INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('be5ca884-1f93-412b-9445-bb3bf690c608','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURrdGNIeWNREAE','google','Owned by a really sweet family, get the pork dumplings and the sesame noodles you won''t be sorry',5,'2020-09-06','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8b6e042c-b52b-4af5-9d27-27a1b9483360','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDNWNQZFBnEAE','google','The specific location leaves a little something to be done desired (little to no outside seating, and it''s not terribly easy to find the first time you hunt for it), but the interior is massive when compared to the Downtown Mall location, and the decor is fantastic.<br><br>However, one doesn''t necessarily go the Marco y Luca''s for the venue, the buns, a sampler of the non-dumpling plates, or one of the wonderful and delectable variety of noodle mountains. (especially the sesame noodles with peanut sauce!)<br><br>No, one goes to a place which is locally known only as "the Dumpling shop / place / store / etc..." for the DUMPLINGS!  And yes, if you haven''t visited in a long time, the dumplings are STILL the very same crispy-on-the-outside, satisfyingly-savory-on-the-inside, one-of-a-kind, world-class experience you remember, lovingly draped in a mantle of mouth-watering, home-made hot sauce; all of which pairs wonderfully with an ice-cold can of Mr. Pibb that provides a perfect sweet to the sauce''s spicy, and paves the way for the signature "Dumpling Belch."<br><br>10/10, must eat!',5,'2020-08-30','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fc0c0458-ae5f-4c75-af76-72e38edb888f','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDOGUzVUJ3EAE','google','Food Is very nice.',5,'2020-08-27','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('868cb7a6-c612-4fa7-ac73-cdfdad64ece9','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDdHQzd0VREAE','google','In one of Charlottesville''s many shopping centers, marco and luco dumplings was easy enough to find. I purchased a combo plate which included a steamed bun, fried dumplings, and chicken curry with rice. The highlight of the whole meal was the fried dumplings and the rich sauce provided. I wish the whole meal was just that. The steamed bun was premade and dried out. The chicken curry was lacking any depth of flavor. For $12 I felt it wasnt a great value when the highlight was the 4-5 bite sized fried dumplings. If I were to go back I would pass on the combo and just get the dumplings.',3,'2020-08-21','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('82ea9a47-1b07-4f61-9de6-42e1269d6073','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDb09PRVpREAE','google','Hard to find location, and the interior decor definitely not what you’d expect from an Asian food place. But the food was spot on. They had a limited menu, but what we got was very delicious. We got the sesame noodles, fried dumplings, combo plate, and veggie bun. All were delicious. Covid procedures also well done. Fairly priced. Would come back',4,'2020-08-07','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0fb09421-ed08-4ef0-95ad-f89f29d2bfa4','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4Z2JiTU1BEAE','google','Delicious food, prepared by someone who clearly cares about quality and cleanliness.  Excellent experience.',5,'2020-07-18','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9f68d458-b56e-42ac-a20d-6b1d4bd6006e','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjb1lYVnZBRRAB','google','They now have veg dumplings!! My (non-veg) family loves the pork ones and both the sesame and spicy noodles are faves with my vegan kiddos (and me!). 5 of us can eat for under $40, which is also pretty remarkable. Great food, family-owned, great service, and affordable- winx4!!',5,'2020-06-12','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
