INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('03ffed74-2912-45f1-8a1e-bbe6c2b28a42','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVM3FhMHd3RRAB','google','Delicious! Fresh! Hot!  Get the combo! $10.50 with drink.',5,'2019-08-24','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e5c3fa2c-84e6-440e-bb34-ea56161016df','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVd3JDZFhREAE','google','Charming little spot with great food at excellent prices! We tried everything on the menu, and an extra order of dumplings, and it came out to $30 and change. Enough food for 3 hungry people to be well fed.<br><br>The owner was also there, and very friendly. We are looking forward to coming back to support them.',5,'2019-08-18','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f1881f04-3566-4dec-85a0-61d046deb17b','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVa0lubG93RRAB','google','Always love their dumplings, and the pricing is good',5,'2019-08-11','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('713f5e01-eb98-406a-a4e6-346001b5ccc6','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVbjR2ckxREAE','google','The cashier was not very friendly and was very disrespectful and sounded aggressive when I did not understand his accent. He also did not treat me like the other customer when she walked up and was more friendly with her. I will never EVER spend another penny at this place again. Lost my business for good.',2,'2019-08-09','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('30ae9757-a32b-467b-9d30-a58a461ff04e','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVeWV5enNBRRAB','google','Love these dumplings.  Not even sure if they have anything else on the menu.',5,'2019-07-27','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3781a2d9-80dc-4c28-87b4-426999dcbaa8','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURrNTdqc3hBRRAB','google','Oh, yes, yes, yes!!!<br>This place is a hidden treasure experience, wish they had one near me!!<br>Limited menu, but so worth it to try everything on the menu.<br>They serve these scrumptious fried dumplings made with minced pork and green onion and seasonings all wrapped up in a crispy fried dough. They also serve steamed pork buns, hot and sour soup, and a combo meal.<br>We had the combo meal, all five of us had the combo.<br>The combo meal includes rice, curry, five dumplings and a steamed pork bun. My advice, go for the combo meal. The curry was what we grew up knowing as curry. Not the blow the back of your head off hot kind everyone seems to prefer these days. A very pleasantly spiced sauce with extremely tender chunks of pork, with onions. Excellent, exceptional, delicious, we are hooked kind of curry!! Love, love, love it! The steamed pork bun - the very best I have ever had- perfectly cooked! Fluffy bread around that comforting barbecued pork you remember from your dim sum eating past. Really fluffy, and completely cooked bread, sigh.<br>I had enough to bring home half for dinner. Oh, except for the dumplings, I ate all of them... should have bought more.',5,'2019-07-10','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9b38e709-0d78-47e7-b742-8293b343e6b3','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURreloyVEdBEAE','google','Best hot & sour soup! Both noodles are excellent as well',5,'2019-07-04','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4eb2c13f-11b0-41c0-8a83-f37b3b0df099','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURraFpQT2VBEAE','google','What an amazing place. Everything 5 of us ordered was way better than we could have ever expected. The special had 5 dumplings, a wonderful serving of curry, and a really outstanding steamed roast pork bun. The dumplings were perfect. And the meal even came with a canned Pepsi product drink. All for only $10.50. Do yourself a favor and give this place a try.',5,'2019-07-01','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
