INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6a0c78b0-4733-466b-a41a-adf878164f0a','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKMXR1WF93RRAB','google','Brunch was amazing! The breakfast sandwich was buttery and delicious! 10/10 highly recommend',5,'2023-07-16','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('77c7aa66-646d-4fbf-aee1-b210e8c73cc6','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKdFpiS3dRRRAB','google','This was great! The food wasn’t anything super super special, but the atmosphere and service were great. It felt old-timey in a perfect way, and our waiter was incredibly friendly. Great spot for right after our UVA tour.',4,'2023-07-12','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('89006a35-f971-4770-9a2d-c51d81aa71c9','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKeElDVjBRRRAB','google','A perfect local spot for a drink.  Great service, great vibe.  Food is hot or miss but worth it for the vibe alone.',4,'2023-07-11','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8c61f1a3-fd04-4c11-9ff7-17f9702de357','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKa003ejlRRRAB','google','Food was excellent, service was warm and friendly. We were being tourists and the restaurant didn''t disappoint.',5,'2023-07-09','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('220bcad4-95cc-451a-b0ab-b01d63599f57','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKNExPRWVREAE','google','Wait staff was friendly and accomadating, we were a group of 7. Very relaxed during summer break for UVA. Go now and order the mac and cheese.',5,'2023-07-09','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3bfa2e72-94a6-43a2-a937-84ce3c1a396d','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKLWNuUGNBEAE','google','Service is absolutely atrocious. They never come back with drink refils. Food is ok.',2,'2023-06-30','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b6324fbf-f3eb-4bd0-91da-fe65e65cac33','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKbHZMU3h3RRAB','google','They food is very good, and the atmosphere may leave you a little claustrophobic during the lunch rush. Food comes out at a reasonable time. I rate this a little lower due to watching the bar tender sneezing on clean glasses and not rehashing them.',3,'2023-06-26','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d6f780ed-56b9-4713-98e5-b0da6eaa183c','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKMnNTMFlBEAE','google','We ended up waiting over an hour and a half in total to be seated and to receive our food! Food was ok but definitely not worth that wait time. I assume the wait staff knew our wait would be long but wouldn''t give us an estimated time. Had I known we would be waiting that long, we would''ve eaten elsewhere.',1,'2023-06-25','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8a815e86-e12a-454d-a08e-6c26d7b5f4ca','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKNnNEd3F3RRAB','google','To die for Mac-n-Cheese!!! That potato cake on top of those twisty, curly cheesy noodles…I can’t even tell you how amazing it tastes when it touches your tongue. Don’t go for the side dish size, go for the entree one! Ok, I did the side dish size with the fried chicken, mashed potatoes and gravy because I didn’t know I should have ordered the entree size of those decadent noodles. Don’t make the same mistake! 😊<br><br>However, the chicken, mashed potatoes and gravy were very good. We also had their Virginian burger with added bacon and a side of fries. Great fresh burger cooked a perfect medium.<br><br>You do feel like you are going back in time while dining in the close quarters. Look at the pictures on the wall so you can image yourself there in the 20’s with a group of friends or family.<br><br>If Allison is still there serving, she does an amazing job! Say “Hi” to her for us! And tip her well! 😉',5,'2023-06-25','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('142bac39-c1d4-4cdb-9b3e-41a31dcc9b11','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKNE4tdTB3RRAB','google','Good food, cool setting, and decor. The music is a little loud, but great choices. Their mac and cheese was wonderful.',4,'2023-06-19','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d80eb73f-28e4-476e-ae04-a72563b4f9f5','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKZ1BTcm13RRAB','google','The best burgers! Great service! It is a nice place, ambiance is what it is, a pub. Not romantic dinner. Did I mention the food was awesome!!',5,'2023-06-18','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('504253a0-0890-4624-9a54-6466840685ad','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4dmJ5N2tRRRAB','google','The wait for our drinks and food was long. I heard the waitresses telling other patrons that they were overwhelmed. I was extremely disappointed with the fried chicken. It was overcooked yet barely warm when I received it. There was also some sort of potato pattie that was  overcooked.  The macaroni and cheese and coleslaw were good.',3,'2023-06-14','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e1f239e5-624c-44d3-9a2c-a3e1066a2ebc','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4Z3B2bjB3RRAB','google','Ya’ll going to love this place “For sure.”.          It is what it is, and it’s good at that, so it gets 5 stars. If you’re looking for fine dining then pass on by, but if you want to feel, smell and taste the flavors of a college joint and Charlottesville then stop and enjoy the experience. We were in Charlottesville for just one night to visit Montecello and checked in early evening. We needed to refuel before we went to bed and headed out in the morning. Didn’t want anything fancy, just good food at a good price. I was checking out all the little cards you find in the hotel lobby with my fellow travelers and came across one for “ The Virginian”. It<br>looked appealing and interesting so I checked it out online. Everyone agreed it<br>looked good so we took a chance and went out to find it. It was only a few minutes away which was also a reason we picked it.<br><br>It is located right across the street from the University of Virginia in an area referred to as “The Corner”.  It has been there since the 1920’s and it looks and feels like it. That’s the type of place I enjoy, venues with history and atmosphere. What the heck, if it’s been around for 100 years they must be doing something right. It is a long narrow joint with a bar and several booths. There’s even one cool booth in the front window that is shaped in an unconventional figuration because of the space , so it fits right into the area. The wood is dark and old like you would expect in a 100 year old joint. It’s a college watering hole but was pretty quite because the spring semester was over. Collectively the ages of all the kids dining and working probably didn’t add up to our<br>foursome of late 60’s and early 70 year<br>olds. 😂<br>We we’re greeted by “Jack” who turned out to be our waiter as well. Jack greeted us with a few “Ya’ll’s” so I asked him where he was from and he said San Francisco. We had a good laugh over that. Jack was a very personable and engaging young man. He is an incoming freshman at UVA and is starting early this summer. It didn’t take him long to acquire a nice smooth Virginia accent. He loved our Boston accents and we hit it<br>off right away. He candidly admitted to us this was his first shift of waiting by himself with out assistance. He faired very well and I think he’ll catch one and be a valued employee. There were a few small things that need correcting with our order and he was quick and accommodating.<br>Our food was well prepared, delicious and hot. Our items varied from a garden salad with grilled chicken to a pulled pork sandwich to a BLT. There were generous portions, fresh ingredients and brought to us quickly. Needless to say there are dozens of beers to choose from as well.<br><br>So if you find yourself in the area of<br>“The Corner” in Charlottesville and even if you’re well past the age of a college freshman, do yourself a favor and stop by “The Virginian” for great food, great beverages and great service. You’ll be glad you did.',5,'2023-06-04','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f90797c5-1428-45c4-a0cc-59b4d4ab45c4','8db61b55-ebac-4928-aa3c-29234f315832','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4LU9xazdnRRAB','google','Historic location with a no-frills menu and simple beer list. Service was uninterested. Worth a stop just to see, but definitely could pick up their game.',3,'2023-06-01','2026-11-12T02:10:36.430Z');
