INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('938dff3f-42df-415e-86b1-a2fb48a4a33c','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaN2JfcDVRRRAB','google','Service good burger bad',4,'2023-10-06','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('47f12170-ae42-4f47-ab4e-a299d00456b0','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNabHJuTXdRRRAB','google','This was my favorite bar in college but my family got treated like absolute garbage when we visited for a football game. We sat at a table that had no marking whatsoever about being reserved. 20 minutes later we were ejected from the table and were told that our complaints weren’t valid because “ma’am this is a college bar.” A bouncer subsequently tried to kick us out for asking for a better explanation. He stated “you were mean to my server.” This was a lie. She was awful to us. They were extremely rude for no reason. The manager (upon request) did help us get another table downstairs but to have 30-60 year olds treated like criminals to have tried to have a nice time in a “college bar” and be treated in this way was awful. I will not return.',1,'2023-09-09','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bb8687ec-ce44-4c6c-8245-523efe26da31','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKLWZPaGNnEAE','google','I stopped by with my buddy for a quick lunch yesterday around noon. The burger and tots were outstanding; both were large portions and very well made and presented. The woman working the bar was really nice and that added to a relaxing experience. Thanks!',5,'2023-07-20','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cae4b264-ef21-4f36-b760-3590263452d7','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKeHRtT0FREAE','google','Food is mid tier at best. But the worst thing about it is the service. Our waitress didn’t even bring us water or check in on us the whole time. And they have a system where they can’t change items on a check even if you didn’t order something? What a joke. Why does this place have 4 stars?',1,'2023-07-15','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
