INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aca00da2-aecf-4a27-a377-392f5c3dcba7','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhczlIMTN3RRAB','google','Built my own burger and it was tasty, service was friendly and attentive.',5,'2021-08-09','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('69a9bae8-e3ca-4823-8b2f-baf670a11412','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNheko2ZFp3EAE','google','Delicious food and excellent service.',5,'2021-07-24','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b868fb2f-4c1f-46e3-896c-4dc2c87232a9','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURxOFliLU1nEAE','google','I have never had a worse dining experience in my entire life. I placed an online order for pick up and instead of being able to walk in, pay for my order and leave, I was verbally harassed by one of the male employees who was trying to antagonize a fight with me because I ignored him and his friends. Let me also take this second to say I was born with birth defects in both of my arms, and from a person with a disability I was humiliated from the moment I entered the door. Being on a date and being late I wanted the food I ordered. I could have easily left but felt I would have been assaulted if I did. I will never return and will be glad to tell everyone I know to avoid this place.<br><br>-A tip to the owners;<br><br>Not only should you provide better customer service training to your staff, you should also consider helping your employees with their low self esteem and lack of care for their well-being. I am not a violent person but the world today is full of them and you should have more respect for people and how you approach them. There is no reason for someone to end up losing everything over a bruised ego. I would like to wish your restaurant the very best of luck but feel a few changes are paramount.',1,'2021-07-12','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e34a2cd4-43a5-43e8-88f1-f4b624f20b62','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURxd09MUDV3RRAB','google','Great meaty burgers, but I prefer Riverside lunch overall for Cville burgers. Had a Room 121 w double beef. Beef ever so slightly dry and/or overcooked for my liking but still great. Curly fries delicious. Huge serving. A few beers and watched the NBA east finals game 1. Waitress was very attentive and friendly. A few times they forgot to put the sound on and had music on instead - i like the idea of putting on music during ad breaks though. Massive big screen and a number of other standard screens.  Great college vibe.',5,'2021-06-24','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('49324b7a-65c1-44db-958a-57094d3dcdce','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNxbV8tNXlBRRAB','google','Good, classic burgers. Also the appetizers are great - we had the nachos. The wait staff is friendly. If you just want lunch I would recommend going for lunch when it is less busy as it turns into more of a bar at night.',5,'2021-06-19','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
