INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('428259cc-1508-4c3c-be30-ac24a8dee34d','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDeDQ3U3hnRRAB','google','Fantastic burgers and fries.',5,'2020-09-05','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2335e4d9-5b9e-43b9-b9c4-88c27f164bcc','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDaUlIa0l3EAE','google','Overall experience was awesome. We tried wahoo for our drinks. Room 121 for our burgers. Curly fries were awesome too. The servers were very friendly and overall distanced tables and the fact that they opened all the walls to ventilate the area was also a plus. During this pandemic I recommend this place because they are doing what they can to keep the people and the area safe. I loved the fact that hand sanitizers were placed in middle so you can always use it. Thank you also Aimee for making awesome experience =)',5,'2020-08-08','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5133b7b6-136c-4b0e-85d5-ffba4d8ed023','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4bmRxN3lnRRAB','google','Food was great, terrible service. Our waitress checked on us literally one time, we never  received silverware or napkins. Also was charged extra for ranch and bbq sauce which my group did not ask for. Would never eat here again.',1,'2020-07-26','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('13d003de-2ec5-4d20-b96a-3f5b018fbf0e','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4LWR1VUJnEAE','google','Fun place with good burgers.',5,'2020-07-21','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7669d9bf-6666-4d8b-be40-d26a70ae6250','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ4aWZYZk5REAE','google','I wavered between 3 and 4 stars, so in the interest of the college theme, I will round up and give them a 4 WITH a disclaimer.<br>This place is what it is: a bar for college kids to get plastered before stumbling back to campus, or the last stop after a bar crawl to try and soak up the booze before calling it a night.<br>On Saturdays, it may also be a place to go watch the Cavaliers get beat up on by Virginia Tech and/or Florida St.<br>In either of those cases, you probably are not TASTING your food, so billing yourself a “gourmet burger bar” is a bit pretentious. This place is a dive bar, through and through, and they should enbrace that. Being a dive bar is NOT a bad thing. The food is priced right, of slightly above-average quality, and (on the Saturday night that I went) the service was friendly, energetic, and attentive. A mad dash of coeds rush from table to booth, and even through the face coverings, you can tell it is done with a smile.<br>Only other note here is that the beers on tap are lacking (there were only three when I went). However, that may be due to COVID.',4,'2020-07-19','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('45885ef8-c241-4eb7-b6ba-a2467a10a048','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjaXJfVVpnEAE','google','Burgers are great—not just beef but veggie + other alternatives too!',5,'2020-06-04','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ff736c13-91f8-45b2-a332-4b46c71b45c4','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjdFplbkN3EAE','google','Sandwiches were great.  This middle aged man could use a glass for his beer rather than a plastic cup.  Definitely a spot to go when restaurants are open.',4,'2020-03-18','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1fa84e8a-10b2-4b84-8fa5-cf2efdae9743','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBOW9iWUlBEAE','google','Molly was so good she even changed the tv so I could watch the game. It was very cool and the food was top notch not kidding. ❤💚💜',5,'2020-02-19','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dc39b20c-e250-49a0-a2be-72cdb3ad5078','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzMjhQWHF3RRAB','google','The impossible burger gets overcooked and isn''t worth the price. I''ve had the burger at a lot of places, most in Charlottesville don''t come near to the creative creations restaurants in other cities make with the burger. Just get it at burger king, it''s actually kind of better there.',2,'2020-02-15','2026-11-12T02:15:26.148Z');
