INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b67eec2f-a863-4b6a-85b9-88dee3c278a3','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0c1IySjRjVVZrUzNKZlFuTlpXV3RrVkc4MFExRRAB','google','Nice chill place 😊',5,'2026-10-12','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('550b23d6-04bf-4e21-b376-dca2d6fa4be1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GbVdtSXhMVkJDVG5wcVkwbHlSRlIwVEhOR1ZXYxAB','google','Great place with decent prices. Plenty of options for food, desserts, and drinks. While there are many whiskey options, there''s a wide variety of beers too. Danielle was very helpful and patient with us trying to decide between all the great choices. Cozy atmosphere and not too loud for conversations. Do not underestimate the fried chicken sandwich dipping in a side of the honey jalapeño sauce - oh my goodness, excellent!!',5,'2026-10-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9da06b92-5fd5-4f2c-8a18-74a0989def28','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKSFExZG5Va3hGVkd0RFZsbFVhbEV0VVZreGQwRRAB','google','Just had a beer.  Live music outside',4,'2026-10-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c68981c1-ed99-43fc-adba-7c206fc0d90d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWclZrVmpZazlNVTNvdGRISmlZazF0VEhOM1RIYxAB','google','Wonderful experience with a live Irish band while enjoying their Octoberfest menu. Bar tender and chef were both top tier.',5,'2026-09-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('332c323f-e611-4100-984f-47153903eaf6','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GalRESm9XVWcxU2xkdFNpMHhlRTV3YURKR1pYYxAB','google','The atmosphere here is great, the location is prime, and the beer was ice-cold. Unfortunately, the rest of the experience missed the mark. Service was lacking, and the food was disappointing—my catfish po''boy was served cold and had very little flavor. There’s so much potential here with the great vibe, but the kitchen and service needs some attention.',3,'2026-09-25','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fc0f1017-04b5-46a4-b5f6-100985b0da4f','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWMVJrcEVTbHBoUkdSd2FXczJZekJ3VTNGRU1XYxAB','google','What a great place.<br>Food was v good but the best thing about the place is the amazing band they have playing outside.<br>Had an absolutely lovely evening',5,'2026-09-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eb6d315b-2b61-4146-83f6-cedafabdc7ab','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kb2EwVTFhMUpMYW5kM1pXRlJWemxQUVVORmFFRRAB','google','The peach cobbler was out of this world! It was so good!',5,'2026-09-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7137e410-d848-4987-bb09-c6978f3998d2','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2trM2RHMXRTM2xyU0ZRNVh6UjNRWGxpWjBjdGNXYxAB','google','Came from DC to Charlottesville on a work trip and had lunch at the Whiskey Jar with my co-worker. This place is a whiskey connoisseur’s happy place. They have an amazing selection of whiskeys. The fried chicken sandwich is probably the best damn chicken sandwich I’ve had, but wait… After a few bites, I poured on some of the jalapeño garlic honey. Maaaan, it took it up a few more notches!<br><br>Now back to the whiskey… They have some private barrel bourbons that you can only get at the Whiskey Pot, so my buddy and I both had a glass of Elijah Craig Barrel Proof 9 yr (Whiskey Jar Private Barrel 2022 -“Caramel”). Amazing. The service at the bar was excellent. I highly recommend this spot if you’re in Charlottesville. 💯 STAMP!',5,'2026-09-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e664c4e7-49d4-435e-814d-734a03d70626','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCVE9GVlVXQzFUUm5aT1ZsUmxkMnh3VGtzMlFsRRAB','google','Got recommendations for this place from the rental car desk and the hotel desk.  Farm to table restaurant. Nice atmosphere. Large whiskey and draft beer selections.  Service was slow beginning when we first walked in the door to ask for a table.  It was slow the entire time.  The bill was incorrect with an extra drink, but they fixed it.  The blackened catfish sandwich was bad.  The fish tasted muddy. My wife had the French dip, and it was good, but nothing special.  There was live music, but the lead singer was not great.',3,'2026-09-15','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f6e33a5f-a628-41d9-9488-3de7d1ca1c93','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CalIweDBZa1YzUlhkSFVEUlpWV0pNYmpkb01rRRAB','google','Service was great! They were super flexible and accommodating with our rowdy group, especially since we arrived late at night. I also wanted to mention that I was looking at a copy of the receipt afterward and realized I had miscalculated the tip. They were incredibly kind and honored the total amount I intended to pay. The final total was $10 more than what I had written on the tip line, but they still charged me the correct amount. I really appreciated their understanding and kindness. Thanks so much!',5,'2026-09-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('018b4b6d-39bc-4533-a0bb-dde70c960167','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5eFlWUlFjVTF3ZUdKSmN5MHdOMWxHV1VKYVpGRRAB','google','We had an amazing lunch/dinner at The Whiskey Jar! 🍽️ Everything was excellent—from the delicious food and great drinks to the wonderful staff. Totally loved the corn bread!!The service was friendly and welcoming, and we truly enjoyed our entire experience. Highly recommend The Whiskey Jar if you’re in Charlottesville!',5,'2026-09-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6f65e5dc-a041-4698-9718-707dc2ff42a0','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVMWNFbDRVV2h6VGpsaU9IVnlVMjFUT1hJek5FRRAB','google','Servers were great. Nice vibe',5,'2026-09-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3084811a-e86f-4951-8dfe-452b02bc31a1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWSGNpMVZWR1pDZG1oM1FucGxXbWt3TVdkUFNIYxAB','google','​On Saturday night, I was denied entry by the taller of two bouncers because of my service animal. After he stated, "I''m not letting you in with that dog," I calmly explained that I have a disability, that he is my service animal, and that we cannot legally be denied entry. He replied, "I''m just gonna say that you drank too much and got belligerent." Denying entry under these circumstances, and threatening to fabricate a reason to bypass accessibility laws, is illegal.<br><br>​Under Title III of the Americans with Disabilities Act (28 CFR § 36.302(c)), places of public accommodation (including bars and nightclubs) must permit service animals in all areas open to patrons. Fabricating, or threatning to fabricate, allegations of intoxication to bypass accessibility requirements—is a direct violation of federal law.',1,'2026-09-12','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('91e7c7c1-09b5-4da2-8514-131ba8796a2d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tjMmVXRkxNMVJHVjJkRVRIbGFRbVpyUmxoa2VsRRAB','google','Clam chowder was thick like gravy. Salmon was really good!  I was looking fwd to my soup, so this was a disappointment. Atmosphere & service were excellent.',5,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('35dce8c7-2265-4b9b-99c8-890e1e5b482b','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OV1ZXbHFhbWRzZURObVpWbDFVMmhFZUdod2ExRRAB','google','Honestly… I was having a decent night until I was asked to leave for no apparent reason. I ordered drinks for the father of the bride, and was told that I was assertive in how I ordered the drinks.<br><br>I didn’t disturb any patrons in my vicinity. It was absurd. We are here tomorrow as well, and none of us will be returning.',1,'2026-08-16','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f77d9450-460c-4ab4-885e-c4e1ef10ac56','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wMVVEQldjek42T1ZwUWNEQlRRazVWWkU1MFVYYxAB','google','Great service and kindness.',5,'2026-08-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9020a425-d89a-4953-8c38-2daeec1005f4','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201alVGVkNka1pOZGt3M1oyTXpTMTlJVFhCT1VFRRAB','google','We drive from NJ to this spot on our way down to Myrtle Beach. Fried chicken & collards are phenomenal. Corn bread has a butter on it thats worth the IG photo. Old fashions are on point!',5,'2026-08-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dcf785bc-92de-4c0a-9d85-907d6a91354b','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poR1FpMXdaVmRyZW1kblRXUjZPWFpaVjNJMGIzYxAB','google','We hosted the afterparty for our wedding at Whiskey Jar and it was the most perfect venue! All of our guests had the best time with the live music inside the bar and the outdoor patio perfect for chatting and catching up with friends! Christy and the entire bar team were so great to work with and it was so easy to set up a bar tab for our guests. The bartenders were attentive and the band gave myself and my groom a shoutout during their set, and it was just the best touch to finish out such an awesome day!',5,'2026-08-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8601cfad-6020-4584-a360-0f473b0164b6','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wb2JWWkZOeTFqTW5SS1YwdE5ZM1E1VFhSMU9FRRAB','google','A good place to eat. Will be back there soon',5,'2026-08-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e6dc17d2-bf60-450a-8350-5b954156e8ad','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xVVZtaGpUemhpVkZaeWVWaEtRVWxqUjNGUmJXYxAB','google','Excellent food and service, had Riley, who was incredible and helpful.  Enjoyed the pulled pork nachos, Riley said the brownie & ice cream was the best on the east coast, she was right, highly recommend, will be back',5,'2026-07-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9cd13a5b-e914-4f1f-9305-427225f4983a','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twdFQycEtSamQ0VTJ4a2QyOW1Sa0pIUkdSck1IYxAB','google','We went to dinner here last night and had a wonderful time! We''ve lived in Charlottesville for about two years now and have always heard of whiskey jar, however we never visited. I did not realize how incredible the food would be! We had the wings with a peach chipotle sauce as well as BBQ mac and cheese. Our entree was the shrimp and grits. For dessert we got the peach cobbler and bread pudding. Every course was delicious and I can''t wait to come back to have some more of their wings. Our server was Thomas and he was wonderful. He was great with recommendations, gave very fast service, and anticipated what we might need before even asking. I could not have asked for a nicer time for the start of restaurant week. Thank you whiskey jar and thank you Thomas!',5,'2026-07-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e9db65b9-d883-40dd-a81e-ee1dd828c523','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4NFpVaDRhR1ZvY1hBeGFqWlZUWHBOWW14RmFHYxAB','google','Mojitos were perfect! Bourbon flights were perfect for my husband. Food was good. Service was good. Sat outside with dog(one of four tables).-accurate on Bring Fido. Easily walkable from Home2Suites hotel. Free outdoor concert downtown too. Only negatives were it seemed as if many stores on Downtown Mall were closed by 5:30pm on a Friday ???????  AND occasional homeless person-scattered through city.  -Also, , a bench near restaurant definitely had some heavy pot smokers lingering-a police presence would’ve been better.',4,'2026-07-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a98ac6cf-60e0-4058-9c18-447396f3ee1b','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCQ2RYZEJlRmxpYjBOT2NXSjNjbEI0UkRaU2VXYxAB','google','Came in with a couple of friends on a Saturday evening and we were seated right away. The ambiance is lively with things on the wall to keep my eyes wandering. Our server was nice and attentive. The reason for the 3 stars is the food, it''s average. I''ll speak to the plates I tried, which were the Po Boy and the Red Snapper plate. Neither of those dishes stood out, where I could taste delight while eating them. I didn''t feel they were made with love, moreso this is what it is. Another friend ordered the rib platter, which the meal was big in size, they could finish it.',3,'2026-07-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('01c36fc7-9b20-4d00-ac40-562f805e8185','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBNFNGOWFZWFZtYkZKWWNGYzBiblpyTkUxbE0xRRAB','google','Enjoyed a fantastic time in The Whiskey Jar, the bar staff were great fun and really knowledgeable about the Whiskies available and the Smoked Strawberry Lavender Old Fashioned cocktail using Old Forester Bourbon was delicious and only $14.<br>Enjoyed a bowl of homemade chicken and dumping soup and the Beef Jar Dip was really lovely.<br>The live music from the band in the evening was great fun too, real toe tapping stuff and plenty of folk were dancing. A really great atmosphere.',5,'2026-07-15','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b96c8e8b-2792-4d35-8c65-bcd7366a627d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aeGVrMTZTMU00T1dveE1IRm9URVJGYWxCb1dFRRAB','google','Delicious and high quality take on southern style food. Extensive drink selection and the monthly specials are wonderful. You can sit outside and people watch or sit inside and marvel at the eclectic decor including Bob the Boar. Friendly and hard working staff who never push you to finish fast and get out. Did I mention the delicious food? Highly recommend the enormous veggie burger. The fries are perfection and the mashed potatoes are divine. The grits have a little kick to them and the fried chicken biscuit was so big you could hardly fit it in your mouth. Don’t miss the cobbler. It’s big enough to share, comes warmed, and has a generous helping of ice cream on top. Anyone can find something they like at this place. Nightly live music is a major bonus and we really enjoyed the Wednesday night regular band.',5,'2026-07-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d4a62450-8bc6-4427-ae51-3556b54266b9','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJNE56WTNUalZyTkZaNWRuTnhkVU5rVnpKV1JXYxAB','google','What a great experience at The Whiskey Bar restaurant, food was amazing drinks for even better. The old Fashions were the best.<br>Deja was a great server!<br>Not to mention  the dessert!! Peach cobbler',5,'2026-07-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('abcf8449-b7f0-49d9-8a4c-66349337e352','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGeFpHMW5hRTExU210NVNHbFNaMG93Y0RnNVNHYxAB','google','Nice local hangout with music.',5,'2026-07-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('58bfa112-c7ac-4dac-b063-f23f4fec8405','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSFozQlRlVmswVkZWVlIwOTRhV3RQU0ZKblpXYxAB','google','Exceptional experience from start to finish. Everyone was super friendly and welcoming, and entire party felt the food and drinks were phenomenal. 100% recommend.',5,'2026-07-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c31602f2-def2-46e8-9a43-8e5df1e438b1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toQmVsZEpUWE5yTVVoSmNtNUhjVzF4ZWpKbE5YYxAB','google','Amazing experience from a very unassuming spot. Food was fantastic, great beer/whiskey/bourbon selection. If nothing else, go for the brown liquor choices. Most comprehensive selection I have ever seen. The quality of the food will shock you if you are a first-time visitor.',5,'2026-07-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('df6fafe5-240f-4f58-830d-a19753b023a9','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sSVFtOHRiakpXUm5aVUxXWTRTRkpWTFZwbFRtYxAB','google','So happy I stopped in, the French dip was killer & Will was wonderful/ super helpful!',5,'2026-07-06','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8d8f5913-d588-49c4-b4ef-183d0fc2573c','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVNFQyWnBWVGgyVFhKTGNsOU5jWGRpWTNSWFNsRRAB','google','Chris, Christina, and Jasmine are all incredible!!! They put me on to new drinks and were super friendly with their service. I recommend everyone bring their friend and have a good drink, this place rocks!',5,'2026-07-05','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5ff89237-bc36-41be-a94e-45f7eaa9e382','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQ1EyTjRiMk53V1dSd2NTMXpaMlpUUm1oeFdsRRAB','google','Charlottesville was a stop over for us on a drive home.  We didn''t know where to go to eat and my son found this place.  It had options for all of us and we loved our food here.',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('32030d6c-7425-460a-bda2-a7b245307e6b','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNd1JuaENNemhRVFhKeFJGODRZM2xYY2tJNVJGRRAB','google','I’ve been to the walking mall twice now and both times I’ve started the evening walking to the Whiskey Jar and ended the night there. Jasmine is phenomenal and besides the food and drinks she recommends, she why we keep going back!',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a4a9aae6-972e-4e26-88c0-245561ecd640','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21NMFJFVnVjamxKUkZkME9WRnlSMFZHV1RSWVpIYxAB','google','Always have an amazing time! Jasmine is extremely welcoming, knowledgeable, and makes the trip worth it each time. Will come back time and time again!',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5fff881e-7583-4ff1-830c-fab03e5f7d23','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21welYxSmljV1pPYzBGdk9UVjNRa0Y0WldOcFNIYxAB','google','I am from Boston and only staying here through Monday but I had the most amazing experience at The Whiskey Jar! Wide selection of whiskey and bourbon, and the food was delicious! All of the staff was super attentive despite being very busy with the 50th anniversary of the Downtown Mall. I hope to make it back at least once more before I fly home. Jasmine was very informative about other things to do around the area and very nice. All of the staff was top notch! Thank you for a very pleasant experience as a first timer in Charlottesville!',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('04ee1051-3c6b-46b2-a259-df7584e799a9','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paNFlrbHZXVTVUY1hGa05WVTFlWGxJWDBaM1ZtYxAB','google','Bar was great. Will be back to try the food!',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e792e851-098d-4cad-bfed-fea71146f742','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFeVptNWxWR1kzVVRSR1FYSTNUM00wT0VOdlpYYxAB','google','Had a great pre show meal!!<br><br>Will was a great server, very attentive, and knowledgeable! Wonderful atmosphere and great drinks!',5,'2026-07-03','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4f6e5237-47e8-432f-8fcb-77dfcd961f29','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCS01XVnJjV2Q1Y0hScVFWZ3lZbWs1WTJseFVrRRAB','google','Absolutely the best spot in Charlottesville, hands down. Fabulous food, wonderful whiskey, stupendous service, and marvelous music. Don’t miss this genuine gem!',5,'2026-07-03','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('263f2027-1e23-4e62-8f95-228214792884','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oWGFEWlFMVEpwYjE5blJXRmxlRmx4TjFKYWMyYxAB','google','Food was terrible   Pork chops were terrible.- taste like cooked in bacon grease. Broccoli salad wth lots of cheese and cranberries with no dressing. No season to chicken and dumpling soup-tasted like  old chicken.  We inquired about what tupe of vhickrn in chicken sandwich and the waiter said not white meat or dark meat. What isit???',1,'2026-06-30','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f11048ab-1e6c-41fa-9e09-2b17243eca59','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xONk1uZHFObkJUZHpZNFQzZzVkRUZsTVZSdE9IYxAB','google','Horrible experience. Drove into town with my disabled father who was hungry. Place an online order which was lost. Waited forever. They forgot two out of fore entrées. Parking is atrocious. Zero out of 10 do not recommend ever.',1,'2026-06-22','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('588135f8-e2c2-47b5-a9d6-64a1393c4e13','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOWmMwTmZkSFIzZVRWcE0wTmZYMnhmU2tSVFZHYxAB','google','Burger Great. Pulled pork good. Ribs burnt and dry. Catfish good. Service excellent.',4,'2026-06-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f8a71814-3bdb-474a-87ef-a2879e326080','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201akxUUkhhVjlJUWtKc2JucFBNemd4WXpKUFlVRRAB','google','The staff here were amazingly kind! I came in with two kids and they were wonderful with getting their food out quickly and being very understanding. My food was also delicious and I will definitely be back',5,'2026-05-23','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf91ed23-0390-4d38-ad67-8aed68f58c1f','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poSFRFVkRNak5UTjFSNmVWcFhkMVJPT1Rkek5rRRAB','google','Cool place.',5,'2026-05-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('afd35383-1743-4ebc-b7fd-fc10d06e7ce1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5M1ZESm9TbE5XTWpKM04yNHhPVTFNVlZOa1pHYxAB','google','An open air restaurant and bar in Charlottesville.   I had the trout, which was excellent,  but be aware it''s served whole.  The cocktails seem well tended as well.',4,'2026-05-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c4588f2a-8ad8-49f5-b593-8f61084456bf','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSV1pXNVlMWFoyVFhaTWExbGlYemRwUW5CblNXYxAB','google','Really good food, great service.  Normal prices for Downtown Mall.  Will return to sample additional items.',5,'2026-05-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8de30153-aab2-4080-a64e-b5246d432d26','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSRFZXNWpPVU5UZGpKYVUyUlVhbXRqUVZGdE0zYxAB','google','It''s on the downtown mall.  Inside and outside seating.  Music and dancing.  Fun!',5,'2026-05-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('738d62da-db5f-4c4b-ac18-396395786bca','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25neGVscHlhMnB5VUMxSmQyVkRhSFJYZDI5cVkzYxAB','google','Really good value for $',4,'2026-05-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('30d6ad2b-06bb-4172-8589-69a84616fdb4','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xSFJEVlRkbWM0UjNaalVEVjFhR2w0TTFWeWNWRRAB','google','food was excellent the wings with the peach was awesome. and the fried green beans were interesting different in a good way. Definitely will be back',5,'2026-05-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1ed14d44-2606-4f47-a2f8-4ffaee4df786','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pablpGZGpaMnBzU0hGbk1HdFFjVUZTVXpkYVlWRRAB','google','Kris the bartender was a phenomenal host. Super welcoming, kind and knowledgeable about the expansive whiskey program. Saturday afternoon had an amazing irish jam going on with accordion/fiddle/mandolin/amazing. Top 20 all time.',5,'2026-05-02','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d075277-4277-4951-ba7c-90d396b7fbfd','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKMU0yaEZUVzlETFVGdU5qQlZiSEJ2TVVNelQzYxAB','google','Everything we tried was amazing! So many yummy flavors. I loved the shrimp and grits…so much flavor in every bite!',5,'2026-04-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('87f16b71-d081-46b0-a851-7b0d80e2ec51','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OVmMwOVZOM0JGWlV4eU56YzJkR2t6TlVsVkxYYxAB','google','When we''re in the mood for whiskey, we come here. Lots of variety and great specials on Virginia made whiskey. Good place to sit down at the bar or outside when the weather is nice and have a couple drinks.',5,'2026-04-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ed284976-30f5-44ae-90f1-be632efcd8ea','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2todVgwWkRZUzEwTkRBdE56bDZXRE5hUzBGS1duYxAB','google','Drinks were great. Food was delicious. Vibe was on point. I think they only had 2 servers for the whole place and it was packed so service was rather slow but it worked out.',5,'2026-04-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('786cba96-d34c-44da-ac01-3c0bacfcb86d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25BdFYzVkVRbW80ZFhOVVEwWTBkakJ2U0MxbFVHYxAB','google','We stumbled upon this adorable restaurant as we strolled through the downtown mall and it exceeded our expectations! You feel welcome as soon as you walk through the door with the friendly staff and decorative lighting. They had live music playing which made our experience even more enjoyable. We started off with an appetizer of fried green beans that was AMAZING! My husband and I both ordered burgers which were very good and made us so full. We did leave some room for dessert which fulfilled every craving that we had! If we find ourselves in Charlottesville again, we will be back to this place!',5,'2026-04-02','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c1317c2f-2e75-438e-835c-03bca89a2511','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGcFJVNDJOSFZaVUdsa1JHTTViemhwZDFSWmNYYxAB','google','The last few times I''ve visited the Whiskey Jar have been wonderful. But they have been more late night. There was great live music, and a very good selection of whiskey to choose from, if you''re so inclined for something more top shelf. Service is always prompt at the bar even on busy nights.',5,'2026-04-02','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c91b4283-541c-4a66-a83c-51a31b99d9a3','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOVFFXcExVRFJmUlZoT2VuQTNVVEZrT0RGVlJGRRAB','google','Food was excellent but we had a pretty lackluster experience with the service. We went around 5pm and it took forever for food and service. I watched the waitress serve and check on several other tables more than once before she came back to ours. Again, food was amazing but not sure it was worth being there over an hour before we get food and our check during a time where they only had a handful of tables.',4,'2026-03-31','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('85d6296b-5cc7-49ff-80d1-a1d3636322f7','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxak5XeEJiRjlPUlhsMmVWRnhSVGhxY1hGTlFrRRAB','google','We loved this place. Simple small menu for food but endless drinks.',5,'2026-03-31','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3ac22f71-c9ed-4c64-9697-078401dc4ffb','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4NVpscHZZWGx0TWxaRldVZGFSMHgwVFZOc1MxRRAB','google','I must''ve been there on an off night, based on everyone else''s reviews. We were sat quickly, but then immediately ignored for at least 15 minutes before greeted by the waitstaff. Then we waited quite a while again before our orders were taken (this whole time no water was brought to the table). For entertainment, we watched the waitstaff of the restaurant during this time. There was little to no visible organization to approach, with staff going hither and yon with little to no results in serving the patrons of the restaurant. Whatever was going on in the "staff only" room in the back must''ve been amazing, because the staff spent as much time in there as they did on the floor of the restaurant. Multiple guests from other tables had to directly approach staff members to get their food, drinks, and/or checks.<br><br>If it wasn''t for the youngest member on staff busting his backside to run food from the kitchen, seat guests, bus tables, and wrap silverware... I''m fairly certain nothing would''ve been accomplished in the operation of the front of house of the restaurant.<br><br>I can''t really blame the staff only, it was fairly obvious there was a breakdown in basic operating systems that should have been implemented in the restaurant, but obviously were not. That falls on management and training, plain and simple.',2,'2026-03-31','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d7e7e10d-a62b-4a27-882b-cdb6f477060a','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOTFdUaGZiRU5HZDBwV1ZXMUVhMXBUZEZCR1owRRAB','google','Faith and begorra, what a find! If ye be lookin’ for a pot o’ gold at the end of the rainbow, ye’ve found it right here at the Whiskey Jar.<br>Our clan stopped in for a feast, and let me tell ye, the spread was enough to make any sprite skip with joy. We filled our bellies with the pork and Mac and cheese, a basket o'' fries crisp enough to rattle a pooka, and plates of biscuits, hush puppies, and kid chicken fingers that vanished faster than a disappearing glen. And the bread pudding? ''Twas a sweet treasure indeed!<br>But the real magic wasn''t just in the kitchen. The service and the vibe were the true enchantments. Every soul workin'' there was as kind and helpful as a friendly brownie, makin'' us feel right at home. To top off the evening, we had live music by the bard that had us tap-tapping our heels to the rhythm.<br>Five stars for a legendary night! I’d trade me last gold coin for another visit.',5,'2026-03-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b2dc6a4a-3b22-4f93-a79f-05e3d9deaeeb','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCblNYbHJkbkZMUzNoS1UzaDBTUzFvZGxKRlEzYxAB','google','Stop by for a couple drinks and apps<br><br>First, I ordered an Irish drop shot, they actually knew what it was. Along with an old fashioned.<br><br>Both drinks were made perfectly. And served as they should be.<br><br>I ordered the collards, cornbread, and grits. The collards were perfect and need nothing. Same with the grits. The only downside of my visit was the cornbread. Stand alone. The cornbread is great. But it does not need the caramel that they put on top of it.<br><br>Wait staff was amazing. And honestly, other than the caramel and the cornbread there is no complaint whatsoever',5,'2026-03-20','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0c1ec430-4594-40b6-98cb-faf1ece3c8bd','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCNWJXTlpibk5YVVZGTFdERkhlRU16TkVGNFRuYxAB','google','Great place to hang with co workers',5,'2026-03-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ad6786ca-409d-47fd-8730-00276a71e2f9','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GbVNVODFjVUpxY0RKTlowdG1RMDlUUTFSWVFYYxAB','google','Had a good and fast dinner here. I had the chicken and dumpling soup, while my husband enjoyed the burger. We split the (amazingly huge) bread pudding for dessert, which was a bit disappointing, and cold in the middle.',4,'2026-02-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9a5fd068-f627-40e4-923e-af703543c41c','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Ga1QxOXRXR2RPUW1walUxSlhkM1Z3TkRrM1FrRRAB','google','Fantastic food, attentive service.<br><br>It''s four, not five stars because I was a little disappointed that the server didn''t inform us he had auto''d our party. There were six of us on a single check, so the sever was within his rights to auto, but when you do that, you have a responsibility to inform the customer.<br><br>Food was extraordinary, though. Excellent shrimp and grits, perfectly cooked catfish, tasty gumbo. Whiskey sour was also on point, perfect balance of sour and whiskey. Beer selection is okay, cocktails are better.',4,'2026-02-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1e9ba888-50f9-401c-be8e-6e94929c3810','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CR1dIRTJibFZuZEhJMmJ6QmpRek5mWmxCalYxRRAB','google','My partner reached out to Chris and Christina at the Whiskey Jar to see if there was a way to make a proposal happen at our favorite bar in town, and they absolutely knocked it out of the park! Their kindness and joy at helping him execute was incredible, and they managed to make a beautiful private space feel like its own world, even on a busy weekend night. They even went so far as to help us clean up and hold our extra items overnight so we didn''t have to worry about it. They also both got rave reviews from a good friend who made sure everything was set up in time. Whiskey Jar will forever be our favorite spot in town to stop in and celebrate!',5,'2026-02-22','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0ce5cf05-0245-4d71-aae2-5722a25c048c','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paQ1gyWTFOMUpNVWpGc2FEWlhVVFp5YkZkeE5WRRAB','google','Fun time!',4,'2026-02-15','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aae9696c-70fe-48e4-9aa4-337c0dd9f2a7','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WU01VMU5ZM0J6Y2s1SWN6Sk9SbmRKUW5KUFYxRRAB','google','I''ve lived in Charlottesville for nearly five years and have been to The Whiskey Jar a handful of times. It never disappoints. Excellent cocktail menu, always excellent service and good food. Whenever I have out-of-town guests, I make sure they get the local flavor and Whiskey Jar is always on the itinerary.',5,'2026-01-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4556b236-971c-496c-9d09-ba5cf7498d2f','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sRGJTMTRiRk5UZFdkMk1HSkhhVkV0YzI5UFFYYxAB','google','We went here for the live music. Special shout out to Matthew O''Donnell for the invigorating energy and amazing music. Spent hours in the place just for the music. Its mind blowing how many instruments he played! Its ljke a magician who gets out a different instrument every two minutes.<br><br>Unexpectedly, the food was also quite nice. The vegetarian burger might feel slightly dry, but less so than most other american burgers. The hummus and veggies were great and healthy. Although, I wonder from the huge size of the veggies whether they are gmo. The hummus tho has a brilliant taste!<br><br>Moreover, one of the most lively place in the downtown. Love it!',5,'2026-01-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1591b3a9-8909-49dc-b00d-74b9ed921f53','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SRVNYZDNTMkZEU210RE9VaFJRa3MzYlRoMGIxRRAB','google','Overall great experience. Would highly recommend the smoked buffalo wings.',5,'2026-01-03','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e6cae042-3fe8-4927-93db-4d6592e151fd','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JMGNWQnpVeTFaYzFkc1EzYzVObGxVVVVWdGVIYxAB','google','Very cool vibe! Plus it has fantastic BBQ, amazing whiskey and craft beer choices and great service. Will definitely go back!',5,'2025-12-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('272a9067-6486-4791-87a9-1e4dcb7bba40','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psdloydE1lREpzUW1GbldWYzFkMjh4UTJsWVlrRRAB','google','We got the bbq nachos which were delicious and the fries and broccoli slaw were also really good. Oyster po boy was huge. Tried a few seasonal drinks all were very tasty. 10/10 no complaints',5,'2025-12-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e6416681-a241-46a8-ae1f-3f5f8fff9144','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkalZ6SmplVWMxY2xoWldtdFlPWGRYZDJwcWFXYxAB','google','Bartenders were extremely attentive and knowledgeable. Drinks were delicious. No notes.',5,'2025-12-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bdbc242a-2c21-4dfe-a896-e1dab0027f21','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSUlRucEZjbGxpTm0xWU5FMTZjbWwzZFhwbFpuYxAB','google','Cornbread to die for',5,'2025-12-25','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1b092fe4-064b-435c-b84c-9bf998588a99','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kWE5tMVJkMjVKYlZOc1dHRTVlbVJZVTFaU2RsRRAB','google','I was just passing through and might never make it back, but I would sure like to. Funky atmosphere, great food, and excellent drinks. I was with a large group and everyone just loved it.',5,'2025-12-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b7e0782e-94c0-40cb-aaa2-d3900253f336','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oUGJtZHROMDVTV0VScVJHdFZjR3d5YkZWRFpHYxAB','google','I’ve been here before to go to the bar and enjoy live music, but didn’t realize they had an entire robust menu! On top of that, the food is excellent!<br><br>Got the beet salad and it was very good! Going to try the chicken sandwich next and will update if I do.',4,'2025-12-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dcaa0af6-164e-4df9-96f6-e13f5d989c15','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKaVdWTkRWbXRzY1VoSlYyTkRVV3h2WldJME1FRRAB','google','Dining at The Whiskey Jar was an experience that left a lasting impression. From the moment of arrival, the welcoming atmosphere set the tone for a wonderful meal. The staff provided excellent service, attentive without being intrusive, friendly, and eager to ensure everything was perfect. Their genuine hospitality made the visit feel relaxed and personal, which is rare in many restaurants today.<br><br>The real highlight, however, was the food. The menu showcased Southern-inspired flavors with a modern touch, and every bite delivered. The catfish sandwich stood out among the offerings it was perfectly cooked, lightly crisp on the outside, and tender within. The seasoning was on point, allowing the natural flavor of the catfish to shine through, complemented by fresh toppings and a soft, toasted bun. The side dishes were equally impressive, especially the fries, which were golden and perfectly salted.<br><br>The overall dining experience felt both comfortable and elevated a blend of casual charm and culinary quality. The Whiskey Jar is the kind of place that invites you to linger a little longer, savoring the balance of good service, excellent food, and genuine Southern warmth. It’s definitely a spot worth revisiting.',5,'2025-12-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dd1e0d5b-4a71-4aab-af7b-a7e20bb62aab','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KVFlqRkZkMms1WmtFemREYzVTa2RtUjNvNVYyYxAB','google','I absolutely love this place!! The bartenders were amazing. My wife and I were celebrating our 2 year anniversary and they gave us a complimentary first round! I had the smoked old fashioned and my wife had smoked apple mule and both were wonderful. My wife had the chicken sandwich with fries and it was so dam good lol I had the cheeseburger salad woth goat cheese ranch and it was simple but tasted wonderful. So many selections of burbon/whisky, scotch, and beer! The bathrooms were clean aswell as the restaurant. They have outside seating and there open late which it kinda turns into a little club vibe. I highly recommend to stop at this restaurant every time your at the downtown mall.',5,'2025-12-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ae49667e-77b8-468e-a8bf-c232d2bffecd','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kelIwczVkMDV1VUdaV1dUWkZVMkpWTldnM2VVRRAB','google','My wife and I loved this place. They make great drinks and it''s a fun atmosphere. A lot going on! Bartenders are awesome as well.',5,'2025-12-02','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('51498090-53a0-447b-8ac6-68cc807bc0ba','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taRlN6VXRWR2hmTmpGS2NrbEthRGxSVDNKQ2EyYxAB','google','Great college town restaurant! Good service!',4,'2025-11-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cef7d04a-5fee-414b-81cb-d108569de96d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pneFlubG9NWFV5VkVKbFZWUlNkSEpJZG5aRFdFRRAB','google','Fun, busy, place,',5,'2025-11-12','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cb59b9c6-e619-4a7b-bae2-ae2ea88e6cd3','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tReVlsbFdMVkZKYlhBeVpGVlplbnAwYkVaQ2FIYxAB','google','This place was amazing. The food was delicious and the drink selection is unmatched!',5,'2025-11-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('767b2691-2018-44f0-ba33-6cf0bd7b804f','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZMlltWnJXbFZGVVhkdGR6bFhiak5wYmxod2MyYxAB','google','Food was good ish service was stellar and bread pudding was amazing.',3,'2025-11-06','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0c264fc4-47c8-4ef7-b989-2b584d40e9ad','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SamVWTmZObVJpY25CbU9GOUpjMHhvZUZwaWEyYxAB','google','Had dinner here on a Saturday night while visiting Charlottesville and it was great. I sat at the bar and the bartenders were friendly and attentive. My appetizer was delayed but they comped a drink for me as a courtesy which I appreciated. The food was awesome.',5,'2025-10-29','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e8ffed4f-b048-402c-adbb-2ab5a60ac339','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tRNVUwdFJiVTQxVEhCTE5XTlNVVXRhYXpaWE9GRRAB','google','First time there. Great food and service!',4,'2025-10-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('89de36c1-237b-438d-9eba-1396d10abaab','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWb2FHRm5jMHBSVDBGZk1ESndiWGxITUZoUVFtYxAB','google','Saw some incredibly unprofessional behavior on the part of the Whiskey Jar staff on Friday night, October 24. The bouncer denied a young blonde woman entry, then held her ID over her head like a game of monkey in the middle. He then tossed the ID onto the downtown mall and very violently pushed the young lady into the street. Classless people who hit women. Won’t be coming back again.',1,'2025-10-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a59650d4-387a-4fa0-9c07-9799d6784e2e','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWWWRYaEZjbkZuU1VrM2VGWnpTVWRVTkVSV1VXYxAB','google','Great selection of all kinds of whiskeys and tap beer, including many from Virginia. Live music often.',5,'2025-10-23','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('404deea9-2340-4749-8412-c7b36dff919d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSMlVVSnlXazh6YWxGMFgwNDNNREZzU0ZOUE9WRRAB','google','Cocktails and whiskey selection is always creative and unique! Bartenders were so kind and accommodating. Always have live music and great vibes.',5,'2025-10-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('13f46b8d-9636-493d-b48d-bf9b2909bc15','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tocFZIVk9jV1IzTldGR1NtSlNjMHBRVVUxUlUxRRAB','google','Had lunch here today, my wife had the Ruben and I had the grilled catfish dinner entree, both were AMAZING!  Great flavor, plentiful.  They also have an impressive whiskey and liquor menu!',5,'2025-10-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ddbda593-bc8b-4f8e-b39e-5b19e8c9a53f','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaMkxMNDV3RRAB','google','Fun spot that has a lot of good whisky; but you''ll pay for it. Some of their rare whiskys are too expensive.<br><br>The food is great! I recommend the pork chop! It was cooked perfectly and was delicious. The atmosphere is awesome too. The live music is really fun!',5,'2025-10-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4c2d8365-fd93-4677-8387-5bbcf4bad0af','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OVldFeDFTREZEZEdoWVQzbFdka3R5V1RkVWRrRRAB','google','Get there for happy hour 😎🤘',5,'2025-10-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8ea2e419-cb82-4ce3-9d16-66a2b0988c92','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WUxVaGxRbFl5UzNjMlRsVkhSV3RSVFY5a1NuYxAB','google','Excellent food, service, atmosphere, and bourbon selection.',5,'2025-10-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3e3bf665-c465-4e83-bb64-16f64133d751','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoblZGVkVXSFF4Vm5Oc2NGbG1VbGhVTjJodFdrRRAB','google','I went there to experience a late night out with a family member and turned out to be a great idea as we enjoyed Blackberry margaritas and the sound of a live jazz band at this restaurant.  The waitress was very kind and did a great job making sure our glasses were full. The food was hot, I had smoked wings. The Wings were a bit dry however the sauce was a good compliment.  I look forward to coming and trying more food options.',4,'2025-10-07','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2eacad21-ae1d-4f51-9ed2-17c12f595878','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsU1dYUmlkekJQWjBReWVsUlVVMGhaTlRGMk1GRRAB','google','Hamburger was good just not 5 starts good.  Band was playing,  service was good and atmosphere was friendly.',5,'2025-10-01','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cfef37d8-5180-4302-8764-8d2a093922ca','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTWVrMVBUelZGUVd4R05YZzFOVmRhUlUxdE9IYxAB','google','Really good crispy chicken sandwich. Quick and nice service.',5,'2025-09-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eb0982fa-099c-415f-9bbe-8573a36f24af','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GcE5VZFVWV2MwZUVseVNsVkRVMFZUZG1nMU4wRRAB','google','Highly recommend Campfire Old Fashioned! The smell of scent from fire processing + marshmallow',5,'2025-09-22','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0a5158ae-3e90-4ad4-86e8-6af6e91c7e3a','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OWmIyaEhOREpDU2t0Tll6bHhSVkkyUWkxdVJVRRAB','google','We sat outside the shrimp and grits was excellent the burger was definitely rare but it was delicious service outside was a little on the slow end I kept on getting overlooked but where one failed another would come in and saw that I was needed attention great place great atmosphere',5,'2025-09-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cfff28c2-65d2-4b33-8c2e-f7c286d17d8b','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5RmF6SlFhbmhQVWtGWk1XeEhOVTQwV0ZrNWRWRRAB','google','Food was delicious.  Live music.  Comfortable atmosphere of a classic bar.',5,'2025-09-18','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d6cb6c50-75ad-4730-85d4-8151e0fe9f92','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSaE5pYjdBRRAB','google','If it''s on the menu it''s delicious',5,'2025-09-18','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('149ee2cd-fe41-4e23-899f-c6f6a815d7fa','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOMWFWZERTalJLYnpoR1ptWTFSMlJhVTFOdWRFRRAB','google','I really hate this place because of the music they play..... late at night..... when I''m trying to sleep.',1,'2025-09-18','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2898f16d-081e-4cf8-b7be-ccbac88da1c6','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1bU9WaElaSFV3V0VKcFpXMTBiR0pQUTFCdFMzYxAB','google','Loved the vibe!   Staff was attentive and friendly.',5,'2025-09-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ee011608-41af-460d-93b0-cba5b6cd777a','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxNmVXMHhRV2cyV0hoMk9GSnZlRkZSWVVkRmIxRRAB','google','Second time to go, first time getting food. Don''t order the barbecue and I think you will be okay. Good service and atmosphere and other items I tried were fine, but the ribs were terrible, pulled pork and sausage were meh. I will go back, just won''t order that anymore.',3,'2025-09-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2a443091-3869-4e1b-82d7-7c3685cbb93e','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0UVdGVjNZWEZuUm1sNlZtaEdNbVpNVkVvM1UwRRAB','google','Nice whiskeys. Some very drunk clientele',4,'2025-09-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('359856b8-2dee-43b0-a31f-f6d09e4803f6','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214WWJHaGlPV3B2Vld3ME16QlFOakJWTnpSc2VrRRAB','google','Nice spot.  Good food.',5,'2025-08-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('30343920-a4b0-4e74-bad3-c38857dc9264','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4VVIyTkdhM2hmTlVsNWFEUk9NRUV3TFY5bVdsRRAB','google','Monday night live music was excellent, unfortunately the fried oysters were looking good, but mostly just bread lacking oyster. The first cocktail on the menu the classic old fashioned was served underboard and I ordered a beer and almost forgot that I ordered one because it took so long to receive it. Order the beer before the food but received it after. Hopefully they can fix these issues.',2,'2025-08-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9005b5bf-8574-4e2d-9217-546227d20a5a','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnd2JuZDVkemMyZG1sa1UwUjJUMnh5V0cwdFNsRRAB','google','The bourbon selection is pretty fantastic at the whiskey jar and the staff were great. We stopped in on the way through town and had a few local brews and had some dinner. On a recommendation from the server, I got the BLT and it was unquestionably the best one I’ve ever had. The kids had grilled cheese and they were also raving about it. We had to wait about 25 minutes to get a seat outside, but that’s probably because we showed up around 6pm on a Friday night. I’ll definitely stop here the next time I’m in Charlottesville.',5,'2025-08-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6e905cf3-6040-4826-811f-4390d16dbe46','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25NelVGVXdVRTV3VFdkcFQyOUlWR1ZtVEZCV2FIYxAB','google','Good experience with attentive staff and decent food - nothing to write home about. The Wilson sandwich was tasty and the  house salad was good (w/ shrimp). The drink were a bit strong for my taste.',4,'2025-08-08','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f408e44d-b761-4086-afd9-15de95cbe7f8','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25VM00yNXVlSEZKWkdGemJFNTRiMGxVTnkxRlNWRRAB','google','Nice place to chill with friends n family',5,'2025-08-05','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('46736ab0-1911-44a7-93df-576e1769953c','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twVFpGRjVSbVJFTUZCT09GaElNa2sxTlhSVk0yYxAB','google','Absolutely stunning stop in the Historic Downtown Mall showcasing local cuisine and delicious cocktails. I can’t ever go to Charlottesville without stopping!',5,'2025-08-02','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9412d86d-ccf2-4995-ace1-c2c7d095cd04','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeGRXeGFSVWR0U0ZCT2VqSnZSR2h6VEVkUFUxRRAB','google','Fun place and loads of ambiance!!',5,'2025-07-29','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d81f4a5c-64da-4c6c-8312-b835930635ba','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jMmFVcFBWbFZTZG5oWE1EUnBlV3Q1YWxKeVRVRRAB','google','The ambiance is solid but the drinks are somewhat poor.',3,'2025-07-20','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf6c8563-2614-46d5-9440-43669b9aa5fd','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVNVpWQkJlRlYwYUVWMGRVWTVWWFUxWW5GbFQwRRAB','google','Fantastic beer, bourbon and whiskey list.<br>Locally sourced farm to table menu.<br>Pam, the bartender....very attentive service. You should definitely stop there when you''re in the neighborhood. We just happened to be at UVA and needed a treat after.',4,'2025-07-17','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a2bed015-0d62-449c-ab3b-6f8f8ba0496c','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KMllWazNURmhaY1daT1YyTkVOME15WXkxd1VtYxAB','google','Good food, good beer, great atmosphere… and a kick ass band tonight!',5,'2025-07-10','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5b7797f3-c66c-4365-97fd-4b500bb8b917','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WbWJrODBaV1F5VHpORWR6aFRSbU5PZFVSSlFtYxAB','google','Shrimp and grits were great.  The "Wilson" chicken sandwich had just enough spice to notice.  Very good service.',5,'2025-07-01','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f3fa060e-cba0-4be3-aeb6-40c4781db5f4','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4eExUaGpjREJMZGkxb1dWYzJWWGcxU1ZkeVNIYxAB','google','When you close your restaurant for a private party on a Saturday put it on your website…',1,'2025-06-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b5df0d2d-1009-429e-951b-5a8f177b852d','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toU1prTkZVWHB4UjJNd1EwWjJhRkJUZFZwV1FVRRAB','google','Planned a special trip with friends… got caught in a thunder storm walking to the restaurant… only to be told they are closed for a private party. This was not on their website or facebook page. When I mentioned to the person that they should post this to make other customer aware, he shrugged his shoulders and shut the door. First and last attempt to visit this place. 👎🏼',1,'2025-06-28','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d6090b4f-159d-45dd-9a56-5b267c0a7c82','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twdFl6TjRkV1JaYzJSME4wMVdjelZVYkRaaVIwRRAB','google','Absolutely delectable collard greens, fried chicken, fried oysters and more. Left fat and happy!',5,'2025-06-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('99369629-d4ba-40fb-8506-58d79d0cfba5','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTWRWRlpVbHBFTms4NWRtc3hiemw1VEROTE1sRRAB','google','Live music, friendly atmosphere, whiskey sampling and delicious pub food. Their whiskey menu is extensive.',5,'2025-06-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('674c5be3-2f85-4155-a5fc-f7c1d53aaaa2','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGdVdVdFRUREJ3UkZGYVgxTkdTVzVGVW5GWmJFRRAB','google','This place was amazing and the staff were super nice. Keep in mind it’s a casual dive bar vibe.<br>Was served super quick even though the place was packed.<br>Fun fact about the place is their live music. I was blown by the talent.<br>Highly recommend if you’re in town and want to vibe.',4,'2025-06-24','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4f164e9c-358e-4cec-b2ed-8d6d7891fd67','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVNVVUbFJZM1JhTURkME9XVnRWM0pSUVZSbWRWRRAB','google','Manager called me back and fixed the billing situation.  I am very happy they responded to my google review.',3,'2025-06-21','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d9e93a53-d54b-411f-83e0-68dd21fa0892','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaaVZtTXRVVEZVUkcxVlVFNTRTMmxzV0dSRUxXYxAB','google','I can highly recommend the Whiskey Jar Julep is made of very fresh ingredients  at the bar. The meat is not a poor quality cut but actual good quality and the sides are all good. Staff remembers faces despite the busy atmosphere. Drinks and food can be found cheaper but not for the exceptional quality of the well made food and drink.',4,'2025-06-19','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('35fd4e94-f486-498a-8de7-a7fd9ce4bfa1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5c05XZzFhemRCT0RGdFltTkZUM1pWUzFGQlZWRRAB','google','Eddie with security was great!',4,'2025-06-15','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('87464059-49f6-430c-b102-713e62d7ad81','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oT1NqUnJTR2xoZWs5eWRWRmZZMlIwWDFWQmMxRRAB','google','We sat on the sidewalk and enjoyed the good times with everyone.  We shared a great feta salad and pork chop and broccoli  meals.  Plus a couple of good beers added to our experiences.  A great band playing an exceptional set of music made everyone at the bar and the downtown mall enjoy the evening.  ENJOY THIS PLACE!',5,'2025-06-14','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e23c5b8b-61ae-4472-9151-b51e53f5b2e8','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pVNU0wZzFMV2huYmw5eWVqQjFhbVJzT1hsRmFHYxAB','google','Best variety of whiskey in cville',5,'2025-06-07','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('56e0a1b2-57b0-4a8c-a065-3722ed8052c4','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VMejRfSmJHdk9TNXNBRRAB','google','Our server this evening, Deja, went above and beyond to give us a great experience at the Whiskey Jar. She quickly helped us move out of the rain before we got really wet. She fixed a minor error when one meal was slightly different than expected. She was very busy but managed to give us cheerful attention when needed. The food and drink were excellent but it was her service that made it a evening to remember. Thank you.',5,'2025-06-07','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b8172d68-095a-4f06-b746-4d4bc9177fa3','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2LU0yOXdRRRAB','google','Our "go-to" place for lunch when we are in Charlottesville.',5,'2025-06-05','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6dbcd502-e80d-4670-9823-a7d7ec173ec0','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VMaVk3N21tNGJQRm1RRRAB','google','Unfortunately, our visit to The Whiskey Jar was disappointing from start to finish. The service was inattentive — we had to ask the waitress twice and the hostess once just to get our visibly dirty table cleaned. The waitress never checked in on us after taking our order.<br><br>The food didn’t redeem the experience. The chicken was dry, and the collard greens lacked flavor. The country fried pork chop was underwhelming, with bland mashed potatoes and overly soft mac & cheese. I also witnessed the table next to us dealing with multiple drink order mistakes.<br><br>The outdoor dining area was unpleasant, made worse by a homeless man sleeping nearby — not the restaurant’s fault, but it added to an already uncomfortable atmosphere.<br><br>Check my other reviews — I’m generally very positive, but this experience fell far below expectations. I hope management takes feedback seriously and makes improvements. Do better.',1,'2025-06-03','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4b863bed-e55b-4886-86f1-38085ca8db31','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKWExvSXE4bmFLNzNBRRAB','google','Caveat Emptor: came for the celebrated fried oysters and whiskey sour, they were top notch, and our server Christopher B. fast and professional, but my credit card went missing (and was used at a local McDonald''s the next day) after I accidentally left it in the check folder at our patio table out front. Bummer; reported to Cville police. Otherwise fast, pro service, plenty of leafy patio seating. A downtown gem, but do keep your wits about you!',5,'2025-05-31','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a4a63124-d1d4-49d3-b7ca-344f02a1baea','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VNS3B5X1BzaXNIb0NnEAE','google','Great food great vibe huge whiskey selection awesome staff would recommend all to give it a try !',5,'2025-05-29','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('37eeb13c-5e37-4569-8d4e-08ba2caac841','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhOUpXRGZnEAE','google','Great space. Good whiskey. Superb staff because they know their whiskey, they are efficient, kind and friendly.',5,'2025-05-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7d9d6a4f-f019-43a8-8a00-dcfae0bb068e','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VNcWpqNzd4Z3FXaENnEAE','google','Great burger!',5,'2025-05-23','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ffa07314-36aa-4f5f-aa7f-e20f46c24a55','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJbi01OUxFbGNMX3ZnRRAB','google','We hit happy hour and it was great. Really enjoyed the bourbon and vodka drink. Missed the music but look forward fo going back. Bartenders were great. Friendly and really knowledgeable about the big selection of bourbons/whiskeys.',5,'2025-05-13','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4347b83d-cf2d-4338-a802-b6f26a399850','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VOSG1vdkNSaE1TbUxnEAE','google','Always a good place for a drink in downtown Charlottesville. We stopped by for one drink after dinner and ended up having two! They had a 2 man band from Waynesboro who played nicely.',5,'2025-05-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1adc1502-131e-4a75-8938-3f4ec0cff5fb','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VMSEFnb2JaczdmNzVBRRAB','google','I went with a friend for lunch. The decor was authentic and made the place charming.<br>I took the rack ribs with french fries and salad. The meat was really tender with a barbecue sauce. Absolutely loved it.',5,'2025-05-09','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('619c0059-a2ca-47a4-a939-50ec58159df3','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQX2NpTGlVcnYzUm53RRAB','google','One of the top five Old Fashioneds I’ve ever had and some amazing fried oysters.',5,'2025-05-08','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('23892186-aed6-40fd-ac7f-50f6dd6e0b08','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIMmQyMGpnRRAB','google','I reviewed this place 7 months ago and it hasn''t changed after giving it another try recently.<br><br>This is the second visit in 7 days, and neither of them was mind-blowing. I had not planned on reviewing this spot since it is a local favorite. After the experience tonight I wanted to put my two cents in.<br><br>To begin, the drinks are great, as is the environment. There was a local group playing some music tonight, which I have heard before, and they are entertaining. No issues there. It was nice to see the folks dancing and having a good time. The drink selection is great too. I am writing this based on several visits and not a single visit.<br><br>The not-so-great. These last two times I have received glassware that was chipped and broken. Not a huge deal to some and I''ve been in food service before. I know first hand how this can become a big deal to some folks. I was honestly perturbed by the fact that it happened twice in a row. Sounds dumb, but I was not inspecting my glassware thoroughly when it was brought in; I did not notice that it was broken until I was already drinking from the glass. The first time I brought it up, the young man was very apologetic. This second time, the waiter (a different person) was sort of nonchalant and uncaring.<br><br>The food is mediocre and salty. I had a burger the first time that was made incorrectly. I notified the young man, who was apologetic but never came back with the condiments I requested. He didn''t come back for a good 40 minutes, to be honest and I had decided to just eat my burger and go home by that time. This time I had the fried chicken. I won''t make that mistake again hahaha. There was a breast and two other pieces which were unrecognizable because they were burnt and dried up. The breast was moist inside but the breading, potatoes, and gravy were all extremely salty.<br><br>I enjoyed my drink so I will just stay away from the food next time. Overall, my impression is that the location and live music is what makes the place great. definitely not the food nor the service. I want to say it was a one-off, but through the 3 or 4 past experiences, the service was never more than "ok".',2,'2025-04-29','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5271c760-c523-4749-9bb8-6e74cfe0c024','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvcGRDdl9nRRAB','google','Well, we tried. Heard about this place since we moved here and finally made the time to drive over and give it a try. That mistake won’t happen again. Horrible experience from start to walking out. We walked in and got sat right away as we missed the dinner rush by a little time, the waiter finally arrived at the table and we placed our order…never seen him again until about 30-45 minutes after we were sat. He comes up and says they had a new food runner and some miscommunication caused a delay and the food would be right out. Another 15-20 minutes later and still nothing. Wife goes to hostess station and asked for a manager and we were told there is no manager there and no one to talk to. Waiter meets her at station and then says that they are making our meal right now. We will not be returning when the service is that bad, also will tell everyone to avoid that place. If you are a member of the Bourbon Society or an avid enthusiast, I’d also recommend avoiding the place. The pours are heavily over priced from what I’ve seen around the country. #avoidatallcosts',1,'2025-04-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0dd7e5e1-574c-49a2-9d85-2edcf4b03af1','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURveFk3S0lREAE','google','Atmosphere was pretty cool, but the food and service was terrible. Also the drinks are mid',1,'2025-04-26','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eecca907-d4a1-44e7-8b48-116bb45dc322','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJcFlUTVl3EAE','google','Disappointing experience at the Whiskey Jar. We arrived just before noon to no host at the front and staff hanging out by the bar. When we asked if they were open, the bartender replied dismissively and told us to seat ourselves. After a long wait, we were served a dish that was supposed to be a grilled whole trout—but it wasn’t grilled, wasn’t hot, and definitely wasn’t whole. Mediocre food and poor service.',3,'2025-04-11','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5a50fc12-31df-451c-9d8f-59b4dadad396','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJbUtIT0x3EAE','google','The restaurant is so cute and the food is amazing! I absolutely love the cornbread and have to get it every time. I’m also a huge fan of the blackened catfish. This past time I got the oyster poboy with the broccoli salad and both of those were so good.',5,'2025-04-06','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2c0dac73-08a0-4481-887c-1ac3671eb2c6','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJN2V6OEhBEAE','google','Got the bbq 3 meat platter. The ribs were dry and old, the pulled pork was cold and the smoked sausage was average at best. Honestly, the fries were the best thing in my plate. The bourbon/whiskey selection was really good though. The bbq needs some work.',2,'2025-04-04','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9e0fcde6-e78b-472a-bc88-6a27c27eb106','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJOEp1eVFnEAE','google','Bar Manager could really teach his staff how to clean. Bar smells awful every time we go in there. No telling the last time this place got a deep clean. Would hate to see what the kitchen looks like.',1,'2025-03-29','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2274ca30-13b8-4610-a0ea-442bb77ad791','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3MWJ1S0lBEAE','google','I’ve been to The Whisky Jar restaurant twice now, and both times were absolutely amazing! The atmosphere is warm and inviting, the service is top-notch, and the food is consistently delicious. Highly recommend for anyone looking for a memorable dining experience.',5,'2025-03-27','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ce35ed72-3417-43ce-9647-9287904eb7e7','476dfdb1-6f8c-4e52-950d-172696b8659a','google:ChRDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3NnI1bBAB','google','Early afternoon drinks, great service, wonderful  drinks, tasty burgers, and delicious French fries!',5,'2025-03-25','2026-11-12T02:15:27.030Z');
