INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('00750d71-2c3f-4f54-a2a3-7c449cb2b66b','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzNGM3bUJ3EAE','google','Extraordinary!!',5,'2020-02-04','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ecb46326-0d27-4560-9e31-0878f4ffb5dc','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzeXVHU1ZBEAE','google','Food was good.  Everyone in my lunch party enjoyed their food, and we all ordered different things.  Ambiance and location is fun.  Work staff were great and the service was fast even when busy.  Four stars because the food was good, but not necessarily a place where the food was something I was eagerly excited to tell my neighbors about.',4,'2020-01-28','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('46130f99-aa96-44e0-ab24-fa4c44cbc483','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzbElpLXJnRRAB','google','Awesome awesome place!!!',5,'2020-01-23','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c2db5f64-3d0e-4250-8f1e-62d1b11f5134','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzbVB6UXdRRRAB','google','I really like this place but honestly I kind of just get the same two things when I go. The loaded potato soup gets me every time. I also like the student combo, which i typically just get with the tomato soup with a grilled cheese. It’s incredibly classic and ordinary but still quite delightful. The location is also very cute too, I must add, and I like their selection of drinks. Local virginian kombucha and ginger beer almost drive me to bankruptcy.<br><br>The only fault with this place is that I think that people are way too slow. Not the workers......the customers. I only have a 30 minute break for lunch and it drives me nuts sometimes when I have to wait in line for a good ten minutes because the lady in front of me can’t figure out what is going on. This isn’t a complaint about the restaurant really, mostly just on white women (and this is coming from a white woman..) However, if Rev got another square and had two registers it may just help the process along quicker.<br><br>Good soup, good serve. Nice bread.',5,'2020-01-20','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eef90c95-9e88-44a7-9e70-46a257ea246a','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzNE1DVk5nEAE','google','I think that they expanded their menu recently. They have a lot of options for bowls. I''ll have to get back in there and try one. Last time I went for soup.',5,'2020-01-18','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e06dc779-3846-4e98-8b11-7a6e3d7ee29a','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNbC1yaDNRRRAB','google','They definitely know how to run a restaurant cause it''s very fast even when it''s packed and employees are kind and helpful. Buddha bowl is good, lots of fresh arugula, curried lamb soup is amazing and the apple butter and goat cheese sandwich is so goooood. Even brownies are great. Definitely a good bet if you''re short on time but want to eat quality food.',5,'2020-01-14','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e369dcad-f30f-4c91-a791-debac58366e7','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNM2JpZXhRRRAB','google','Great soup & quesadillas. Friend liked the budda bowl.',5,'2020-01-09','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a7491f90-f1b0-49b4-a701-6bcbbb3f1203','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNemZXckNnEAE','google','Great place to get some soup, not super fancy but not a dump, just a great little hangout spot. Sandwiches are good too, and the people are really friendly.',5,'2020-01-08','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1affe963-3f58-45e0-a980-269ae42f8514','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNemFiY0ZBEAE','google','I love you Rev. Amazing vegan options',5,'2020-01-07','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('beedc552-7be8-450c-9cd3-eec00dd2f8c0','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNcGZuTWZREAE','google','Excellent soup and service!',5,'2020-01-06','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('45ec2a8e-93bb-4dbe-b943-68f2beb306de','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNLW9hclpBEAE','google','This place is a classic. Everything is delicious. You kinda can''t go wrong. Last time we were there we had the potato bacon soup and it was amazing.',5,'2019-12-27','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('92e0c7b6-d05b-4555-b25e-44973c14f354','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNMHB6TXl3RRAB','google','Soooooooo goooood! Grateful we stumbled across this hidden gem.',5,'2019-12-24','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ec845860-9350-4f7e-9ac8-273a5b937469','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNeUs3b0p3EAE','google','Rev Soup is a Cville icon. We had them cater our wedding last fall, which was brilliantly done (our friends still bring up "that soup at your wedding"). We go to Rev Soup frequently, and it''s consistently delicious, even as their menu has changed over time. They have a lot of local ingredients and their menu reflects some seasonality, which is cool. If you''ve never had the Spicy Peanut Tofu soup, your life is incomplete.',5,'2019-12-14','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bc080414-e1b7-4800-b9ac-95b37981d3d1','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNc05pNWdRRRAB','google','I''ve heard others rave about this place. To me it was just average soup and sandwich. I''d probably only go back if I was with someone that really wanted to go there.',3,'2019-12-13','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6da31bb3-1337-4740-bddd-c68a6f9b7da0','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNbV91Ny1nRRAB','google','Good food, not expensive at all',5,'2019-12-07','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2a322a93-bc2e-4042-ba94-faedef587358','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNNDRxdHBnRRAB','google','Always amazing flavors!',5,'2019-12-03','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f9fa94ab-2cd4-4cd7-9ac8-dbefda566c45','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNNLVpTRjJBRRAB','google','A laid back, uber casual place that has delicious soups, sandwiches, and salads. Staff will always let you sample a soup. Vegetarian options are clearly marked. And their potato-rosemary soup is one of the yummiest things in all of Charlottesville. Recite a poem by heart from their ''poet of the month'' and you''ll get a discount on your meal. How cool is that!',5,'2019-11-27','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('678263b5-4f3f-4114-a15f-acbdcf264448','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwOWZqWGNBEAE','google','My first visit I had admittedly high expectations due to hearing from every angle how good it is. Unfortunately, my experience was left well short of those expectations. I''ll start out by saying that the soup I got WAS incredible. The Corn and Crab chowder was not lacking in either corn or crab amd it was served piping hot, with a (rather stale) roll. They were however out of Tomato Soup and the Spicy Chicken Tortilla which I personally was keen to try. My sandwich came out looking spectacular, loaded with chicken, bacon, and chipotle mayo. Unfortunately, it waited on the consolidators counter for nearly 10 minutes while they failed to put together the simple Greek salad my girlfriend had ordered. After a reminder, they quickly threw together the salad, and when I returned to my seat i quickly realized there was no feta or olives on this Greek salad, which for those of you reading who know, are pretty much the main ingredient to a Greek. So returning to the counter for probably the 4th or 5th time, I asked for olives and feta and was told they were totally out of olives. Despite this being a minor detai, it should still be mentioned at the time of ordering.<br><br>In summary:<br>Food Quality - 4<br>Food Availability - 2<br>Service - 3',3,'2019-11-14','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fbc71e41-4a68-40ad-b01c-e468fbed7b06','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwMnFQNGxRRRAB','google','Every time we remember to take the kids to Rev Soup I wish we went more often. Everything is delicious and it''s an easy place to stay and eat or for takeout.',5,'2019-11-09','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7039acfa-cc20-4aee-8c3e-5ccaf4828372','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwbXBULU9BEAE','google','Great soups and sandwiches!',5,'2019-11-01','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('93a7fc17-f189-478a-93c5-03cbf63e9dfc','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwa3E2TlJ3EAE','google','Great food and atmosphere!',5,'2019-10-29','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d4989f94-23a2-4c6e-acbe-9c157d66b835','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwdEsyakVBEAE','google','Stopped by after the Virginia Film Festival. We shared Tomato Basil Bisque and Chicken & Andouille Sausage Soup.. Both Yummy!! Thanks.',5,'2019-10-25','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c3b24b37-8a7d-4763-993e-4d759559171a','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwMk5uMVp3EAE','google','Great soup and fun ambience.',4,'2019-10-21','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('14930d54-1415-467a-91c9-d3b6c0bf543e','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMwNGJmY0xBEAE','google','Locally run, locally sourced foods from what I saw. Great service and friendly laid back environment. But pricey but that''s what happens w local sourcing. I''d rather pay more and support local!<br><br>Want to give four stars bc I got a chicken sandwich that tasted boiled, flavorless, and was chewy. Not ideal for a $8 sandwich. But otherwise, really great. They''re all home made soups!',5,'2019-09-29','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('998b050e-edea-48fd-80bb-fa0f5db2e7aa','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMwaEo2cVVBEAE','google','Delish',5,'2019-09-14','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20295e18-f33b-4987-abd3-573ef926db29','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVeTVmVTZRRRAB','google','Love the soup and sandwiches! Have options for everyone whether they’re vegan, vegetarian, or neither. Only thing restricting me from giving them 5 stars is that everything they serve is in dishes that get thrown in the trash. A lot of people eat in but they still don’t serve the soup/salad/sandwiches in washable dish ware.',4,'2019-09-04','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6c857612-e848-40e9-b133-e4c067f9fd22','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURVNFpmeWZREAE','google','Outstanding soup, nice atmosphere! I had the lamb curry and played a game of checkers at the table. Would highly recommend! The bottled beer selection is surprisingly good as well.',5,'2019-08-26','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8b487abe-340f-499b-931d-775fdfe6de64','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVMzRMNzJnRRAB','google','Really good.',5,'2019-08-09','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5bd42694-72a0-4ebf-9a57-73fe6e3bafcc','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVdVlHaGZBEAE','google','Seems a bit overpriced for what you get. The two acquaintances I was with loved it though. Lemon and chicken soup and potato soup were on point. Grilled cheese and ham-not so much. Fast and friendly and they have Coke in a glass bottle!',4,'2019-07-29','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0c7ab8cc-3ab7-45e7-96f9-6f2ec060b17d','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVcVppc1h3EAE','google','Wonderful soups, salads and sandwiches, and a strong commitment to local foods.',5,'2019-07-28','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1029ec24-b34a-4b78-a6dd-7351bada6b44','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVMXNQZzN3RRAB','google','The food is incredible. They have a great variety of options, even for special dietary needs. I loved the fact that most everything on the menu is not what you would normally find at a deli!<br><br>With the increased quality of food comes an increased price. They don''t skimp on the ingredients so don''t expect a "cheap" meal, but I would definitely lean towards the fact that the food is worth what you pay.',4,'2019-07-23','2026-11-12T02:15:29.082Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('28dc6187-3ad7-4a45-8716-cfebb621572b','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSMmMyVXpSR1J6U0dkMGQxSlFiVmhGVlRGVE1uYxAB','google','We had Borani Bademjan, Qabuli Palow, and Sultani kabab and all of them were great and flavorful. Staff was very friendly and helpful. We will definitely be back soon.',5,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('25f2c7d7-b513-4b23-8d77-c905abc6be75','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Wc05VZGhRbVY1Tm5WVE5GRnZZWGRNWXpsRVlWRRAB','google','AVOID!<br><br>I can’t believe the high rating of this place. Their food was stale, service was terrible, we didn’t get some of items that we ordered. We had to go and fetch utensils and an extra chair ourselves bc the server didn’t bring even though we asked multiple times.',1,'2026-10-25','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5f7ca3f1-b777-4d67-bed4-1c4d2a20ca93','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0YVdGbFZkV3RWUWtReVFrdHNVR2wxTlRGR2EyYxAB','google','Terribly bad!! All the reviews are probably fake. We went there for dinner and the food was dated, definitely lunch leftover!<br>The service was horrible!! It couldn’t get worse. They ignored almost every request we had.',1,'2026-10-25','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bdf36f55-eca4-471b-9cd7-638bef0885c6','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25RNWVrWkNXRVpmUzJwUlNFVk5USFE0T0RWSE4xRRAB','google','Do not go to this place<br>I think all the reviews are fake!<br>We came here on a Saturday night, ordered a couple of dishes<br>The service was so bad that we didn’t even get 3 of the dishes<br>The barg kebab was so hard that I am 100% sure it was left over from their lunch',1,'2026-10-25','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d22f658c-6b28-4bde-9303-d65ad1f7e374','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWTk1rbzVlbk5DUld4Wk9HczRia2xNZEVwSVRWRRAB','google','The lamb chops are pretty delicious here on top of seasoned rice. They serve a side salad and bread with your meal. We also got the kubideh and steak and the steak was delicious but the kubideh was just okay.',4,'2026-10-24','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f4fcfee4-1580-4e95-9ecd-d0c365612661','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201blVVVnZiV0U0ZW10VFZrbHdRbmhyVVU5WWQyYxAB','google','We went for the lunch buffet and everything was delicious! Service exceptional, and ambience very conducive to the full experience of enjoying an extensive selection of freshly cooked Afghan cuisine.',5,'2026-10-18','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c7aab3cd-edd0-40d1-a02a-8d515cca5164','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGek5GZHJPUzAyY0ZkaVVUTXRVMEphTW5kRU5rRRAB','google','Food is hearty. Atmosphere is homey.  Meat and rice yum.',4,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('686945d4-3bcb-484d-af42-3eb8668d23a9','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT204dFNqVm9kbE00T1c1RVNHOHdPRlJWYUdGbFRFRRAB','google','The girl who serves inside is so sweet and sympathetic ❤️',5,'2026-10-07','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d126fe7f-6b95-4b54-b2d0-b5aa0198a331','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZM2JFWldkRjh5YjFCdlRscDBXWFF4VDI1WlluYxAB','google','It’s a hidden gem, highly recommended for catering.',5,'2026-10-04','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dc0b47a6-b41f-4a35-bf55-ce03633189bb','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGNk5VVjRMV3RKZEVOS1VuTmpXVEZLTVV4VWFIYxAB','google','The food was fantastic - so rich and flavorful! Portions were quite generous. Service was quick and friendly. So glad I stumbled across this little gem of a place when I was passing through Charlottesville!',5,'2026-09-28','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4bc34da5-20f2-4444-ad15-e14704d30fe9','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KblNtNHpaSGhMZURVNFFqaHdhVUptZUUxVGJGRRAB','google','Nice place with tasty Afghan food. We’ve tried the buffet option. It was tasty and filling :)',5,'2026-09-26','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3b1294c0-a207-43f0-adf0-7526eb3c8ad1','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCT2FHbDVObUZQV1ZZNFZESlZlVkkzTFhkaVNsRRAB','google','We were looking for a place as we passed through Charlottesville and ran into this one. What a magical spot! The food was fun and plentiful and the service was some of the best I''ve ever had! The kebabs are a little spicy for kids, but the vegetables, rice, and salad were incredible, and the chai and baklava were a perfect ending to the feast. I recommend getting one of the family style meals.',5,'2026-09-26','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3ea5c97a-c908-4e8c-9488-29d42824cf08','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNMlYzRnJhM1ZsU2pocmFUZHRlRWRrY0RGeGQxRRAB','google','Fantastic place! Fantastic food! Live music on Friday night!',5,'2026-09-25','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('171424d7-f57a-442f-90bf-de4f94ce3de8','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kamRYQnNjMjFvYmxsaVpIQmtNemhmWlRaRE4yYxAB','google','Very great food, and very nice people working☺️',5,'2026-09-22','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fd140d3f-e861-4461-8a62-c6653dd3da39','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGTVQzTndORFpQVUY5SFJYQnZkRWh2UzNWSE1tYxAB','google','Absolutely delicious, got dinner for two and everything tasted great. Recommend this place to all',5,'2026-09-22','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('81db4f26-5846-42aa-a66e-e2ffe975db39','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25rMGRHbzNaMUJoVW1wTGMyTnhaM0pCWjFWM09XYxAB','google','Delicious food and friendly service! Would recommend',5,'2026-09-10','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aee40676-d5bf-40df-885e-5763aac9cc05','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twc01TMW9Xa3hTTUU5YVdGb3liazlNWWxGaWVGRRAB','google','افغان کباب زندہ باد',5,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7ffa653c-9418-41a0-85bf-09d4d633c939','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4MWMzZGxaVWxwYTNwck1VODRTVkp1Y1Radk5rRRAB','google','Delicious meal here September 4. Chicken kebab with rice and side of chickpeas was very flavorful. Wife had vegetarian medley with chickpeas, potatoes, rice. Just great flavors all around. Server was very knowledgeable and helpful.',5,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d246fa1-8fcd-4ff2-8a9e-cf4e6b491739','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poVmNsazBZekpqZERCMWJHbElXa3RQV1d4TlMwRRAB','google','We visited on a Tuesday evening and the food was terrible. The kabob was ridiculously dry and the bread appallingly stale. I have worked in restaurants and I would be deeply embarrassed to send this out. My best guess is that they are serving left overs from the day or two before. Perhaps it is fresh food on the weekends and the fact that they served this bad food to customers says something about their character.<br><br>The Atmosphere is stark. Bright white LED lights with a flicker in the dining area. It was clinical and harsh.<br><br>I will never visit again and I will discourage all I know from visiting.',1,'2026-09-03','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1399d238-4eba-4539-b975-735a036dde96','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25FeVIybDBlSEpQYjJOdlFsaEJVUzFMWWxOZmNrRRAB','google','This place was fantastic! The lamb and chicken combo on rice absolutely floored me. The service and ambience on top of it made it a wonderful experience. Would easily recommend this spot to anyone looking for good Afghan food👍',5,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('15e45398-b563-4b4d-a476-ce6f0d78924a','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xveGFESnVhWGhGVlVKNFF6SXRjVWRrU201dFZsRRAB','google','This was good. Chicken was seasoned well and cooked well enough. It does not come with any sauces though, so that was slightly disappointing. But, food was good.',4,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T02:15:30.152Z');
