INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d1820686-0363-4d23-b52c-435d27338f19','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxdmVqZDFObk5vV1RGbGJYbHlNa0UwTm5RNWRYYxAB','google','Jay was an amazing server! Wish I lived near by sfo i could come back more often! Great energy!',5,'2026-11-06','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bcc09dfa-7856-4cdf-bd6b-054e09006f69','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMmFXWlRkbEZKUlhWT04zWldZMjFPV1UwNFYxRRAB','google','Taylor was the best server I’ve ever had in my life. Genuinely she is so personable and awesome. Ask for her!!!!',5,'2025-08-24','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('59f8b3b8-c2a1-4dfd-8b47-6153128e54b1','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toQmRIaEpaWEprZG10elRIRTJYMVJXT1U1UE5rRRAB','google','Plan well in advance if going during main dining times. We waited for close to an hour and a half, even with joint the wait-list before getting there. The food options are plenty. The food came out nice and hot. Everyone said their food was great. Will stop again when back in town.',4,'2026-11-06','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f23ee533-223c-4c67-b502-49713b39e102','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOVWJsWkhhbXhxWVdWa1JUVlJiV2xRZW1OUmVtYxAB','google','Our server Taylor was just wonderful! So attentive and had the most radiant, positive energy! Will definitely be returning.',5,'2025-08-24','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3b71286a-339f-4729-a4ea-1c56dbd05c1a','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWFVXTjJORU0xWDJkblRYWndZa3hSUVMxdE9IYxAB','google','Was seated at our table, took forever to be greeted. Once our server finally came over, she rushed us to order. I understand it was busy, but we were there to enjoy ourselves. Instead it made us feel like an inconvenience. I think she said her name was Dara, or I misunderstood Sara? Tall, red hair, boots.  When we got our food, it was ok at best. Then she didn’t check back on us a long time. Forgot drinks we ordered as well. Really disappointed because our friends said they loved this place.',1,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9c697156-c9dd-465e-8457-14a79d6d5f57','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNelZGQkZObmhUYW5kV2FWTjNlR2RDTVVoNGNXYxAB','google','Sehr gut',5,'2025-08-16','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6bae8c58-5ef6-4abe-8e82-c0e43b3d0144','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21keUxUUm9ZV3BaVFZKWGRXMWtUVGROU1ZoME9IYxAB','google','Went for my first time a couple days ago, had a blast! Our server Sierra was so great, and Manager Kody was perfect!',5,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1cc495d3-faf7-4a2f-b3a1-89ff910f4f94','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKV1RWWkVNVkpTU21wdVZtSnpVbGx0U0RKdWVIYxAB','google','Charlottesville is lucky to have a dining establishment like Bizou! I''m a local and this is a spot we go to at least once a month. Outside dining offers great Al'' Fresco dining. Inside has a unique old-world that passes the vibe check, no cringe. The menu updates seasonally and always offers a few great new dishes.<br><br>We went for restaurant week because I''m always curious how quality is during these higher volume times. Bizou knocked it out of the park. Great portion sizes, balanced meals with texture, and amazing service. They didn''t cut any corners with Restaurant Week and seemed to go even harder to provide a great experience.<br><br>Some of the reviews are a little hard on the service; I have a different perception. When you come to Charlottesville, become part of the community while you''re here and you''ll have a fuller experience. Actually engage with the people around you - connect with them as people and listen to their stories. One of our servers shared his excitement to be going to Northwestern in the fall to study Engineering. For free, we got to see and feel his excitement about the future. Did my water glass sit empty for a little bit longer than if I were at a fancy-dancy restaurant, maybe - but I''m also a camel and drink way too much water so I can''t fault them. Regardless, I don''t really care because I got something out of the experience that was truly beautiful.',5,'2025-08-06','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9e408130-f584-449b-b5b8-1065d747fc09','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsSFRqbGpZV0p3U2tSRE4xZG9VVlJsYmxGRmVrRRAB','google','Watch out, the cashier will add a 20% tip before you can respond to the reader. Gaslighting ensues.',2,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2ca3ec29-54d6-4f1e-985f-35fb61d4c888','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xrM1pXWXlkRzl3VUhGVmMyWktSRlpXVVdrM2FGRRAB','google','Food is fantastic. Wine list is complete. Only comment is to take a day with the staff on the wines & proper serving temps. Beautiful bottle of 2022 Chablis came out slightly under room temp. Had to ice it down to bring it to its glory.<br><br>Was genuinely great otherwise. Just take the time to educate the super star staff on the wine.',4,'2025-07-30','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('caaa014f-c866-492c-83eb-a71c100eceaf','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOWGJIQkZOa05zY0Y5clVIQjJkVW80VjFGRlRIYxAB','google','Erica the server was AWESOME!',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('61e12eee-b484-4380-aa3b-dcfeca2f6709','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT200NGRsWk5TalZsZVRWeGNFWjBiVEozWDFGNFRYYxAB','google','Average food not worth $60',2,'2025-07-28','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5be8cf79-602a-4cf4-9e82-7aef2920f87c','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WVZGbDBaV2hHYVMxaWJGOWtWR1EzY25Rd1UwRRAB','google','Fantastic food, selection,  and service. Service is fast, friendly, and accurate. For those with hearing problems, be careful, it is always very loud.',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6a64a768-8d9c-4585-b838-57d13ad79103','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaclMwVm1SekZmU2tOYWFGZE1XRWhvYVZvd1QwRRAB','google','My wife and I enjoyed a terrific restaurant week menu and sat at the bar, where Oscar made terrific drinks and even better conversation. Will definitely return during our next trip to Charlottesville!',5,'2025-07-21','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e250675e-86a3-43cd-9184-b1cabde4cc12','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kWlUwRmZhbXhKT0ZOdmVUWmlZMVp2TjNaamRsRRAB','google','Fantastic variety on the breakfast and lunch menu.  Roast beef with havarti was incredible with horseradish sauce.<br><br>The vegetable soup was exceptional.<br><br>Service was quick and accurate.<br><br>A little noisey but very acceptable.',5,'2026-10-10','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('27f32e4e-1f61-4953-9a77-c64f2ebf430f','f9271bc9-2e71-4a9c-b363-52741ee273c8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Kc1dXZFFNbmM1YW1kYVdtWm5SekZTU25nM2IwRRAB','google','Eggplant was horrible!  Overcooked, greasy, unable to eat.  Should never have been served.  I ate a few bites of the so-so side salad but did not ask for another meal  as the one served to me so terrible.  When paying the bill I asked for my meal to be removed.  Manager that I never saw refused.  Waitress advised they will only fix something else from the menu. No apologies, nothing to make me ever go back.',1,'2025-07-17','2026-11-12T15:33:54.883Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bd3dc5cb-7131-4cda-a5d2-947d55bc286f','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCME9XeERVMGxHVmtGc2MwdDVhbDlEU0VSVmVsRRAB','google','Served dirty dishes, coffee was not good and our server rarely came back but ill give her a a pass as it was busy. The food was cold when it got to our table. Just overall not a great exp.',2,'2026-10-06','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('99807917-7346-45f9-867a-806a3261aef9','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0MllrUnJibGxEYTBWVlZFNHlOekpmWjFneE4xRRAB','google','Erica behind the bar is wonderful!',4,'2026-09-30','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0ddacbcf-55dd-4a40-b8b3-2fe8d4be29ba','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsVlIxRjFaWFUyVVVOWFRuQXdkemxGV0VoSFFtYxAB','google','At breakfast this morning, I ordered the trifecta and was told after being brought part of my order that the waffle maker wasn’t turned on like they thought. The waitress was very kind and reassured me it would be out shortly. She checked on us multiple times and the manager even came over and reassured us. They both were very kind and made our breakfast worth while.',5,'2026-09-30','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bcae4446-bfec-48c2-8ee3-94f035e4c5a8','ac247f38-5015-470b-a380-2fa7f4479d24','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbE1tOVBhbGxzZFVwNU1WRjBkVFZxWms5a1NGRRAB','google','This was our first time at first watch. I was there with my wife on a trip to Charlottesville Virginia. We enjoyed a tasty breakfast with good service. Highly recommend it.',5,'2026-09-23','2026-11-12T15:33:54.953Z');
