INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('06d9d75f-a183-4a5a-b50e-1ba9a5f2d320','994f1573-8b85-462d-82d1-6a786fa42c27','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwekxXaG1hMWxvZVZOQ05HUm9kRTFuVVdaemFGRRAB','google','unfriendliest service possible. ruins the whole experience.',1,'2026-05-06','2026-11-12T15:33:56.336Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c5623127-91a2-487d-9400-7f2f6971bef2','994f1573-8b85-462d-82d1-6a786fa42c27','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213eVYweEtNUzF0VldZd1kySjRhRmxPYW5SMWVFRRAB','google','I’ve lived here for two years and LOVED THIS BAR. However, one of the blonde girl bartenders just came to the second floor and reprimanded us. She told us we were wrong for going to another bar to get a drink. HOWEVER, we were sitting for ten minutes without service. I’d think again before yelling at patron. I understand the service industry is difficult, but there is no reason to yell at a customer.',1,'2026-03-15','2026-11-12T15:33:56.336Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3fdef9af-8ca5-44df-82f6-167170eaed88','994f1573-8b85-462d-82d1-6a786fa42c27','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21FdFRWbGlNRU5oVlZkelgyWkJkWEJQYkZSaVNYYxAB','google','Came here for drinks as we ambled down the mall. Decent service for a Friday night, not great but good.<br><br>They have a terrific whiskey and bourbon selection. Good beer choices as well.<br><br>They have mocktails that were good.<br><br>Great decor and atmosphere, old timey feel to it.<br><br>Would definitely return.',5,'2026-03-07','2026-11-12T15:33:56.336Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dd3a477b-ff56-48ef-b947-888f3f98feb8','994f1573-8b85-462d-82d1-6a786fa42c27','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201VlNtWjJRa3hNZUhKNE5VTklhM1F5WjFkRlNYYxAB','google','If I could rate zero Stars. I would. We walked in around 5:15 on a Saturday. We sat at the bar. We were there for about 5 minutes and nobody greeted us. There were only two other people at the bar and the bartender was busy chatting with them.<br>We left without ever being acknowledged. The Whiskey Jar was great.',1,'2026-03-05','2026-11-12T15:33:56.336Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bc71b2f8-be9d-47c6-8b13-8605b593a0cd','994f1573-8b85-462d-82d1-6a786fa42c27','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OQmNFRnhVR2hxWDJKbVdFOVlTbTl5Wm5rMVpsRRAB','google','My name is Brittany Morgan. My 15-year-old son,is a dedicated baritone saxophonist as well as tenor and alto who has played since the sixth grade and is now in his freshmen year of high school. He currently performs with his high school’s performance, concert, and jazz bands, participates in marching band and the Orange Community Band, and recently earned first chair for baritone sax in the District 13 (that’s includes 10 counties )concert band for the second consecutive year.<br><br>We visited on Sunday nights, January 11th and 18th, specifically because of Mr. Dearth’s reputation as an educator and advocate for aspiring musicians. While my son had a wonderful experience with the welcoming band members on the 11th, our experience this past Sunday was deeply disappointing.<br><br>Mr. Dearth was not present and unengaged for most of the night wondering in and out of the bar. After playing several songs, Adam was publicly addressed by Mr. Dearth from the stage. Mr. Dearth stated that participants "have to know what they are doing to be up here," specifically telling my son, "By the way, I meant that for you," before walking out of the bar.<br><br>This public shaming of a young musician was unprofessional and unnecessary. My son has worked incredibly hard on his craft, and this interaction has been More likely completely discouraging. There were many constructive ways to offer feedback or clarify participation expectations, but choose to publicly embarrass a student does not reflect a commitment to the musical community or the youth.<br><br>Despite traveling from a neighboring county to support the Charlottesville music scene, we no longer feel welcome and will not be returning and Mr.Dearth has made I clear that we are not up to his or Millers standards.',1,'2026-01-19','2026-11-12T15:33:56.336Z');
