INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d0f08ac-864d-405b-bceb-113bd1e27ccd','8a680b6c-e4b4-4b25-b0f0-03888cf919cc','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSVGFsVm1WalpsWDBSU2VWWTNjbGwzUkdobk1rRRAB','google','My first time ever to any Cava, and this one knocked it out of the park! The food was delicious, and the blueberry lavender drink was so yummy. Great service, everyone was so very, very helpful. I appreciated it on my travels.',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:34:09.290Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('72c5659d-5ab6-4a14-9f5b-eb539499e233','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oNFQwMXFlaTFoZEZsV1Qzb3RiWGhPVTJsVlIyYxAB','google','Great location downtown in the pedestrian mall. Delicious burgers. Pay the extra to add a fried pickle to the top of your burger.',4,'2026-11-12','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8a321faa-8d71-447c-9a58-7a14acc55a5a','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swNE15MXNORGxuYVVndGNrdGxSR2R4VXpCSmFVRRAB','google','My family and I stopped in on a Sunday afternoon after walking the cute town of Charlottesville.  We were starving and wanted something simple. The music was super loud but we were sat in the back so it wasn''t bad but if we were to sit in the front it would''ve been hard to hear each other. Our waitress was young and not very friendly. She took our order. After waiting 45 minutes for our food, she forgot our appetizer which was taken off of our bill. The food was OK. Not the best but not the worst. I got the truffle fries which were nothing special and actually all of my fries were very tiny. My families fries were all long. The food came out cold. The burgers were dry and the buns were old (very brittle and falling apart). We did not take our leftovers. Our waitress acted like we were a burden when we needed refills and never came to ask how we were doing. We usually tip very very well but unfortunately 20% was all that was given and not earned. Luckily we will never have to return as we are out of towners.',2,'2026-11-10','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('77c058fe-5baa-41fc-a003-52383cda506a','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBeWF6SjVRMWhxZEdObVdHbFJaRGxWWVVwaFdXYxAB','google','Best burger place in town,  all grass fed beef, amazing sides plus an awesome beer selection.',5,'2026-11-08','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3da52c85-3a5e-4b23-ae39-f76233ca585e','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taNFJIUmZTRXBKYTNCTlYzY3hSWEJ2WTNoMU1sRRAB','google','boyfriend wasnt hungry so i had to eat both meals but it was marvelous',5,'2026-11-07','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('02949c9c-c7a1-400a-bc28-355a5b2e67c0','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wUmNWZzNjM2h1ZFUxTVdFSnRXVTgzYVVKVVVGRRAB','google','An Unforgettable experience<br><br>I have eaten at plenty of burger restaurants, but I can confidently say this was an experience forged in a league of its own.<br><br>Our server, Seth, was an absolute legend. From the moment we sat down, he made us feel like royalty. There was something almost mythical about the way he carried himself. Calm, dependable, and clearly a master of his craft. Our drinks never ran dry, our food arrived piping hot, and he tanked every request/allergy we had like it wasn’t a problem.<br><br>The burgers were nothing short of legendary. You could tell they were made with the kind of care and craftsmanship that only comes from someone who takes genuine pride in their work. Even during the dinner rush, Seth remained an unstoppable (btw) force of hospitality. Nothing seemed to shake him.<br><br>I’ve never seen someone turn the simple act of serving a burger into such a memorable experience. The man is clearly built different.<br><br>If you find yourself at this restaurant, ask for Seth. He doesn’t just bring the heat; he brings the entire forge.<br><br>Five stars. An absolute mountain of a man. Top 3% of waiters.',5,'2026-11-06','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8df39208-9c7a-494e-8ad7-55c78f610d9f','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWFEwZEZhWGR0UkRsNGVUbEZiWFY1U1UxeU9VRRAB','google','Fabulous burgers! The truffle fries were amazing.  Loved the outdoor seating and they had a decent drink selection',5,'2026-11-04','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('930058cf-cfdd-4fa1-bc4f-96fbe2943c6a','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5RWFWUk5VMFZsYVZCWVRYbGpRbmxaWkd3eGRYYxAB','google','Great atmosphere',5,'2026-11-03','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2a54c4b4-c6a8-4ac0-abde-5b4e457fcbb9','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JME5WSXRRM2Q2Ulc5b2VtVlBRa0ozWTJGRGVGRRAB','google','Food was pretty good. Service was really really bad. Our server disappeared for<br>20 mins at the end of our meal. We had to ask the hostess to locate him. When he finally comes back, he said he was busy running food back and forth… no apology. Nothing. And this is the same server who wouldn’t shut up when we first were sat down and kept talking and talking and talking instead of just doing his job. Anyone reading this who works there knows exactly who im talking about.<br><br>Overall, not a place I’d be interested in going back to. 3/5.',3,'2026-10-27','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('43c16ceb-e17b-466b-93d3-450637d89deb','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oWmFVMUJUMmx0U0dscU5tbEJjSFo1Ykd4RmMyYxAB','google','45 min for a kids chicken tender. Waiter doesn’t even know the burger special written  on the board coming into the restaurant. Get it together',2,'2026-10-24','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8823283e-264e-465c-b5e4-ea57e13c44a5','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wbkxWRk5TV2xDYXpOWk5FZE1Va0ZGTmtGSVZGRRAB','google','Great food amazing service by Preston. Will be back.',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bad54825-94ab-4115-ad25-6e9c4244b992','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOc2JXczJPVVkyWnpadU4wMVNkbVpoWjNWek1XYxAB','google','I had such a great time here , the place was very clean and the server "ALONDRA" made great recommendations and was very helpful ☺️',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('baba977a-1b43-4e3c-99fa-4473ed163f6d','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSNWFEaDNkMUpqT1ZaU01VdERXRTVET0VGbWQyYxAB','google','Sat at the bar with Alondra tonight, what a wonderful spot. Alondra was super sweet and inviting. An amazing bartender, can’t wait to come back 🙌🙌🙌🙌',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('66435a2e-845f-4834-a06c-560aaf71f3b8','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KWFNGWnVSSEJPTVV0ZllUbEhjbFZZTkRSSVJWRRAB','google','Alondra was our server and so full of energy, extremely knowledgeable of the area and great local recommendations',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('71ac7611-9f8c-467d-b4f1-3dbc09f5bc29','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wYVoxOU9UVmxKUkdSSVFXaFljMWxDTTBwRVVIYxAB','google','Meh.  We were initially greeted with a warm welcome by several staff at the desk.<br><br>We were promptly greeted by our server.  Husband ordered a burger "pink in the middle" and I ordered a salmon burger with chipotle mayo on a brioche bun.<br><br>The menu said local brioche bun.  I made the bun out to be something amazing in my head but it was rather dry. There was not much sauce and the salmon was a touch too overdone.   This all culminated to a dry sandwich.  My salad was super fresh and I loved the balsamic vinaigrette.<br><br>My husband bit into his burger to find it well done. (Ordered pink in the middle)  Our server didn''t check on us until we were more than half through our meal.  When specializing in burgers you really need a chef that can cook to temp like a boss.  That is the expectation.  Good service rule-  30second  check in after first bite.<br><br>To note-  the bathroom was gross.  I really base my cleanliness scale on an establishments bathroom.  I''ve worked in a lot of restaurants in my life and the kitchen mimics the bathroom mimics the standards.',3,'2026-10-15','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('14a3f82c-a68b-4d3b-8c62-56d6bc0cd968','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKa09YTlhSMEpVT0ZZelNqZDZiRTV6UzFkS1gzYxAB','google','We ordered onion rings and the amount of grease that was on the napkin was gross!! The cheese fries would old fries reused and not hot. The hamburger was plain tasting. The waiter only checked on us a handful of times.  Our bill was 53.00 for that kind of money you should get fresh food and worth your money.<br>Unfortunately I would not recommend this place. And I failed to mention they sat us at a dirty table. I tried to call a couple times to speak with the manager  And no one answered the phone!',1,'2026-10-11','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('17ee1475-5116-4a49-a50a-752334e8b369','3c436577-c273-4528-b590-b82adcf34c04','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0NVVWaEtiVEo0VEdOdlgwMWFOV3BuVjFGdlNXYxAB','google','The biggest takeaway from our time was Alondra! She was an all time server and felt like we were being served by a friend and not a stranger. We will definitely be back!',5,'2026-10-11','2026-11-12T15:34:27.445Z');
