INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0e8ca05a-dae2-4bb8-98aa-6a5b644e3813','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21FemNtdDFjR1JJTmw5dGRTMXNUM2R2UVMxQ1lVRRAB','google','Loved this place. Great brunch on the weekend. And seems it becomes a bar in the evening.',5,'2026-10-18','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bff97c7a-49bc-490a-a2b2-241fcacb5c86','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOc1JUSjVjRWx6ZDB4eWJtOUJlWEpPUVVRNWVHYxAB','google','We had an incredible dinner experience at Fig! The atmosphere was warm, inviting, and beautiful. I had the dill salmon paired with a glass of Sauvignon Blanc, and both were absolutely delicious.<br><br>We had a wonderful experience from start to finish. Everything was fantastic, and we would definitely recommend Fig to anyone looking for a great dining experience. We will definitely be back soon! ❤️',5,'2026-09-23','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c3e7e95a-33ed-448a-ba0a-a78a6cc733e6','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfeC16MlFnEAE','google','Wonderfull spot.  The food is delicious, warm atmosphere, lovely staff.<br>Great price range $10 - $20.',5,'2026-09-17','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fb6560f3-4f18-4466-abb1-bca228830913','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZeFQxUkJTV2xzY3pOV2JGZFpNbmg0VFhkVFYwRRAB','google','We really loved the staff Sunday afternoon, plus the food (and pitchers of mimosas) were wonderful cherries on top.',5,'2026-08-17','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('399970d8-ab68-4563-b240-d4707ddbcddf','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKblkwdFVkRXAwWDFWTlRURlFVazlXWDJoSFdIYxAB','google','This was my first time at Fig. It will not be my last. The food and service were very good. A nice gem on the University corner!',5,'2026-07-28','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b3452ece-5c3e-466f-a962-9205b153e1c4','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aU1ZtdEVSbWhCVlVKaFdFNWxVbmhNT1VwbmMzYxAB','google','Poor experience this evening as a party of seven. I expected more from restaurant week. The food was sub par, and cold. The pre fixe menu had no option for someone who was GF, meaning you pay for three courses but you only get to eat two if you have an allergy. And we were bombarded by the staff with water pitchers every 3 minutes. Including one waitress who was constantly asking us if we needed anything else, when it was clear we did. The constant interruptions and lack of attention for the things we actually needed was very odd. The staff need some serious training. I won''t be back to see that occur, and would recommend you spend your money elsewhere during restaurant week. Also, our entrees took a solid hour to arrive so don''t go hungry.',1,'2026-07-22','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('670edb20-e10f-4d1b-895a-91cfa089c595','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205elJEa3hXVUZ2ZERWaFVIUXdabGRYYzJWelFtYxAB','google','Sooo I usually don’t do this but I was absolutely disappointed by this experience. First of all I ordered a cocktail (from the menu) so it should be known how to be made correctly. It was not due to key components missing (mint which compliments the elderflower.) I was excited to see that on the menu then was disappointed. The menu on Google is incorrect so they didn’t have the dish I originally drove a half an hour for. Whatever I know things change so I ordered something else. Waitress said I can get my eggs however I wanted so I asked about poaching them. She came back 10 mins later to tell me they can’t do that, once again… whatever. However asked how she can do eggs and all she could say was scrambled. Not sure if thats a licensing thing or something. The staff was busy but seemed veryyy stressed out and didn’t know what they’re doing. However they were friendly. I got a side of toast, then was asked after already receiving my toast if I wanted butter or jam. The butter came out rock solid so I couldn’t even spread it on my toast. Maybe I ordered wrong (my friend liked his fig-changa though and the hot sauce was good.) My food was very bland and honestly something I could’ve done at home in 10 minutes. For such a cute/hip looking place, I was overall very upset with the entire experience.',2,'2026-05-24','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('92d732a3-4cde-4086-ab74-3ee5630b1093','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCNVdEZzFjbVkzTjJaaFJWOXpVek5pZUZSM1psRRAB','google','We went here for brunch on Mother’s Day.  What a great find! Wonderful service, good food and great location.  We will be back.',5,'2026-05-15','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e87da747-e955-4a9b-9d97-2b6cc9f08159','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkcVpIYzFhVzFJY3pKUlNEaHNNMWRyYjBaYVZXYxAB','google','everything is really filling. The alcoholic drinks were just alright. We did like that half the place was open with windows so it felt less cramped inside.',5,'2026-05-06','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3b41c7e1-a3f3-41fd-af64-150e9fa65bef','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205S01IaHdlR2h4VWxsWFMxRjFTVEYzY1VZNVozYxAB','google','took great care of me, and I enjoyed my meal. Made a stressful evening better.',5,'2026-04-29','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('873f25cd-7195-4bf6-a851-c167f1ec050f','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOWFVqUkhlSHB0VkMxUmJHdE5jV0ZEVVdwR2NWRRAB','google','I understand now why I’d never heard of Fig before eating there tonight and why the place was basically empty during dinner rush. If you’re looking for good quality food and a pleasant atmosphere then don’t bother with Fig. They’re lucky they have a corner location near UVA because without it I doubt they’d still be open.<br><br>I ordered the lamb loin and was served maybe 4 bites of thin meat. The majority of it was grizzle and bone. The mash potatoes were cold. I didn’t eat more than 2 bites, 1 of which I had to spit out into my napkin. The owner who is also the cook came out to let me know I must not actually like lamb and don’t know what it’s supposed to taste like because he cooked it perfectly. If I had eaten the whole plate I would understand not comping the meal, but it wasn’t even edible to me and even if it was, it was a child’s portion size. Seems like food must get sent back a lot for them to have such a strict policy. Or maybe it’s just the cook/owners ego 🙂 Either way, wouldn’t recommend the place. You can walk a few steps in either direction and find much better options where they actually care about their customers leaving satisfied.',1,'2026-02-04','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('de0ffb34-09ab-425a-aa4b-c75e4b9bce1e','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25abFJTMW9RV3BRU1Y5c2JFWndVM2RQTUdkWWMzYxAB','google','I stopped Saturday evening in advance of the January 24-25th snowstorm,  and had a lovely dinner; it was delicious! Lydia ( I hope I am spelling her name correctly) took great care of me, and I enjoyed my meal. Made a stressful evening better.',5,'2026-01-25','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('770b46b2-9a4b-4ce8-847d-c3966f95af07','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkWGQyTjNaVFoxZVZZeVlucFlkV1I1UW1WZlFsRRAB','google','Visited Fig for the first time. The hostess, Simona, went above and beyond to help us find the right table to cater to our puppy. Our server, Leyla, was so patient and sweet as our large group took forever to decide on orders. Josie was also a sweetheart and helped explain the items further. What a great group of waitresses/hostess- Will definitely be back!!!',5,'2025-11-08','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fbdd76f4-c62f-438a-a94a-1280d1fd8f0c','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQ1RWRjJNWEJYTmtoRVFYZDBRVzlhYkhweWJIYxAB','google','When you have an 8pm reservation and you eat, they close at 9pm, but at 9:15 the bar tender turns off music and yells across restaurant that everyone needs to leave… not a good way to get return customers. I can understand if we were there 30 min past closing, but 15 min really?',3,'2025-10-05','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('61ec7a7e-5bfd-4a9f-a2d2-5d8d4faa2954','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGdGJWY3RWbmRQU3pRNGJ6aEViM0o1Wms1dlRtYxAB','google','I just enjoyed the freshness of the food, the unique flavors…& the portions were more than generous! Great restaurant for the corner…I’ll be back!',5,'2025-09-16','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a8dc83a8-9e0a-44d6-84d6-1463716252ea','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwWlZraFRjRmN0TTFaNmNEWkVURU5mZG5Od1luYxAB','google','Experience was great! Food was solid and our server Zachary was very delightful. We will definitely be coming back.',5,'2025-09-12','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fff97f84-f501-4cb7-be57-8d475ec0a452','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJMmRrcHRURk4xVXpKWUxXTm1VRkYxUnkxek5WRRAB','google','Just skip this place. Their online brunch menu says they have $3 mimosas but we never saw that in the restaurant. I got the Big Fig which was $13.50 on their menu on their website but it was $16.50 in person. The bacon and potatoes were supposed to be "cajun" but did not have ANY seasoning on them. My friend did not like the egg whites and the $6 side avocado is just pitiful. This is the type of place that brings you sauce in little cups and it''s never enough... They say their system can''t split bills by items, only in half. So we paid on one check. Then see there is a convenience fee of 3%. For what? Nothing about this is convenient?? And if it was because I paid with a card we were not told and there are not signs about it. Our waitress was okay. Forgot some things, could have come back to check sooner, didn''t explain some things, whatever. And the suggested tips are 20, 22, and 24% 🤣',2,'2025-08-13','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bf8a82d2-635d-495e-8377-fffe1742a950','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pVemMySkRaVzk2WVc5bGMxazFUbWN5ZFUxUldsRRAB','google','Food was good l. Service was good. Restaurant is a bit on the small side with limited seating. Enjoyed my meal and service.',5,'2025-07-09','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('02784487-2486-46a4-a52a-bc877776e31b','4fa14c8d-de34-440f-86c0-f17939c3d159','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKS04yb0t4cTRlVS1BRRAB','google','Brunch at Fig Bistro & Bar in Charlottesville isn’t complete without the Figmosa—their bold take on the classic mimosa. Blending sparkling wine, fig juice, and a splash of vodka, it’s a smooth, flavorful upgrade that pairs perfectly with dishes like chicken & waffles or bacon chocolate chip pancakes. Served weekends from 9:30 AM to 2 PM, Fig is a must-visit for a brunch that’s both comforting and elevated.',5,'2025-05-12','2026-11-12T15:34:40.022Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('221d2bb0-5c93-4b5e-9956-5bc086e42dc4','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aeGJsSjBRVXRuUTBSWFRqazNhMEZtVVhCNldXYxAB','google','I strongly recommend this restaurant. They have good food ,good price, and good portion. I really enjoy the food! Especially, I love their general Tao Chicken, Sesame Chicken, Roast Pork and Egg Rolls!  My son loves their  酸菜魚湯 Suan Cai Yu Soup （ Boiled Fish with Pickled Cabbage and Chili. )! They are really tasty 😋!',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8dcf43da-b732-42f1-b86e-577ae740911a','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKZlNqZE5RMFYyTnpWM1JEbHhkMkpOZEdSVVowRRAB','google','The food was very good, very well cooked . We loved eating here.',5,'2026-10-02','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('21102bc6-d7b7-48a4-b73a-9e1d7ae932f2','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGMVltSjVkSEl3Vmt4d2N6VlBYelZHUVVSMFQxRRAB','google','My favorite Cville Chinese takeout.  Good comfort food, nice staff, clean seating area',4,'2026-09-19','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1da03a00-b934-4fda-9af5-c875267c8900','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBeGJrSldhVXBFV0d0dGJscDJTRnBQYTAwNGJtYxAB','google','⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 5 Stars — Seriously Underrated!<br>Hong Kong is honestly one of the most underrated restaurants in Charlottesville. It can be easy to overlook because of its location, but don’t let that fool you — the food is absolutely worth finding!<br>Everything I’ve had here has been fresh, flavorful, and cooked with care. The portions are generous, the prices are reasonable, and the food has that authentic, comforting taste that keeps you wanting to come back. You can tell they take pride in what they serve.<br>I really feel like this place deserves way more attention than it gets. Sometimes the best restaurants aren’t the ones sitting in the busiest or most noticeable locations. If you’re in Charlottesville and haven’t tried Hong Kong yet, do yourself a favor and give it a shot. You might just find your new favorite spot!<br>Definitely 5 stars from me — great food, great value, and a hidden gem that deserves more recognition! 🍜🥡🔥',5,'2026-08-11','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d590556d-2db0-41ec-b1af-95cb2e0d205d','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFdFkzQmhjakEyTnpGT1NGVmFSa1JJYW5aRmMwRRAB','google','Best take out in charlottesville. My order is always fresh and correct and the staff is so friendly. Also a nice seating area if you prefer to eat there.',5,'2026-08-06','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5bd84bb2-62b6-4cbd-95ae-6f55d755127c','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT200elNHTnpXVzVZTVdwR1MwdHRhelprZVVOTkxWRRAB','google','We''re new to the area and tried Hong Kong and was pleased with our order. Everything was fresh, vegetables just the right amount of crispness and sauces flavorful for the chicken and beef ordered. Great price and friendly service. Our new go-to for Chinese food!',5,'2026-03-14','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b4425750-9bb2-44d8-a5e2-c70b655c2e3a','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205MlVrZEZUbm8xYVd0SlFtaHdSMkZQT0c1MmJIYxAB','google','Every time I order food here I enjoy it. One of the best chinese take outs I have eaten from. As a non Cville native this is byfar better than what I have experienced outside of DC''s ChinaTown. Get some lomein you will love it.',5,'2026-03-06','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f875f78a-2264-4908-b882-307e8c127416','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twekxURmlNR05NTjA1cU0xaFpNbUl5VlVvMWExRRAB','google','Terrible! We have a two week old baby and toddler at home and ordered food at 11 in the morning online for 445 pickup.  They hadn’t started our order when we got there at 5 then preceded to give us the wrong order.  Will never be going back.',1,'2026-02-21','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8352e65f-b328-4c35-afdd-948ef612ec12','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kNE1DMUVWME5UUWpCM1dXUnBSMTl6YkVKdGFuYxAB','google','Our favorite place close to home for the last couple of years! Delicious veggie options and we can’t get enough of the fried rolls. The people there are always kind too!',5,'2026-02-18','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9b8a60bd-b5d4-4e29-8a45-c726d40769b2','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5U05tOUllR1pWUlRSelNVUlpNSFJRVUUxU1RFRRAB','google','This is what you should expect from a Chinese take out. I love this place and the people that work there. Always a great experience. Can''t recommend it enough.',5,'2026-02-14','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d56dd8a9-ba58-4c4f-9fe7-12bbebff9ef6','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wNVNrdFRVWHBZYTNwb1ZEbG9NbmhuTVZZM1QwRRAB','google','great food, great service, fast, and cheap can’t do better for takeout chinese food in this town - sweet and sour pork was amazing',5,'2025-12-25','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d705c69e-802a-4163-9b35-aa7a340d289a','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWd1EzQTRWMEZET1hsS1ZuUlVTWEJsVG5Kc0xXYxAB','google','Best Chinese in town! Always fresh and delicious.',5,'2025-12-04','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('50fab2d6-602d-42ec-9fba-c3aef4af072c','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWSGNXeEROVTVTUWsxRmJFUTFOMDV1TFZwaFZXYxAB','google','I get the luncheon specials at least 2x per week. Lots of choices, great food plus soup. Can’t go wrong. The dinner menu is large and prices very fair. Place is clean and owners friendly',5,'2025-11-25','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f27972f1-e833-4a54-b59a-70f92311bc93','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOclJGSm9VRlpYY0MxQ1JVc3lXVFJwV0VOdE4yYxAB','google','There''s another review on here that mentioned dumpling wrappers instead of Chinese pancakes. 20 November 2025 and the problem persists. No utensils either. Yeah I''ll be a 1 time customer.',1,'2025-11-20','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e2a4df5f-5e46-456e-a07e-88c2671ec509','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tObWRXaG9OMUZPTW5GNFFtZDBiMWQ1T1hSMVFYYxAB','google','Outstanding Chinese food! Huge menu of choices; have never been disappointed.  Always fast and friendly service.  This is my stop for Lunch or dinner when going to Charlottesville.<br><br>Marilyn',5,'2025-10-30','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('31b107fb-0417-4cb4-9cf0-6f06bbae165a','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaRVExWjFjMFpWUkdZMlgwVmpOazEzUW1jNVFWRRAB','google','Placed an order over the phone and went to pick up and supposedly my order didn’t exist . Waited an additional 25 minutes, No apology or explanation.',1,'2025-10-29','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b9f0211c-5627-4724-9860-bada2f42b919','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNM04xRkRNVVJFTTJ4V1JWTk9kVWxmTFZRNU1tYxAB','google','Excellent shrimp with broccoli and prompt, professional service.',5,'2025-10-10','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9c5413b3-6a36-4b8a-9871-45aabb9bbfa4','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aaWRHbHRNbU5mV1dOM2NGZEpjMUJmYmtSQ1lVRRAB','google','I ordered Moo Shu pork.  It came with five pancakes, hoisin sauce and rice. The five pancakes were raw dumpling wrappers. They were horrible. It’s a shame because the actual Moo Shu pork was absolutely delicious.  The rice was rice. It was good. I love sticky rice. That for $13 I would’ve liked a couple of pancakes.  Probably will never go back again.',3,'2025-09-22','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6eb26eaa-98e7-41c3-aa92-c35aa4b63ace','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xJd1YxZDFVbFoyTkZrelpHcG1ZbkIyU0VOdWVYYxAB','google','We had never tried this restaurant before, and decided to have dinner there last night.  The restaurant was small, which is to be expected, since they do mostly take out orders.  It was also very clean, which is a big plus. The service was great & the food was ready rather quickly. We have tried several Chinese restaurants in Charlottesville (and other areas), Hong Kong Restaurant is definitely at the top of our list for the best! The food was absolutely delicious & the portions were substantial.  We had plenty leftover for a couple of days. The prices were some of the cheaper ones we have seen around town. This will definitely be our go-to for Chinese in the future.',5,'2025-08-23','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('987e4911-a109-465b-b81a-9c192ca2bac4','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VQQ1ItOWlfLUpPOUhBEAE','google','In Charlottesville for a Dr appt and went insearch of a good sit down Chinese restaurant. Most everything is carryout. Found this little gem and was not disappointed.  They do mostly  arryout but have a half dozen tables. The food was EXCELLENT and very reasonably priced. If you''re in the Charlottesville area, I highly recommend.',5,'2025-06-09','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('af8276c7-f41b-4c79-b852-e1aaf3953458','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNaXkzS240M1kydjNnRRAB','google','Always so sweet. Food is soo good!!',5,'2025-05-12','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('748b257c-2e27-4950-808d-241e64627055','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvcUxMSnBnRRAB','google','Amazing food. Great service. Clean!',5,'2025-04-14','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8969e4a7-d5ca-42de-8a1c-3e2bf4b6590d','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNna3JPMXVBRRAB','google','Best Chinese food in town and arguably the best Chinese food I have ever had. They are super nice and accommodating. Strongly recommend!!',5,'2025-02-15','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0a4d9958-e1f7-4ead-b9ea-47ef8d339d00','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURBMHNLOGtRRRAB','google','Hands down the best Chinese in Charlottesville! This is our new favorite take-out spot! Highly recommend.',5,'2025-02-07','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8e2cddb7-6282-4262-8170-bf8f188944e1','780e4f6e-3dc2-4c71-9fd9-aa6489c1939e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYay11cEl3EAE','google','Best Chinese take-out in town by far!  It seemed to be a family-run business, extremely kind service and great tasting food for a very reasonable price!',5,'2024-10-30','2026-11-12T15:34:45.223Z');
