INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8cbfb61a-8548-4ed7-851e-034e3b8530e6','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkNWRscFlhVUpKVUdKeU1HaHpTakpRVDNkRFFWRRAB','google','Best wings in town!!<br>Cheapest bucket of beer in town!!!<br>Local hang out',5,'2026-10-19','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c130536d-9554-4dcc-b2dc-838ec3865c84','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ReVUyRnpjMVo2WjIxb1RrSjVOVmM1WTJaVmQyYxAB','google','Laid back place. Maybe a little too laid back. I ordered a drink and asked for a menu. The server started a tab with my card. The drink came right away along with a menu. 35 minutes later my drink was empty and the server hadn''t bothered to check and see if I wanted to order from the menu. Bummer experience for my first time there. I had to move myself from the patio and find a seat indoors to get anyone to notice I was there. The people working inside were very attentive which by now I wasn''t expecting and the food was just...OK. I wanted to love this place with a giant covered outdoor seating area. So much potential so little attention to anyone, (there were many of us) on the patio today around 2:30pm.',2,'2026-08-22','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('be5b32ff-a68c-474b-887a-ad8d0dd4757f','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxbk1GOWtkV1pZU0d4cmVVMTNkek0xY2t4QlUzYxAB','google','This place requires a dress code requirement that men cannot have cut off sleeve shirts. On that note, they should focus more on cleanliness rather than worrying about somebody''s clothing choices. The food was good, no complaints there. The service was pretty good, there were some girls that were hustling as far as drink runners. And the bathrooms 👎🏼',3,'2026-08-22','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20b15ab6-8d2f-4365-8766-fed42052a573','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21admVVNDNSSEZVTUhOeFdXRmliM05GZFZkVU1uYxAB','google','Best Mac and cheese I have ever had. Fish is delicious. Staff is cheerful and helpful. Thank you Sarah for your kindness.',5,'2026-08-12','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('787e10e3-d466-43d3-9c8f-1d602b4e929e','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaZmQzUnJXVlZPWkhOVk4ySnZkMDVhZG1KSmEzYxAB','google','Service definitely left a lot to be desired. Waitress just walked away in the middle of us placing orders and we had to go to a bartender to find someone so we could pay our bill and leave. Great waffle fries though!',2,'2026-07-29','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b70b35b9-bcb5-49a1-aa91-1abeeb3e1b39','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsc04zaEROa3R1YUhOVFdEaHRjMEpQTVZOeE5VRRAB','google','I love coming to this place. The seating situation is kind of confusing, i am pretty sure it is a seat yourself thing but there are no signs anywhere telling you to do so... it was raining and they were willing to seat us outside still under the roof area! I love the nachos with chicken and shrimp. I was sad when they got rid of the shrimp topping option. They have a ton of great sauce options for the wings though! It was also very cheap even with drinks and an appetizer.',5,'2026-07-13','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
