INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1ad5b09d-ac6f-4c6d-9cc4-67678e4fab1b','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsRVEySkVZekZSY0RSM1kzUXhYMXBPYURkZldYYxAB','google','Fun atmosphere and great lunch specials!',5,'2026-06-24','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8d0f611a-edb2-4648-b10c-6bd0371d068d','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOemVuZzVjVTFNWmt3emQzbEtkMHBoWlMxUE0zYxAB','google','Started with the buffalo chicken nachos the nachos where warm and definitely hearty plenty of chicken and it came with blu cheese crumbles can’t complain at all..I had the the Sunday special 90 cent wings!! I had 10 dry lemon pepper they were definitely fresh nice sized very flavorful..my wife had the cod fish fish that came with waffle fries and hush puppies a tad bit overcooked for me but my wife enjoyed it.. she also had the key lime and coconut with rum it came in a nice small bucket that u can take home overall a pretty positive experience will be back to try the burger and onion rings!!',4,'2026-06-22','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8285a006-4398-44e5-907a-fae3cfca6045','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aaVVXUnBaMGh1U0ZCRlRXbHZRM1ZwTjBwSVNXYxAB','google','Good service and good attitude',5,'2026-05-29','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('231b6175-d9f0-4062-a996-7843434e9be1','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKbFdGb3lkVGxLVUhFM1owNUhTak5qY0ZGb1VXYxAB','google','We came out here to celebrate a friend’s treatment from cancer and the staff were terrible to work with. They didn’t acknowledge anybody waiting at the bar to put in for a drink, they claimed they weren’t gonna do individual tickets and put over 30 people on one ticket, and just had an attitude. Truly put a damper on a friend’s cancer celebration. My first time here and my last time.',1,'2026-04-17','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('371342c4-8dfb-47c0-b214-4898539f07e6','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OSlkxQktTWEp6VldseWMyODROVGw2WWsxeVNuYxAB','google','A zany sports bar with a big personality. Good beer and sports galore. What more do you want!',5,'2026-04-08','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('571813f6-026e-424d-88f2-48191bd0fc20','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKNFprWlZNMU14UTAxbVpHVXRNbU5TTkZkeVdIYxAB','google','Terrible service. Walked in, nobody greeted or acknowledged me. After standing there like an idiot in an EMPTY restaurant for 10 or so minutes, an employee finally came by. All she said was take a menu and sit anywhere. I sat there for 30 minutes and never had a single person come by. Don''t ever come here. You would be better off wasting your time and money at macdonalds than coming here. I get better service at a gas station. If I could, id give zero stars, but people need to know not to waste their time or money here.',1,'2026-03-10','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c504dc34-858d-4ef8-9eb7-cf6c5692eb67','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xacGJtTkJTV3N4VW5aRE9EZ3RkRGx0ZEY5bE1FRRAB','google','Great Food, Service and Atmosphere!!!',5,'2026-03-07','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('369d8800-2be9-4308-9f33-b2c57302e50c','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21walkzaFBNbk5tYkZWdVNsSTBUblkwT1dFMVNGRRAB','google','I placed two platter orders for the super bowl and I called a few days in advance just to even see if they would do the platters. I get it''s such a busy day so I wanted to make sure instead of asking day of. I was told everything was fine and they could handle it. I pick up the wings and it''s crowded but everything is fine. I didn''t check my order and that''s my fault but I left. When I get home, both platters were naked bone in wings and I''d ordered one bone in, one boneless. I call back and explain what happened and I was told I must be mistaken and that no orders would leave like that without sauce. I assure them that they are and I was told I could come back and get them retossed. I live 35 minutes away but agree as I''ve worked in food service and understand mistakes happen. When I drive back,  no apology and I ask if I could keep the extra platter of naked wings for my troubles. The girl just grabbed both and didn''t say a word. I received my correct order and checked it this time and the girl asks "What? You don''t trust us?" Never got an apology or that other platter that is probably being served to customers or eaten by kitchen staff. Never again',1,'2026-02-08','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('281c6b71-d613-4077-9eb7-3259adf5b92b','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWbk5rSklkMWh4WVhvNWNFUmllbGh4YnpaZlkxRRAB','google','Kayla is MVP - best drinks and food ever, she takes care of us every time!',5,'2026-01-21','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('04d1749d-0a90-457a-b0f0-13aba64dc616','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkRFRHRkpNMmhyVkRGNkxXOXhUMjFUTkdzek5HYxAB','google','We have been coming here for 20+ years, great local bar thst attracts all kinds of people from the community and regulars. Services is always great and friendly, food is consistent, always packed, fun, and people are respectful. We love this place, the serving staff arr amazing as is the owner.',5,'2026-01-10','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('08591a96-c3c9-44eb-a6c1-34426661aeaa','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSdmFIZGpVbnBSVjJkaFRsWXlZa3hxZG5wMWQwRRAB','google','Went to watch NFL game. Many TV''s, good service',5,'2025-12-24','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('25db9904-bdcc-4200-9ee6-2ce8218213f6','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oWWVYTk1ZbEJDTlhCT01tRkJZa2xmVEVKWk9IYxAB','google','this place has really really great wings! they let you mix and match sauces too which is really nice for trying out different flavors. takeout or dine-in offered.',5,'2025-12-06','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('87bf7862-01a2-4721-a54f-2e1c4ed785c4','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM0MmZmMzVRRRAB','google','This is god''s country',5,'2025-11-23','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a4cd152d-e93c-4e3c-bbca-67a0cd78c491','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21nNGJWSlBUVlZHV21sc2RHaDNORXRFVFVkUFdHYxAB','google','I''ve only Been here 3 times to call in a takeout order for my Dry Rub Lemon Pepper wings and 1st time they were Great,2nd time They were not seasoned enough and 3rd time was So Messed up. I went in to pay and when they brought me my order I checked it and found that Nothing but the Little Drumsticks was All that was in there,No flat''s or wing pieces. I called over and asked for the Manager and the lady there said I''m the manager so I asked what happened? She said they were out but if I was willing to wait 17 more minutes she would get them for me.An I didn''t understand which lie was the truth or Both lies because why didn''t you just add the flats from the beginning being you made me wait 25 minutes to pick up my order in the first place.She said I believe the person before you ordered All flats so we gave you All Drummets 😤 What So I asked my ride could he be a bit more patient so they can fix my order. So she took the first order back to the back and I waited for what I believed to be a New ORDER done correctly. Why did I expect that when I wasn''t even ask if I''d like to have a glass of water while I waited the extra 17 minutes which it was turned to be 20 minutes. Upon bringing the order out I noticed how heavy it was and opened it and 😳 She put Flats on top of the old Drummets she had first given me and I said you gave me too much, She this so called classless Manager said Yeah you can have em. I grabbed them and came home to the Slimy Celery that I''ve never gotten before and the flats were Not seasoned or Cooked throughout. I should have gotten my order fresh and redone and my Money back for a almost hour wait for 10 wing''s.SHAME ON YOU. Don''t take our money for a lousy job. I''ll be filing a complaint and trying to get my money back. Those wings that could have been my After work dinner went to Waisted time and MONEY.',1,'2025-11-14','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3024a5ea-d760-4118-929e-c4f5bf15eb64','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSTVozbFlZMHhTVnpSek5ETm5kM2Q0VFZkNmQyYxAB','google','I’ve visited this location twice and each time they have charged me for two tickets at check out. I’ve been trying to call for days and they don’t ever answer the phone. Seems like they are stealing peoples money when they are out having a good time.',1,'2025-10-27','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2d721d0a-a107-475f-8a86-10f3c07593df','a9ba744d-d325-4bf7-b182-0d48932d57e6','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWlltTXpZM2xZWXpsR2NEUnhXRGhGVERKa05tYxAB','google','Poorly run.Very slow service',1,'2025-10-25','2026-11-12T15:35:17.278Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f73b666e-d5b9-4322-93c6-009e6e96a42d','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wNGJFVjZTMEV5VXpRd1RYaHdVM1ZPWlRST1ZuYxAB','google','Unfriendly employees. No one greeted me or anything upon entering. Definitely need to work on the service for mediocre pasta. Pasta was dry as well. Even with the extra sauce I paid for. Not the worst place in town but spend your money elsewhere for better service and value.',2,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3a3c0261-50b8-401f-91e3-10dd8f4296fc','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKRU5IWTJYMmswU2xGTU1uWlVjVEZHZFVwcVZGRRAB','google','Looking for somewhere to eat. Ordered their New Sesame steakwith Ramen. It was salty , little noodles hard steak. . Not coming back',1,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a07d02d8-b529-4664-9094-59bd6b5f31ef','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5b1lqQk5kbnBETVV4clJtODFaR0pIVEdnMFltYxAB','google','The restaurant is clean and the staff are very nice.<br><br>I came to try the Spicy Korean Steak Ramen. The pictures looked great, online video reviews sounded very promising and i really love Ramen of all sorts.<br><br>When the bowl came I was a bit disappointed by how it looked.  I barely saw any meat and what I did see was very thinly cut and small.  That''s okay,  maybe it''s on the bottom!<br>The picture is after I stirred it and found all the steak. I would say 8 pieces total, cut into about 1 inch squares and 2 of the pieces were 1/2 fat.<br>Either way,  fine,  no big deal.<br>It tastes just like very oily indomie Raman but at 5X''s the price. Not the spicy version, just regular.<br><br>Very little meat, very little spinach, cabbage? Where?<br><br>Don''t let the word spicy scare you, they should put it in quotes. It was hotter sitting in the restaurant then the spice level okay?<br>If you are interested in Raman you could make at home, go for it. Honestly,  it''s mid at best.',3,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('781a3e68-b76a-4d13-b746-021f4b17cafb','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tRNVZUVnhkMEpDUkdGM1IwUlRZbGhNWldKUVlWRRAB','google','My best friend and I came to this location for the first time and dined in and we had a great time! Everyone was very kind, food was really good! I want to shout out Jaiden (I’m sorry if I misheard your name!!) but she was fantastic, answered all my questions, made sure we were taken cared of and more! So thank you to her and everyone else there for the wonderful experience and the Korean BBQ Meatballs were amazing! Haven’t had them in years!!!',5,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e0f6a1c5-48e3-4af4-9275-8ffdc03ed838','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWVU1qTTRabGxPU2tGcU9HVkVPV3A2V1hoaVJrRRAB','google','Stopped in for a quick bite one afternoon. Ordered the potstickers. They were lukewarm and not fried (I guess that’s how they come). Disappointing food for $6+. Not worth sending them back so I ate them anyway. This is not the first time I’ve been disappointed here but it will definitely be the last.',2,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('61cb1e80-a8fe-452d-9950-1dfe73c1a8ef','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SNVpGVlBieTFxYmxwVGRsbEtObk5RT0dSdFYxRRAB','google','Consistently good. Employees are friendly and welcoming, food always comes out hot and generously portioned, and prices are reasonable. Love the mac and cheese with meatballs. Underrated fast casual restaurant.',5,'2026-10-04','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
