INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('69957f58-6c6a-4e18-8520-fce7445ee595','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd2JWTTBXakZpY0hKamFqaEdRVU5RWDBrMFJVRRAB','google','Jeff did an amazing job making us feel cared for and the food was amazing.',5,'2026-07-29','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf9a371e-77f3-4076-9970-21172c7bbc0d','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sRmRYZEhUbUo0ZGxOWE9EQXdkVVl4UWxoUWMzYxAB','google','So I look forward to ordering Pan noodles every now and again. We are on our 6th or 7th order and one thing I’ve come to understand is consistency is not a thing here. Tonites order of pan noodles, meatballs, green onion and mushrooms arrived without meatballs or green onions and not extra mushrooms. So if you want what you order, order elsewhere.',1,'2026-06-18','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d25fa21-2f06-4b1a-a235-4c44b0fa869b','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sSWRqVmlaRVEyZGpONmEzbHBTRzF6VG1kbVEzYxAB','google','Long story short, don''t really have a problem with the food. Portion sizes have definitely gotten smaller recently, tastes decent. Staff is nice, usually flustered and busy though for this location. Went here for the first time in awhile recently because I saw they had a buy one entree get one free the next time you come in, but you have to sign up on their mobile app. No problem, go ahead and create an account, go to order my two meals with my partner, cashier scans my app barcode, all is well. Fast forward a couple days later, wanted to take my family here and use the free entree coupon. Check my account, to my surprise, it''s not in their, and neither is my order under my recent orders tab. Frustrating, decided to go somewhere else instead.<br>Reach out to customer support.<br>Response 3 days later.<br>They say they need a receipt.<br>I reply that I wasn''t given one, because I wasn''t, not a big deal.<br>They ask for a copy of my bank statement.<br>Give it to them and my card and date and time purchased.<br>They say "okay we''ll get back to you and get this sorted out" regional manager by the way.<br>This was 9 days ago.<br>5 days ago, I asked to follow up and see if anything got figured out or progress was made.<br>NO response.<br>So infuriated and feel cheated.<br>Never going back.<br>Let down. Was also counting on the free entree to feed my family in the future, and would have never eaten here if it wasn''t for the original sign on coupon.<br>Luckily the food is not that good, so I''m not missing anything. No problem with the people at this specific location, big issue with the company and its choices.<br>Save yourself the time.',1,'2026-06-18','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3779bea3-b4c2-4710-9840-cbd5cce9972b','578fefe1-2f8e-4dc8-92f2-75516dc38fa8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwSE1EZFpTRTR0YzNka09FdGhVVjkxVlZRdFpFRRAB','google','Excellent food and great service! The food is always hot, fresh, and delicious! Friendly people and attentive to my order. Pleasant atmosphere and not overcrowded.',5,'2026-06-12','2026-11-12T15:35:31.597Z');
