INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('830391d1-6826-4e16-a302-f734e41c5ac6','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGd1dHNUdVVlpwYzBwa01HRlBWVjh6ZDJ0ZlpFRRAB','google','I''ve been in better Applebee''s before this 1 . Waitress wasn''t that very attentive',3,'2026-02-18','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4ce9253d-8dee-4903-adbb-8d8668a8ed6f','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWWWEyVjNZbWxVUmtsR01sVk5PSFowTW0xNlNHYxAB','google','Horrible (No) service. - Walked-in and sat ourselves at the bar. 15-minutes passed without a server or employee talking to us, welcoming us or taking our order, so we left and went to another place else where we figured would actually want our money. - Don''t waste your time here. - No service. No food',1,'2026-02-17','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7ab2ba37-e176-46d5-b7b7-0591bd7603b7','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vM2FHUldWVjlHVldZMlJWRmFWMDl0UW1odU1XYxAB','google','I ate at Applebee''s last Monday!  I had eaten a Caesars salad and French Onion Soup  there several times and they both were excellent!  This TIME I decided to eat the same things again!  When the server brought them out, the Soup looked and tasted like it had been diluted down with water.  Absolutely NO taste!  The salad had either thousand island dressing or a different dressing, NOT the Caesars Salad!  Very DISAPPOINTING!',1,'2026-02-14','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('90aacdc8-3fc9-4224-88ec-85a81aece196','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGRHUjVWV28xWkZGZlZYTXllRll5WTBKcGRtYxAB','google','ordered online said pickup 611pm got there 620 called to let them knw i was there in curbside had to call 2 more times finally got food 643pm got home quesidillas were hard mozzela sticks all covered jn sauce and cheeseburger that was supposed to be well done was not was rare son refused to eat it as would i now i have to take time to go talk to dm about the order uggghhhhh',2,'2026-02-09','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3b3338c2-ea40-441e-8dca-e3b3168e9ba4','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxUWJUbDFVekZEYlY5WmVqbExOSFpzVjJKb1luYxAB','google','Let me start by saying, the server himself, did a fine job. The food, started off pretty good, beer cheese and pretzels. The steaks were both ordered medium, one was rare the other closer to well-done,neither had any seasoning. The Mac and cheese tasted as though someone forgot to drain the water.<br>The MOD was notified and did nothing more than look at our table and  take $5 off the bill, no apology or addressing of the issue. The mac and cheese was almost $4 each.<br>Mens bathroom could also use some attention.<br><br>*****The link provided from the ''owner'' in the response doesn''t work****',2,'2026-02-08','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('18eaeefd-f94f-45a1-90b0-3c9a7d6ecc26','9a224b90-4af4-454a-8f99-555476f4e651','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21odFREazJURE5aWDBORVdXRnRhRWx2UWpOSmQxRRAB','google','Ordered the om cheeseburger, omg is more like it.   The bread was like a cruton, but I never got to taste because of the hair in my fries on my first bite.   Dinner over!!!  I drove 20 min to get here, had a lot of anticipation over this sandwich I see advertised all the time, all I did was waste my time.   The restaurant itself, the ceiling tile ceiling is caving in, and very dirty. The bathroom smelled like pee and the smell was wafting out in to the dining room.   Needless to say I never return, but the way this place looks they''ll be gone soon!!!  Good bye',1,'2026-02-03','2026-11-12T15:35:38.707Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2e4c034b-9304-46a5-8fed-7283def72277','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabmFrZERkMG93YnpGcE16RjRUVzV3VW5rMmIxRRAB','google','Awesome food. I love the shrimp appetizer and the fish sandwich.',5,'2026-11-08','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('63cc60b8-27dd-4a7e-bc77-0168222a8f98','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GYWJrNUdTMGREWlVOdU1UVkJTWEJQWkdSVVEyYxAB','google','We had such a good experience here at Burton’s for our anniversary! Togen was our waiter and he was amazing! He was so attentive and gave us great recommendations on what to order! Thanks to him, we ended up getting the braised short rib grilled cheese and steak frites; both amazing! We can’t wait to return!',5,'2026-11-06','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0cd1d7a1-1469-46e4-bee0-255ea87e183c','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkaGFGUXpkVlZEWm5SNldXbzFaRFkzVFdwdWVHYxAB','google','Waitress was fine but food took a long time and order was wrong and no reduction in price',2,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('da544697-f585-409e-8c1a-1bec19031cec','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21nMVVrZHBjbFpQWlZKZmQzUjZWVVIxUm14SGNVRRAB','google','Good price to quality. Great service.',5,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5302cc59-8a72-450b-af95-5d5267f3bb4e','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJNWRrWXdaa3RIVmpseE5uRlhObXRDWTBNeFUwRRAB','google','After a very disappointing lunch at the Big Meadow lodge on Skyline drive we were looking for redemption food.<br><br>That food was found at Burtons Grill and Bar. We arrived shortly after 7pm and the restaurant and bar were both busy and there was a good buzz of noise that dissipated after we were sat (after a short 10 minute wait for a booth).<br><br>For those of you with food allergies rest assured that this establishment is keyed in and ready to take care of you, they have a dedicated gluten free menus that encompasses most of their regularly including their entire dessert menu. All gluten free dishes are served on square plate ware to minimize mistakes!!! They will ask u at the hostess stand about allergies and if so will seat you with a small tag to let your server know, they will capture the details and pass along to the kitchen.<br><br>I had read a number of reviews and some had referenced a waitress named Ebony. We were fortunate to be seated in her section and immediately knew that she was awesome and struck up a short relationship. Ebony was friendly, funny, and just the right kind of sassy.<br><br>We ended up ordering their version of buffalo chicken wings (very good) & gluten free focaccia (horrible after cooling down).  I ordered a half Caesar with chicken, my wife a gluten free chicken piccata, both were very good.<br><br>Faced with a dessert menu that was gluten free we had an apple crisp and a chocolate cake that ended up being a mile high, enough so that the three of us bust out laughing.  Both were brilliant and most of the Nakatomi shaped chocolate cake went back to the hotel with us.<br><br>We both highly recommend Burtons, ask for Ebony.',5,'2026-10-27','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f3cc6d6d-d10d-43aa-81ed-e136dcc5f645','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pseVdHeFZjRmRWUTJveGEwVjZVM05vVDBocFkwRRAB','google','Delicious food. Relaxed atmosphere.',4,'2026-10-26','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ba869e6b-6ed1-4161-b2e4-ecd822520e95','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2trMmRtcHlUalpNZVc1aFJrazBZakpWWVVaemFWRRAB','google','Food was incredibly delicious! Our server, Ebony, was exceptional. Can’t wait to come back!',5,'2026-10-26','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e8947f00-654d-48d1-936c-b38984457dd7','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBdFVETnpWR1p2U2pGTFpGRlhWVWQzVTNoNVRrRRAB','google','Always enjoy Burtons. Highly recommend the General Tso Bowl. Had grilled chicken and steak, was very good and filling!',5,'2026-10-19','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9f37c8bd-b967-45db-96d7-6773e2dc21a7','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ReWVEUXhWamxyU2xreU9XeHBUWEpTYTJwdFJIYxAB','google','It’s honestly amazing that Burton’s offers such a huge gluten-free menu, covering everything from appetizers all the way to dessert, while still following strict kitchen protocols to keep everything safe from cross-contamination—and the food still tastes fantastic! Plus, having a full regular menu right alongside the gluten-free options made dining out with my fiancé, who has celiac disease, such a great experience.<br><br>Dani took care of us during both of our visits, and she was just wonderful. She really made our celebratory dinner so much better by being super attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly the whole time. I’d definitely recommend asking for her if you’re planning to grab a meal at Burton’s!',5,'2026-10-19','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b0bac755-04da-4271-8ab4-948c3387e00c','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFM2RWcENiVUpVWVZWb1VtbDJiRlYwWlVVeFVYYxAB','google','our server, Ebony was amazing. She was very attentive. We loved her attitude and her upbeat explanations of our meal. She’s an excellent  server and you should keep her on as long as you can!',5,'2026-10-18','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0d910557-d53c-4639-a957-1240b254e426','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rNFRYWmtRMU5XTUc5TFMwNDRTa1Z2WVhCck1FRRAB','google','Great birthday dinner.',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7efa1b01-8cc7-4176-97d3-2d386d1a4fdf','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RNFVXcExVekZhYlhCdmNVRXpZMmhyTUVWdmRWRRAB','google','Great experience! Service staff was very friendly and accommodating! We were only there for a few cocktails but talked to ourselves into a cup of their she-crab soup, which was divine! And some pumpkin cheesecake to go which was delightful as well!',5,'2026-10-10','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1dc88b90-f8eb-4fe2-bff2-96bb642fb02e','bb1a58a4-9401-46a9-978b-74043596af1e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwNkxTSHNnRRAB','google','Omg the salad was amazing  and the crab cakes was everything  I needed ...I was craving  crab cakes and these had not to much feeling in them.',5,'2026-10-08','2026-11-12T15:35:43.230Z');
