INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d5e9173d-d75e-49c3-a5b1-f786d9f4a180','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VOXzV2YW1DMXNLVXJ3RRAB','google','This local, fresh-to-order establishment provides a nice variety of Tex-Mex style wraps, bowls, and salads. They also have a selection of desserts and offer breakfast. Layout and service is similar to Chip*tle and I found the food quality and service similar. Made-to-order can take some extra time when during a busy period (which this place is pretty popular during the 12pm rush).<br>The Tropical Chicken Bowl is a fair serving of rice, cheese, chicken, mango salsa, some lettuce, and habanero sauce. The mango salsa was very fresh and the habanero sauce was not as hot as I would have expected, so don''t be afraid of it. Flavor combinations were good and the whole experience was pleasant.',4,'2025-06-03','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d5a664c9-f253-4d32-aeba-0d7e8d6746b1','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPX2FsNVh3Nk0yZW1RRRAB','google','The food here is amazing... everyone is extremely friendly.  The owner is so nice and down to earth.',5,'2025-05-13','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
