INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('01677dfd-e7e7-4298-83aa-2bed9057b003','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJbFp6N0d3EAE','google','Must visit!! All the food is home made and cooked to perfection. Kelly, Dania and Sonia are absolutely amazing! Went above and beyond to make sure that we got exactly what we wanted!',5,'2025-04-03','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7bdf21e0-9351-4ee9-b017-ed44322e642a','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3bmF5R0Z3EAE','google','Man hands down the best rap ever……veggie rap with avocado',5,'2025-03-20','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6d819ebb-71bf-4e98-99cf-d491b4ea5003','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRLTVDLXBnRRAB','google','The food was great. The food looked to be made from scratch. They were fire roasting poblanos when I was there and was told it was for the special. I foolishly forgot to ask what the special was. I had a breakfast burrito which was delicious and fresh. Choices for toppings were typical but not many. I really enjoyed the food and will be back when I am in the area.',4,'2025-03-14','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('84691d45-fa5c-47b9-a1c3-04f274436d02','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRMnRUM3VRRRAB','google','I had no idea this place was here and stumbled upon it this morning. I was blown away! I can’t wait to come back and try other breakfast burritos. I hope you have lots of success!',5,'2025-03-03','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7716e1fd-282d-4c91-937b-fd9d61e464e0','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURncTdXd3dnRRAB','google','A very very peaceful, clean environment, the servers are very friendly with positive attitude something you don''t commonly get getting a quick meal or for your lunch break. No long wait, great selection on all meals of the day, I have a egg chiro spinach burrito with green red sauce guacamole with spinach and this is by far the best breakfast burrito I had for a long time. It''s very filling and I am gonna start recommending and inviting friends, family, lover here. Thank you so much',5,'2025-02-27','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('712fd746-b427-4956-89be-5f95c2753e7f','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfaGMtVG1BRRAB','google','Best burritos in town!!',5,'2025-01-25','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e972e0be-ebb0-4a53-b8c1-227305a4ad3d','a7eb92e0-f838-49d6-a5f8-2a08eed81308','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2eTRuQkdBEAE','google','Food: amazing, massive overstuffed burritos, full of flavor.<br><br>Service: super friendly, hardly any wait.<br><br>Atmosphere: quaint, but it''s a shop that clearly was designed for grab-n-go, so not a ton of effort was put into it. Instead they put that effort into delicious food',5,'2024-12-14','2026-11-12T15:37:17.443Z');
