INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dd800e3b-9002-4a50-8099-d2839a8601f4','03f670a6-33b3-4453-bd84-7589b95ff97d','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oblZUVldkV1pKU0Vzd1NWRXlNMlptUWpJdFNGRRAB','google','Food is so good and reasonably priced. Our son, who attended UVA, brought us here once while he was attending. We were recently in town for something else, and came again. Ordered the chicken special with the corn on the cob, got some of their cornbread, and some plantains, some sweet potatoes. It is just so good. I love this kind of place. Not fancy, reasonably priced, and amazing food. My wife likes to sprinkle a little sugar on her plantains. They don''t have sugar packets out for some reason, only Splenda. I remember this from the first time we ate there too. We asked the people who brought out the food for some, and they brought us a little cupful without question. Really can''t recommend this place enough.',5,'2026-11-11','2026-11-12T15:59:03.039Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('12820b29-95f4-41ae-bc8a-fc569aba33cb','bc6af3d1-40b8-413e-8cba-e3c0dea231ff','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25weUxWTlBkSFYyVTNVM1ZuQkZkekpzTW1VMVIyYxAB','google','First time at Sticks and thought the overall was pretty good, but was deserving of an A-OK category.<br><br>Ordering is at the counter. Service was excellent and very friendly. Price seemed a bit steep in my opinion.<br><br>I had the chicken and beef kebobs which were the stronger parts of the meal. The pita bread was good, salad was fresh, but rice was meh and the egg plant was cold and pretty much not edible.<br><br>I probably would not return with stronger options in town.',3,'2026-07-22','2026-11-12T15:59:03.007Z');
