INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('afd8c560-3501-4982-b4c5-99b47e4e990c','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCWFpXRnVabXhmTUMxelZERmxNV3BRU20xWU1uYxAB','google','Sooooo Refreshing!',5,'2025-10-18','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a8a3616b-ef96-4767-9ec5-47cf0aac69b5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pacFgzUTVVazFxTkRWRGNEVk5VR2R1UmpWelpYYxAB','google','Food tastes great, people are nice, clean place. Problem is, I''m spending 60 dollars at least for 3 meals and we are being served scalding hot soup in disposable plastic bowls. The workers are cooking with plastic crackpot liners. All of this plastic that comes under high heat is going straight in to your body and you get xenoestrogens and cancer from these types of practices. Plastic under heat leaches chemicals in to your food. Please serve with real bowls and stop using plastic crackpot liners.',1,'2025-10-04','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7516b40e-4115-43e7-a3bd-549e08e0c194','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkdFptdDZja1pqZWtObmFtRlliRk54Y0RVMlNVRRAB','google','Food consistently delicious! Boba house milk tea is the best and love the poke bowls. Staff is friendly and remembers my family from visit to visit. Agree with other reviewers. A true gem!',5,'2025-09-29','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6ddd5df4-aa9f-4661-8e1e-2c6ba50d310b','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFMlVIWkJSakpDYmtaNlJDMXBNMEpOWVVwWVVrRRAB','google','The fried chicken here is SO good! The outside is perfectly crispy and crunchy, while the inside stays juicy and flavorful. Every bite has such a satisfying crunch, and you can tell a lot of care goes into making the food delicious. It’s the kind of fried chicken that leaves you wanting more after every bite! Definitely a great choice if you’re craving something crispy, savory, and comforting. I’d absolutely recommend trying it!',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d19c9154-53d0-426c-a3c5-5d62fbfbda4d','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wSlMzUm5aVzFFU2tKdGF5MXlWSGt6U0ZKSE9VRRAB','google','The atmosphere here is super cute, cozy, and comfortable! It’s such a welcoming place to relax and enjoy a good meal. The ramen was absolutely delicious, with rich flavors that made every bite so satisfying. It’s definitely the perfect comfort meal, especially on a cold day or whenever you’re craving something warm and tasty. Between the cozy vibes and amazing food, I’d definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a great dining experience!',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8d3a3aa7-dd44-4ce6-a5d1-2b2858214710','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wdlR6aEZRUzFsVUd3MGNsTTRNemxyYUMxVk5WRRAB','google','Their food is always on point, and the employees are always smiling and very sweet. LOVE this place! 💜',5,'2026-10-01','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b2fcc6a9-22f1-4917-aad9-73690970abdb','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wcFluWkZSV0prUTA5MFV6SnBOblV6VkY5TlpuYxAB','google','Domoishi has a new owner, and you can really tell there’s been a positive change! The food was fresh, flavorful, and well prepared, and the service was friendly and welcoming. Everything came out quickly and tasted great. It’s nice to see the new ownership putting so much effort into the place. Definitely worth giving Domoishi a try — I’ll definitely be back!',5,'2026-09-19','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7c255d10-2ce4-4354-bd20-c67a469995a4','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213M2RVUnpVM1kwYURSbk5Yb3pibUU1UkRnMlpGRRAB','google','Yesterday, I ordered the Mango Chicken for the "Rice Dish Special" along with a side of French fries. The mango chicken was seasoned really well (sauce was addicting) and the rice perfectly complemented it! The French fries were crispy and were a great side. I also got the honey mango smoothie with strawberry boba, which actually tasted like fruit + the boba was perfectly sweet! Highly recommend if you''re craving comforting Asian food :)',5,'2026-09-11','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f7303072-ee6d-495c-8c38-4be543008ce0','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnek1WWjBNMHAxUTFSeFNscHRZa0psYlRodWJFRRAB','google','Really average, high school workers. Friendly and that''s not common and I appreciate them. However, the orange chicken I got was worse than mall chicken. The breading was still wet inside, chewy, stringy chicken, just like not good at all. Next time I''d go to Peking across the street, spend the same amount money and get ACTUAL chicken instead of whatever the heck THAT was. I get that it''s just a Chinese takeaway, but can you use real chicken? Can ya fry it? Fracking frustrating when you stop to buy dinner because you''re on the go and it''s inedible.',1,'2026-09-01','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3dc33ab9-2167-4847-8b61-2a7fd5c9b5cc','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvMVkzQXhSM2x0TVRScWRuTlhSMGcxVlhacmNrRRAB','google','Cute place, good food with a helpful and friendly staff. Have come here many times!',4,'2026-07-30','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9aa1ab48-1bc4-4a5e-a400-1c47268a7cc4','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1RllWSnliRnB2V25Oak1EVTJjMU0yYkVRNVFVRRAB','google','Just picked up lunch. Was ready fast but the food was so bad. Got buy one get one free crab Rangoon but it does not deserve to be called that it is 99% cream cheese I struggled to find a single fleck of crab in my rangoons. I threw the second order away. Also ordered the Korean fried chicken wings which were extremely crunchy yes but it’s bc they were wildly overcooked. The wings didn’t have much meat on the bone but the meat that was there was so dry and hard. A good Korean double fry should still be juicy on the inside. Additionally I ordered the spicy wings and they just tasted like regular soy garlic. Didn’t eat much of those either. Wings don’t hold a candle to bonchon.<br><br>All in all a complete waste of money.',1,'2026-07-07','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e2c6d6b4-8a1a-4014-a849-9bda5d27c447','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wNE5rb3hPVW8zYVUxelJFTmxTMjh5ZVZOcFpWRRAB','google','I’m just confused! This was $17. Not a hint of flavor anywhere',1,'2026-04-15','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('69f2b915-e75f-4cdd-b0db-c4f782a287c5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twQ1dVOUNTRFF6ZW5WUk9HSjVaVFozVlRSQ1ptYxAB','google','Ordered the Thai chicken bowl and the chicken looked nothing like the picture. The chicken was completely dried out and hard to eat. It was barely sauce. I truly could just eat the white rice that was in there but I spent $13 for what seems like old food.',2,'2026-04-08','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0e3c8bb8-a8b5-4300-befc-8ac06e3616c1','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOSk4zbFNSbkZZYmpoa00xSjRWakIyY1VoU2EyYxAB','google','Not good bordering on bad.<br>Tried the pork ramen - gross, broth was thin with no flavor, meat was dry, noodles have no bite; cheese rangoon - can''t call it crab Rangoon when there was not a single atom of surimi in it; Korean bbq wings - ordered spicy, they are not. They in fact have very little flavor at all. Taro bubble tea is fine, but the boba have almost no chew.<br>Next time I''ll just make a packet ramen instead.',2,'2026-04-08','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7afccac7-8291-4a35-be77-bb60916e93d0','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psS1MwMTBOVEIyVTB4cE1YaE5PR0Y2Y1ZwdGIxRRAB','google','First time Customer I got a delivery order overall was not bad at first glance,  I was under the impression that they had forgotten an ingredient, which was the egg that I had added to my bowl however I then found it, BUT I’m afraid to even eat it which then made me not want to eat the rest of the bowl because my egg is brown. I’ve never seen a hard boiled egg that is brown and that does not sit well with me. No thank you. will not be ordering from here again trust the smoothies, not the food and then again may not even trust the smoothies anymore.',1,'2026-04-02','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d6bd6cca-e8bf-4261-bd1d-1833ffb34bb5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oRFRtTm9aM2MyZWpBMFkwUndOVVJoU0hsTVVuYxAB','google','Great food best in area, I''ve had all of the chinese restaurants nearby and they don''t compare. Nice dine in area. The food taste very high quality, even better than dine in restaurants I''ve been to.',5,'2026-03-07','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6aacca44-c357-4750-9780-88eebbc58d27','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKNFNFMVVjVFJ3TWpSQ1JrSnZha05CUzFrMFdXYxAB','google','The customer service was horrible the good wasn’t so fresh at this location',1,'2026-02-25','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7ffc49a5-e9f5-425e-a97a-2b00f99a7b52','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sVVRrRlBZVkJZYjA1a09ETTVhak5ST1haemNHYxAB','google','Poorly-run operation that cancelled my Doordash order 50 minutes AFTER they accepted the order.',1,'2025-11-15','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9f28079a-853c-4300-a2a0-f5231f7713bd','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wclJVVjNNRmRyYTNwTlJEQndUbGREZFZwSVJuYxAB','google','On our way back from UVA, saw this place when we were heading over to I 64, food was surprisingly good! Ramen broth was very flavorful and portion was quite generous. Rolls and sushi were good too. Worthy of coming back. Service was quick but decoration was so so, anyway good food is most important, right?',4,'2026-11-04','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf662237-33b2-4cfa-913b-196f09b3720e','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRGNGRm1ibVpPZFdFMU1VbHFha2t3U2pSSE1sRRAB','google','Only thing I could say is the food comes out pretty slow, ramen has good large portions and the tonkatsu broth was clean',3,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20be561b-bc19-461c-83fc-6185dae535c3','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25neE5UVmtUblJxVVVScUxWSlFUbFIyUWxwWlVGRRAB','google','The mama noodles were wuite literally just an instant ramen pack. The toppings they gove are very few i had three tiny shrimps and three bok choy. I paid $16 for a instant ramen pack that would cost 99 cents otherwise while also waiting almost 2-3 hours for it to come out. We were the only table. They took a long time to bring out drinks and appetizers. The shumai i ordered was $10 and there were four tiny obviously microwaved shumai. The food others at my table got was very basic and should not have taken two hours to come out. There are way better places to go that wont make you wait two hours and isnt expensive for being worth nothing.',1,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eff10cdb-bc2a-41a2-a73f-9f4a672177a9','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSSU5FVmFlV3g2YVVSZmFHdFdhMVJJTnkxeWFGRRAB','google','Was very excited to eat here for the first time. There is a lot on the menu and I was having trouble deciding. I wasn’t sure what some things were and I felt rushed by the server. Ended up ordering teriyaki chicken noodles, bc my husband told the waiter that’s what I’d have. I was not excited for that, and it wasn’t very good. The chicken was gamey and the noodles were bland. The teriyaki sauce was delicious. The presentation was very good. Edamame was good, California roll was good. I believe my husband enjoyed his pork mushu dish. The server was kind, just didn’t allow for time to read the menu or ask questions.',4,'2026-10-30','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('81f4fa8d-ee32-4b5c-a72e-37a350334c32','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTFJqTXRWRFZ3VFZwV1JtbzNMWEJoVG5VdFVXYxAB','google','The spicy salmon roll was a good size 8 pcs hearty pieces  beautiful presentation.  The vegetarian spicy miso ramen is large very filling great flavor hearty perfect.',5,'2026-10-21','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('55a9f73a-7db7-4b73-90cd-9cf8a4859dbc','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkNVluUTFhekEwYkZkVFQyeEViVXhEZGpsZlpGRRAB','google','I want to updated my review in hopes that more people check this place out. The atmosphere is very nice and the food is delicious. The ramen comes with lots of toppings, the sushi is excellent, and the prices are very fair. I’ve also tried some of the appetizers and other entrees, always satisfied.',5,'2026-10-14','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('40a18368-3bb6-46a5-8ccd-19341a3ac270','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21NelEweE5jVXBGT0hka09IZzBWRzFLUTFKTFRFRRAB','google','Ordered tonkotsu ramen and the chashu was lean, tough and dry. I don’t think it was pork belly. It was a bit of a disappointment.',2,'2026-10-11','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('99421bf4-d16f-40d1-974f-4e8a9a6e7c1d','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4eFQyVk1ObVYzTmw5eGRsSXdTbmRWWWtOSmMyYxAB','google','Sashimi was tasteless and texture wasn’t right. Seems like it might have been thawed more than once. Yellowtail was mushy and completely flavorless. I took a few bites but threw the rest out. I’ve never done that before. The fried rice and Katsu were decent. Don’t serve sushi if you can’t prepare it properly. Don’t thaw it too quickly or let it sit for too long. We just moved here and I guess I’ll have to look somewhere else for my sushi. I sure hope one of these places can do it right. Wegmans grab and go does a better job and is more affordable. 🤷‍♀️',2,'2026-10-05','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('42070e4f-8c70-4e90-a5bc-2f298726cc6c','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWNFZtWTRSRUoyWXpOeldtZDRTa3R2ZGxabGVtYxAB','google','Tonkotsu Ramen and Sashimi appetizer were delicious.',5,'2026-09-20','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0ae26336-3f38-4f66-a486-2f8c172ce1b3','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214aFUwNVJURzB6WjNWeVR6WXpZVkZ2VFRaTFptYxAB','google','Me and my boyfriend went here for dinner, we both got waters, I got mine with lemon and he didn’t. I notice my water had a lot of specs in it but I assumed it was from the lemon, I then noticed his water also had some specs but he didn’t have a lemon, upon further examination I noticed what seemed to be a tape worm in his water that was moving. I got photos and videos. Left immediately.',1,'2026-09-18','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('658b27eb-2df2-435f-890c-283064646655','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rM01WTmFXSFZQTFhGaU9WcEJNVkV6VlZJd0xXYxAB','google','Uses generative AI',1,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('25104245-dd5f-4402-a56d-28231da0aaec','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Rd01uTTNiazlPY1hwdFRqbEpiVzFtTUc5MVIzYxAB','google','I found this place a few years ago when I first started coming to Charlottesville and it''s a frequent lunch stop for me. I love the food and I used to love the atmosphere. But now their tables are plastered in these cheesy images and their desert menu is blatant ai.<br>What even is Cheess or Grcham crackers??<br>The food is fantastic but the atmosphere is no longer here and it''s very saddening as a regular. I''m not sure l''ll be back with the way it currently is. Still fantastic food, but really a shame.',2,'2026-08-21','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3900686c-4c4b-45a9-8e4a-822ac75c4b5f','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM2QwUXpWMTlLYzBacVJHWlRXVkIwU2tGc2RYYxAB','google','Siempre que voy, buenas experiencias. La comida está rica, a lo mejor no recomendaría tanto el poke bowl, pero los platos con arroz y el ramen están muy ricos, al igual que el entrante crab rangoon. Siempre que he ido me han atendido muy bien, y aunque es verdad que normalmente me lo pido para llevar, las veces que comí allí el servicio fué muy amable y atento.',4,'2025-10-22','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('832eb195-ebd2-4229-81af-45c17d60453c','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaYWEzZHhZbFF5WlZOelRtSlZaWEpaWkZaNFJsRRAB','google','Did not deliver a boba straw with boba unable to even drink it. Store is unable to be called. Do not order from here.',1,'2025-10-02','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('39d0d8c8-29b2-4e50-bf00-c31917d67632','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SV2MyNUtTVFIzTTAxbWIyZHlSMEZ4VWs5NWFGRRAB','google','Amount of meat and toppings has significantly decreased in the past year.  I was specifically disappointed in the amount of salmon.  If I''m paying $20 I should be getting something. And the toppings did not make up for it.  This used to be my favorite place to go.  I''ll try again later at this location -- hoping it''s a one-off.',3,'2025-08-18','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e69cf996-f696-41e9-9c00-b87f7f942bb5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Oa2JIcFVZbVJsY0dSWGFYSkhPVVpHVlhOQ1oyYxAB','google','is a good place to sever very nice food and milk tea',5,'2025-05-25','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('18beb566-05ef-440f-916f-490c608b56bb','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VOR21yWktMczV2UGNBEAE','google','First time at this location and I felt so awkward and disappointed. I walked in on the whole team eating lunch, which is fine but they seemed confused and annoyed. I put in an order for a taro drink with no boba and add a snow cap. One of the gentlemen began speaking with the woman in their native language and was very confused by the no boba. I heard them saying boba and snow cap over and over again. He then made my drink with plain boba and added one small spoonful of snow cap. It''s usually an inch thick at other places. Like it''s barely enough to taste if I mix it in. Not coming back to this location anytime soon.',1,'2025-05-06','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c69ec2a1-6039-46ef-a329-468dbaa96f38','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNveU5iYmpBRRAB','google','Whenever I am in the mood for ramen or a poke bowl, I typically dine at Domoishi near downtown, as they consistently serve high-quality food. I especially enjoy their crab rangoon, which is generously filled with cheese. However, when it comes to milk teas, I prefer visiting their Midlothian location, as it offers a better selection and overall experience.',4,'2025-04-14','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fc7ee0ef-8a34-42c9-8cd1-b2197d6ac8fb','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJcnVTQ0RnEAE','google','We ordered two bowls with 3x scoops of protein for delivery for $17.50 each. The bowls arrived less than half full, with what appears to be less than one scoop of protein in each. We were very disappointed but thankfully GrubHub gave us a partial refund (no thanks to Domoishi). Maybe they give you more if you order it in the restaurant, but we will not be ordering from here again.',1,'2025-04-09','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('97c234af-f1ee-46cd-941e-16e52348fbe5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJZ0pxODB3RRAB','google','If you get food here, prepare to be disappointed. Not sure if it changed ownership or they just don’t care anymore, but less and less food have been put in the poke bowls over the course of the last few years. An order of the salmon in the poke used to be a nice size scoop - now it’s 5 tiny pieces if we’re lucky. And adding cilantro on top shouldn’t be 2 pieces of cilantro stems. We used to get it multiple times a week but it’s gotten so much worse recently. We’ll be looking for better bowls elsewhere for good.',1,'2025-04-06','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('975ea875-42ce-474c-91fd-ad31a20d9eeb','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnaWMyT1dnEAE','google','Why did I have to wait 15 minutes to get a side of sushi rice ? There was no one in line ahead of me. The people that ordered after me got their food first ? WHY?!!!',1,'2025-02-25','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e2df0734-7b58-43fa-85f0-7b12247053c5','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfeTlQeUlBEAE','google','Food was great, but I didn''t see the option to get garlic oil in my ramen. I should have asked, but didn''t think about it till later. Good sized portions!',4,'2025-01-27','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4aaffe47-c35d-4924-b92b-d928f344f8ef','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQdWVtMXJnRRAB','google','Have gotten takeout a 3 times to give this place a few chances, but it’s always less than satisfactory. Rice is often hard, the chicken has been cool in the middle, the ramen is often water downed, and the teas are overly sweet with over cooked boba. The staff is always welcoming and nice, but it doesn’t compensate for the quality of the food unfortunately.',2,'2024-12-03','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20ab103a-730f-4a3e-95c8-9adb67f0f933','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNINnF5WDZBRRAB','google','This place is so cool! I love all the different options for food and beverages. The ramen I got was delicious and the chicken wings top tier. You order from a screen and the food comes out super quick!! Friendly service and very clean 10/10 recommend',5,'2024-09-03','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c07d1a52-bc5c-43d6-b081-ceb4dfe4b9f2','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3aHBMRkFREAE','google','Food is good but the chubby asian man is rude ! I asked for all flats which i have plenty of times before and was not given all flats and was brushed off. Asked for more ketchup was told its in the bag. Wont be returning',2,'2024-08-23','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3d6473ae-9a0d-47be-9d96-e81ea874e2eb','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNicW9LZzZBRRAB','google','DRIVE TO ANOTHER LOCATION, domoishi isn’t even a bad company this location is just bad, the bowls are smaller but they are the same price. There’s flies everywhere and the food is uncovered. The server tried to tell me they had no owner, no manager, no contact information for either person and then tried to convince me the store number was the managers number. Just go to a different one or a completely different restaurant',1,'2024-07-25','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d77a8a53-a5b1-4c52-bfbf-b2646df4b7dc','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyME1DZEJ3EAE','google','The thai milk tea was good, and if I ever returned I would only try their drinks. The food is not good, I ordered the sesame chicken and rice and the chicken was dry with no sauce. My boyfriend couldn''t finish his meal because the chicken was so dry and low quality. I''d avoid the food at all cost, but I think the drinks are worth trying and if I was just rating the teas I would''ve given a much higher review. Customer service is also very lacking, and with service AND the food being bad, I won''t be going out of my way to come back.',2,'2024-07-13','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('29348d6d-035d-4bb9-9afc-6d456bc4e35e','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURMalBLbmdBRRAB','google','Tried to place take-out order online and the website is glitching. Tried to call and a voice came up that said “Mary Ramen” and rang to a voicemail that was a personal number for a male. Went in to order and wait; when I walked in the smell of very old grease hit me. There was no one there dining or waiting and nothing happening except 2 people that were leaning against the counter and chatting. Did not acknowledge my presence while I placed order on kiosk and stood to wait. Handed me my food after a few minutes with no words, even after I said thank you.<br>They obviously don’t want anyone’s business and I will not return.',1,'2024-06-25','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9e39dd17-fd81-4aba-bde0-e12a46eba164','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6d3B6Q2h3RRAB','google','Prices displayed on menu DO NOT match the price displayed on order kiosk. This over sight should be addressed and can be viewed as false advertisement. Example: Milk Tea served WITH honey boba on menu board says $5.75 but the ordering kiosk shows 5.99 and an additional .75 cents to add boba.<br>This oversight is the same for the food.<br>Inside the store the floor needs to be swept.',1,'2024-06-08','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('92653a6f-89a4-469b-9ab7-a28d0b04cff6','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGb1JDMWZaMlZvUlZKU1pHNVpNRXRhYW5ob2RWRRAB','google','I''ve been a few times before, it''s about 75mi from home, and every time it''s been wonderful. My sister and I went tonight and I had tori shoyu ramen and a spicy kani roll, she had the ramen soup and tiramisu. Food was incredible, service was prompt, atmosphere very relaxed. I always recommend it to friends when they visit cville. Thank you!<br>Gochisousama deshita. Mata kimasu!',5,'2026-08-09','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('51f6f5ef-c93a-4a91-b3fe-dd07bb36a5c7','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201TFVWQjJOSGRGYzFWc1pteGFja2N4T1RKQmNGRRAB','google','Was craving ramen and my partner had never had anything off a Japanese menu besides sushi, so we tried Mashumen. We got the karaage chicken and pork and shrimp shumai to start and they were delicious. The karaage was especially good, well seasoned and with a very light & krispy coating. The shumai also had multiple little shrimp per dumpling, which was a treat considering they usually have tiny pieces or one little shrimp placed on top. He also got a spicy tuna roll and enjoyed that as well. For ramen, we got the tonkatsu and shoyu ramen. The tonkatsu was the clear winner, the broth was extremely savory and flavorful as you would expect for tonkatsu. I was a little disappointed that the chashu pork was actually pork neck or pork shoulder instead of pork belly but it was very tender and easy to eat (and as a leaner cut of meat probably has broader appeal). Overall the ramen was one of the most delicious meals I’ve had in a long time. I would also eat an entire bowl of the karaage chicken left to my own devices.<br><br>We’d decided to try this spot because they seemed to have larger portions, lower prices, and a broader menu than another local spot, so I think the compromise on the cut of meat selection is probably worth it if you want a very solid meal or want to be able to try a broad variety of foods without breaking the budget. Everything we ordered, plus a Thai iced coffee and a Ramune cost $72 including tax.<br><br>The server who waited on us was also very sweet, and we visited during lunch (on a Saturday) and it wasn’t very busy, which made parking easy and dining very relaxing. We’ll definitely be back.',5,'2026-07-26','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('28e9c79a-506f-44d3-813a-0642583b8770','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205UGJEUlZWRUZxZUVWS1oyUlJTWGhITTFGdmVWRRAB','google','California rolls lil  two plain any meaning of option for spicy mayo and put a little more stuff in it overall it was pretty okay',4,'2026-07-22','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1a160f31-b30b-46aa-812a-6fa2df066f53','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwNWJVaEpkbDlxVTNwV1QySmFUbE0wUmtZMGExRRAB','google','I have to recommend the signature dish here - went with a group of friends and found the atmosphere to be familial and welcoming and the food to be fab. Our server was kind and answered our questions with ease. Would come again without a doubt!',4,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3d5dea7e-616f-4b5b-bcb2-5713d493b716','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t3NWExcGxNRE5WWWpWcFRFbEtVRXc1UW1STU1XYxAB','google','Best ramen you can get in the area',5,'2026-06-12','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8d843dd8-454f-4df7-9328-1a008f95167e','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GamFuUTJiRzlvYlU5MWNEUm5TbFphV1cweFRVRRAB','google','Food was delicious',5,'2026-06-10','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('00abde80-4fed-4c40-a1b2-8c9020996a1e','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaS00yWjZSMEkwZEVwRWRXOVlUMU5CYVROb1RrRRAB','google','I LOVE THIS SPOT.  SINCE I WAS PUT ON ABOUT THIS PLACE.  I HAVE ADDED THEM TO MY "GO TO" ASIAN RESTAURANTS.  THEY ARE VERY ACCOMMODATING AND PROMPT.  THE FOOD IS HOT, DELICIOUS, AND SERVED WITH A SMILE!!  IF IN THE AREA....CHECK THEM OUT!!!  NEMO ALWAYS GIVE YOU A REASON TO TIP WELL!! 😍🤗',5,'2026-05-26','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5f177ab1-1c56-4a84-b897-4611259cb833','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tweWNGVkNSR3MwYzA1bFNXTnpWMDFRVUdoWlEwRRAB','google','The ramen was super good and the service was on point. Definitely would recommend.',5,'2026-05-05','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('600de7fb-85fb-49ac-afed-5646e7b3e5c0','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKNUxUWnNVV3RKWTNoRWFtazRia0V0ZG0wdFdFRRAB','google','Always tasty with timely service. 👍',5,'2026-05-03','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6474c951-c9ab-426d-a79f-a27c11c17ef2','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sNWNuWlNRVmd0VEhWa1NIZDJTRlZLWkZKQ1ZHYxAB','google','Approaching authentic Japanese food, I like that they don''t add a lot of sugar to satisfy American palettes.  Watch out for extra surcharge (4.5%!) for using your credit card.  They expect you to read an essay about the charge (they call it a cash discount), so its not like I wasn''t warned, but its not clear and honestly a bit deceptive.  The price on the menu should be the maximum price you pay.',4,'2026-05-02','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('98d4de9a-5cc4-4769-9856-ace21b92385a','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tjeFQwRndTRFpOVWs5WVQybENRWFZTVUdoc1NHYxAB','google','Hands down best ramen in town! And love the service and team there they are so attentive!',5,'2026-04-30','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1e629e88-566e-4214-a889-97928d6e82db','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkelRXWjJTRlZpYnpKWmVqaFJiVVpIU3pkVFNXYxAB','google','Great place to have a bite to eat.',5,'2026-03-23','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2a8eaade-d71e-4d32-a5bc-fec08eb73f4a','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xweFZYUXhabWwyUW1sZmNtMUNNM3ByUlRsRFFsRRAB','google','Very good food and service',5,'2026-03-23','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d5f1a1ca-c532-43fe-a91d-65125913dfb2','3786b059-aa0d-486c-96b3-28bcf399b7ac','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25FeE5HUmphekowU0ZsS2IxRXhZa3BQWjNKaWIwRRAB','google','I was traveling south I64 and searched for a Ramen place near an exit in Charlottesville and with good reviews. This was absolutely the best Ramen I have ever had. The portion was huge and had enough left for 2 more meals when I got home. They had lots of options for extra toppings too. More than I''ve seen at other ramen restaurants. The hostess was very nice. The restaurant was nice and clean. When I go that way again, I will be stopping there for more Ramen. I had Tonkatsu ramen with several added vegetables. I had eaten at 2 different Ramen restaurants the prior week and they were good but did not compare to Mashumen. It was only expensive because I ordered so many extra vegetables.',5,'2026-03-11','2026-11-12T15:59:12.165Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6a59896f-6ee3-4695-9f27-df2da0259b53','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sbE5WcE5PVVpvYTBkRExXdHRTSE5sTmpSeGNVRRAB','google','I can''t say enough good things about our visit to Tavola.  We arranged a private family dinner in the Stanza Mezzo room upstairs and it was the perfect size for our group of 10 to have an intimate dinner where no one was yelling across the room or bumping elbows with the person next to them.  The staff were excellent at keeping the courses coming and managing everyone being able to place their orders for later courses and for drinks.  And I saw very very few plates not get pretty much licked clean by our guests (one said, verbatim, "I forgot how much I like artichokes!" after having the Carciofi.)  Their downstairs also looked warm and comfortable for smaller parties, so if we''re back in Charlottesville just looking for a place for dinner I would love to sit in for their full menu and regular service too!',5,'2026-11-07','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f302a6b4-4f49-46a5-9bbd-218915f050c1','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5clNHUkNlRll6TVVWclIwSnNlbTVVVG5KT1pGRRAB','google','Our party of four had dinner here on a Thursday evening.  They were very busy so reservations are a must.<br>Ambiance was lively but not over the top loud.<br>Service was good...our server made good recommendations but didn''t accept any requests for switching pastas.  We just got the impression she wasn''t thrilled to be a work that night.<br>Food was amazing.  The fusilli, pappardelle, and bucatini were delicious.  Great sauces.  The pork entree was also very good.  Artichokes and mussels were great starters.<br><br>Overall, a very good experience. Definitely plan on returning next time we are in town.',5,'2026-10-27','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d520c90-578e-42eb-8379-ee9f51c04238','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20weGRXaGtNR3hqY1V0NlUyZENRVEV5TVc0M2QxRRAB','google','Beth helped me get a table for one and I appreciate that!  Very pleasant and came by the table.  Theona was the exceptional server who made great recommendation and is knowledgeable about wine, as she said learning from the sommelier.  The house marinated olives were outstanding as was the beet and goat cheese salad.  The eggplant was very good and the Tiramisu was so smooth and moist!  To top it all off, the music was very relaxing and a nice volume.  The Old Fashioned was smooth and served with orange slice and my favorite black cherries.  It was a wonderful dinner and the staff was outstanding and welcoming.',5,'2026-10-26','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('39c63f45-7ab2-4dba-b141-5e187459e498','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WbloxZERVbTFVWjNSUlQzVXRiVVZLWDB0MVZXYxAB','google','Loved this place. All the pasta dishes were great, the artichokes were delicious, the cocktails and cheesecake were great. Definitely will go back',5,'2026-10-25','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5c6f1794-3787-40bd-bfba-950af9e60fe0','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVNVdYcHpWVEpHY1dOaFpFcGpZbWwxVVZVMFdIYxAB','google','Updating since we had another great visit in October 2026. Amazing ambiance and service!<br><br>Perfect if you love seafood/mussels! Sat at the bar when I went on my first visit and had wonderful service from Bri! Made for a perfect experience, and it was an easy decision to add Tavola to our date night dinner rotation.',5,'2026-10-18','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('79424099-0867-4980-8282-8237a7168271','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5aFpHbDRXSE5TTW5VMWRVRllNa1pVWlRBMWRHYxAB','google','The food was adequate, but nothing that would make me hurry back. The tiramisu was very good and was the highlight of the meal, though it didn’t strike me as homemade.<br><br>I was also put off by the automatic 18% gratuity. The restaurant promotes paying its staff a living wage, but adding a mandatory gratuity still leaves customers paying what feels like a required tip. To me, that undercuts the message and makes the extra charge frustrating. Overall, a decent meal with excellent tiramisu, but not an experience I’d rush to repeat.',2,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('85f56f31-2f4c-47f4-8c01-4bf7ad63d01f','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GS1MySXdTSFJRVnpKQ2RqTXhUVTFHTW5KaFNrRRAB','google','Everything here is delicious. The capellini gamberi “raucci” and cotoletta di maiale alla milanese are the type of meals you keep dreaming about, and try to recreate at home but just can''t do it. Great cocktail and mocktail menu. The atmosphere and service is wonderful. Great for date night or a family dinner. Definitely a gem within the Charlottesville food scene.',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1e65ac90-80c0-403b-8152-4990f95f89a4','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSZk1YQklSV1ZaV1ZjMmVuUkZURUU1ZFZvd1JtYxAB','google','I cannot recommend this restaurant more. When we come to Charlottesville twice a year, we never miss eating at Tavola. We had an exceptional experience last night. Tiffany was our waitress and she was the best. We enjoyed the burrata, cheese board, bucatini, and pappardelle. They make their espresso martini with *fresh* espresso — a must. We got to meet the chef for the first time. He actually owns the restaurant. It’s great that this is a family-owned business. You can really tell when it comes to the quality of food served and the phenomenal service provided. My one recommendation is that there be more champagne options on the wine menu. We got to enjoy a bottle of Laurent Perrier, but this was the only option.',5,'2026-10-10','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c223c160-13b7-4194-b28d-bbc4a3191f6c','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSaVFUbHNObnBoTUZWT09YTTFPV2hFVFRoVWRrRRAB','google','My wife and I dined at the bar celebrating her birthday last week. Amanda took care of us, and gave us an amazing experience. The food was spectacular, as was the service!<br>Thanks for helping us celebrate an awesome night in Charlottesville!',5,'2026-10-04','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('258b4a40-7d90-4969-b785-4deb55ad5c37','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGT01FOUhNMFp1Y21KT1pUQkdhMDh6TVc4NVkxRRAB','google','Great food! Loved dining here and trying the menu. Also had some great wine recommendations from Sophia. Will definitely be dining here again.',5,'2026-10-04','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0d11356b-85fb-4c15-b4ea-04711559c8af','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CSWIybEJPR3BvUkRVd2R6bEhjbTVHZWpWdmRIYxAB','google','Really good handmade Italian food, fresh ingredients. The kind of place where the specials are written on the wall.  Warm atmosphere, friendly service, and a menu that feels authentic without being predictable. Absolutely worth a visit.',5,'2026-09-23','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ff474a28-210a-4273-8ddd-f0e8089fc6ca','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNMmVGSkJZazFVVlV0RVVERmtWeTFFU2kxWGVYYxAB','google','20% added to all bills and then want you to tip more.  Price your menu to pay your staff.',1,'2026-09-22','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('03ed8dd0-c38a-4489-9f2c-ac0b7f0bef8e','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOd2JVMWFVM2hxUVZkc00ybGFaa2RXTVRSSWQxRRAB','google','i had the pesto pasta. it was pretty good actually but why was it 35$ (service charge) when i did take out :(',3,'2026-09-11','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0e7d84cd-86c9-486f-8a43-c5ae4471abc3','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkeVluRkZaMk5qYVU5U1JWQlJlVEZZZFhOMlRuYxAB','google','Alicia and her team were phenomenal. Amazing food and  great atmosphere.',5,'2026-09-06','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7344a7fb-face-4170-a253-3a28c3196cc3','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oUVZHaHJZbk5TWjNRdFIyWTJlamRxYlc1TU4zYxAB','google','Boston Market is a better experience. Super loud, not great food. Very expensive for what you get.',1,'2026-09-03','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('376d2f92-b32c-42e6-8661-a381be95dfcb','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psSGNEWnNjRk0xUkZOSmNXbFpabGhRV1dJeVpWRRAB','google','I have celebrated multiple birthdays at Tavola Vino, and it has become one of the Charlottesville restaurants I trust most for a special occasion. The kitchen produces the kind of food quality that is difficult to find outside much larger restaurant cities, and the service makes it clear that the entire team is personally invested in the experience, not just the meal.<br><br>For this visit, I reached out after not having been to Tavola in far too long to ask whether an extended tasting might be possible. Beth, the general manager, was immediately helpful. She suggested options that would let us try more of the kitchen’s work while still being thoughtful about what would be realistic for the front and back of house teams. Chef Robert then worked with Beth and the kitchen team to build a tasting that went beyond Tavola’s already excellent daily four-course menu, and it meant a lot that he came out after dinner to speak with us.<br><br>Fiona was the star of the night. It was our first time having her as our server, and we felt lucky because she was warm, flexible, and consistently attentive without ever interrupting the rhythm of the table. Sophie also added a lot to the evening through my partner’s drink pairings, and she was incredibly sweet even when we got sidetracked asking about other drinks before she could finish explaining what she had brought over.<br><br>Those small moments are what made the night feel personal. We were able to talk with the people working hard to create the experience, and that made us feel like guests rather than customers. Thank you to the whole team for making a romantic date feel so warm and welcoming. We came in with high hopes, and Tavola gave us even more than we expected. I hope to do something similar again soon.',5,'2026-08-30','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6d645298-441f-46a9-a935-663572733bb3','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxVFpFRmxaMnh2UVdoTGNtdGxOMUk1VjFNNFFuYxAB','google','Maybe it’s my tastebuds, but the food was not worth that much money. Maybe $10. They were small portions, not enough for leftovers, and it was extra to add a side of any kind.<br>Our waiter was very helpful and kind.<br>The atmosphere was ok, though where we sat was in the middle of the restaurant on a wooden floor that the chairs slide VERY easily on, and I feel like we were on a slope of uneven flooring.<br>I had higher hopes, but just because you’re expensive doesn’t mean you taste good.',2,'2026-08-26','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c30fb644-8bc8-49f5-a9b8-ae77043fedbe','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tVNWExaG9SV3ByY0VvNFVYQnpNbmhMZFdKNU0xRRAB','google','We really enjoyed our dining experience at this restaurant! The steak was excellent, and the seafood pasta was also delicious.<br>The customer service was outstanding. Our waitress was incredibly attentive, and our water was constantly refilled—those little details really made a difference.<br>The grilled shrimp was perfectly cooked, savory, and fresh, paired beautifully with arugula and sweet cherry tomatoes. The cocktails were also impressive—the gimlet was refreshing, and the espresso martini was very good.<br>Overall, this was a wonderful dining experience with great food, attentive service, and a welcoming atmosphere. I highly recommend this restaurant when visiting Charlottesville!',5,'2026-08-22','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9a21a023-571e-4fe9-b2cb-f1a585fe5baa','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21reU56WkdZM1ZxYlRGRWFXTnpSMjFNYVhrdGNFRRAB','google','Impromptu dinner at the bar on a Saturday night, and we loved everything about it. Terrific bartenders -- personable and attentive -- unpretentious atmosphere and excellent food. I had the scallops and beet risotto, absolutely delicious and the right portion size. My friend loved the bolognese she ordered. Super-glad we wandered in and I look forward to returning.',5,'2026-08-16','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('57df55f0-5e73-4996-a6f5-026b9a42f636','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CaVRHTlZibVpGTjBwNmVFSk5VamwwYXpCQ2JHYxAB','google','Excellent service and food. I got the crab meat ricotta gnocchi and it was the best pasta dish I’ve ever had. We got two appetizers, two drinks each, two entrees, and a dessert. All together after tax and 20% tip it was $155 for two people. Very nice place to visit if in town!',5,'2026-08-13','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bfb4e3f5-498d-406d-98f0-47f3dfa12c97','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbGJrbzNURE5zVW5Wb1dscEJVbEp4UW5kNGJrRRAB','google','Excellent food and service.  I was there for an educational dinner and our servers did a great job.  Tavola is one of my favorite restaurants in Charlottesville and the new second floor space is lovely.',5,'2026-08-12','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('550385f8-73fe-4eba-bfcc-78bbe88a233f','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCM1YxTlViV1pWYldkSVlscG1Va2Q2WkRSa2QyYxAB','google','Absolutely amazing food and service. Must try',5,'2026-07-30','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('813bf5ce-28c9-4c27-b01c-4d79fb787ca0','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeldXUnVRa2xJWkhaNlNGQkxRbHBpWDA5YWRVRRAB','google','Generous staff. Excellent food. Nice interior. Take the W y''all.',5,'2026-07-08','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d738b1c5-befb-47cc-87fb-4590ac3bd55e','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WSFlXdGlURE5tVDFNM01tWkNkMEpVVjJWamMyYxAB','google','We celebrated our anniversary at Tavola. We sat at the Chefs table where Beth our waitress was a delight and provided great recommendations. The food is amazing and the highlight of the evening was interacting with Olivia one of the line cooks. We will be back',5,'2026-06-28','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b8c250ee-5c91-48e1-871b-7cc3ba1c0e81','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GNk0wdElOVGRvZVZjNFQyUXRUUzA1Vkc1UVprRRAB','google','A must-visit anytime we’re in Charlottesville and craving homestyle Italian. Tavola gets it right every time- we don’t give that compliment often coming from the center of NY/NJ Italian kitchens. Really a wonderful spot whether you’re at the bar or near the kitchen.',5,'2026-06-22','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fcb13831-500c-4974-ba12-7d94ef2b63bf','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSTFVqWmFWMVZFYWxoNVVIWnVNbGRQZUhOV1dWRRAB','google','Amazing food and true seasonal rotations and specials that are unique. Recommend getting a reservation, its almost impossible to get a seat otherwise even on a week day.',5,'2026-06-21','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('38ada1f5-37d6-4b93-b367-0d553dced1e2','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wNFNXTmtVRUU1WlRCUGRUVjRkREJ1T1ZWV1NGRRAB','google','I’m very surprised. I came here for my birthday tonight, and certainly, they must have a new chef. I have been here many times, but today the food was cold and absolutely flavorless. We were a small party (3) and it wasn’t busy. The service was very great, and the vibes are always nice. The drinks were a 10, but again, the food really disappointed.',2,'2026-05-28','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4ff80bc7-9bb9-4add-9c8b-962a06d1fbd7','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paM1lqRjRaemxqU21KaVVXRjNURmhRVDI5blUyYxAB','google','Tavola has quickly turned into one of our absolute favorite places ever. I wouldn''t call it just a restaurant because it is so much more than that. The staff are so friendly and attentive - sitting at the bar has our utmost recommendation. The ability to chat with and learn about all the things that go on is truly phenomenal. We cannot recommend Tavola enough!',5,'2026-05-22','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d2060244-9f84-46e1-affb-a1c2abd38a55','0cc59bdd-4a50-489d-9918-e1939648a52f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ScmVUVXlURVpDUVRaUlNqVk5Sek5GUW1veVkzYxAB','google','Tavola Restaurant is in the beautiful neighborhood of Belmont in Charlottesville. The interior is simple, inviting . The food was delicious and service was professional and attentive .',5,'2026-05-11','2026-11-12T15:59:15.689Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0eade03c-6db1-4986-8454-b826b044863a','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaV1kzTTFRWFJGT0V0WFFVVjVhREJqT0hKNk9FRRAB','google','Wonderful variety and flavorful dishes. Savory and rich with unique presentations. Wine is wonderful with impeccable service.',5,'2026-10-24','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d100f2ee-232a-4719-b90c-c44b8c4cc765','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xZmNXRkhlVzlIY3pJM2NGVkxhbGd3YmtwbWIwRRAB','google','Everything is great. The steak dish is tender and juicy when well done, a sign of a good chef! Great mocktail menu too.',5,'2026-10-17','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b8c77a54-245a-441b-95ca-5bdc15a5a599','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJNVZGcEpOMVZzY3psNlEwNUlhR2hFZFRsdWRuYxAB','google','Great atmosphere and good size portion tapas.',4,'2026-10-03','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f19be251-1376-414f-8318-faaa179545e6','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GZmFEZExhVjlMY21OU1NETk5PRFpxYTNWcGFVRRAB','google','Mas used to be a favorite. We’ve tried to give 3 chances and every time we have the same experience. Below sub-par service, also affecting ordering. Mas used to be great, presently I would put it on par with Sedona at best.',2,'2026-09-12','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ad34b534-feb6-4a9c-90d4-3140ac3ac5fc','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKaVZEbEZaR3MxVG5sb1VrdE1jMnd6UjJSWVVVRRAB','google','All food was covered in waaaaay too much salt. The artichoke spread was too creamy. The service was exceptional. Overall too creamy and salty.',2,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6814351a-bc79-4521-beea-6b341fb3e637','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKbk9FVXlORlYyZFVwbU5GUjFTMVJ1YzJKRGFrRRAB','google','Ordered both a large and small portion of Potatas Bravas, and the small was larger than the large, and half the price.  The double bread order was 2 pieces of bread for $30.  The flavors weren’t that great, and service not good.  They had kids hamburger, but no ketchup.  Very disappointing and expensive.',2,'2026-09-04','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3352217d-c948-476d-986d-d911d958c2a6','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25NdFZVVjVOV2hOVW5WU1FYUkxOWGhrVW5OMVNHYxAB','google','Mas is an absolute gem! I have been visiting for years and have only ever had a great experience. Their space is clean and comfortable and their outdoor patio is one of my favorites in Charlottesville. The staff are incredibly friendly and knowledgeable and they add so much to the experience. If you''re looking for delicious, fresh made, and interesting food this is a must try. Their menu is diverse in flavor, portion size, and dietary needs - it is a craft your own adventure style and there truly is something for everyone. The bar program is also phenomenal; the selection of wine and liquor is perfect for the cuisine and the crafted cocktails are mind blowing. I have never been disappointed and look forward to coming here many more times.',5,'2026-08-30','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('96497d2f-2b2e-4fb8-97ef-c41d6fd2d111','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OaWNrMDNXbTVyZFc1alV6bElWbkZQYkRJeFdFRRAB','google','broccoli 🥦 very bad<br>Anchovies Bad 👎<br>Tomato etc 🍅 normal<br>Carne Asada vert Salty 🧂',2,'2026-08-08','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('282a14d2-651c-4f6f-90cf-686b966dbc88','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t3NFoybExSMDR6V0VGbVlWZ3dWRGxZZFc1emNXYxAB','google','Fair warning: this place is quite expensive if you are looking for a substantial meal - like $100 a person. They do small plates (tapas) and drinks.<br><br>The food is exceptionally good though. Every plate I had was delicious and memorable. Their wine-by-the-glass selection is only a handful of options, but every one is incredible. The pairing of the wine and tapas really hit the spot. Sitting on their outdoor patio with nice weather on the weekend was divine. Definitely will be back.',5,'2026-07-26','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('94c47f53-22b3-4577-a82e-67139c6409ad','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSdk1ubzJRVWRsWm1GcE1XazJhRXRWVTFSWFpXYxAB','google','I stopped in yesterday for dinner and sat at the bar. The food was very good, but what really stood out was the professionalism of the bartender, Amanda, I believe her name was.<br><br>I asked for two drinks and told her to use her own creativity. Each one was different, and both were equally delicious. I have to say, Amanda may make the best cocktails in all the land! Her drinks alone are worth the visit.<br><br>Highly recommend!',5,'2026-06-24','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('82225b7c-9789-4a23-a6fc-69de7ecffa91','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201TFlXTnRUbWRHVkVwRVltWkNNVVIyU213NFVrRRAB','google','Just spectacular. The Alaskan halibut transported me back in time to when I was eating fresh halibut in Seward, AK. The lamb was the best I''ve ever eaten. The Iberian ham took me back to Spain. We will be returning!',5,'2026-06-24','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bab12c0f-1d60-47e5-9bb4-75ed415909f4','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25NeVprUk9aRTlETWxWeWVEbExhMjR6UkZWR00zYxAB','google','Mas Tapas is a MUST!  My sister and her husband took me to Mas Tapas for lunch on my birthday last weekend and we had a great experience.  Staff were warm, welcoming, and thoughtful and the food was FANTASTIC.  We decided to sit at the counter so we could watch our food being prepared and had a chance to talk with the chefs.  (Mas recently opened for lunch on Fridays and Saturdays, so it wasn''t super crowded). It was really a wonderful way to celebrate my birthday.  Thank you Mas Tapas!!!',5,'2026-06-23','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5450ffb9-7534-4c24-b150-0c798095e08b','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWSFYwVkRiRWRtVG1Kd01YVkJhRU5IY1VwMFdYYxAB','google','Mas was fantastic. Excellent food, cocktails and service. Would highly recommend. The carne asada and pan tomate were particular favorites, as was the chocolate cake.',5,'2026-06-21','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a8e15ed4-c18b-4dfd-a884-4c5605439ce1','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoWlJHb3daMUZHVEhKb09UWTFNWFZQZG1WMk5HYxAB','google','Amazing service, food and atmosphere! Yummmm',5,'2026-05-10','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a6540731-de34-4931-8253-c2e0f9ba7e6d','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSdFpTMVplRkpKVGpkWVJFTm1WWGcwVkdacVVVRRAB','google','Best dinner I have had in a looooong time. Everything was so delicious',5,'2026-04-16','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('34f3dfbb-6fa0-459a-bbda-d4d0b01c3634','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pVM1pHWmFiMUJNTkhOM1RGQldTMHR4VkhkTFMwRRAB','google','This is one of our favorites! Food is delicious, great service, wonderful wine, generous tapas sizes. Highly recommend!',5,'2025-12-29','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7fff2aee-e8d5-4f95-9fb1-7cedf307dc7f','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psbk1WSnFVV28yTjNOV2FqWkRiVkJtVVZwUU1GRRAB','google','We had booked a reservation for 7pm however when we arrived we were made to wait about 30+ minutes post check in. They seated a party of 5 who checked after us before us a party of 4. We ended up just leaving and going elsewhere.<br><br>There were three parties that checked in while we were waiting and they ended up having to wait as well.',1,'2025-12-28','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('364638e5-92d4-4325-8c37-21c6c8dfd047','10461156-6533-4df0-9edc-c2a02351a3a9','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tweWRqRlFUWHBHTTJWbFFqZ3RMWGR0YkMxVU9YYxAB','google','Yum!!!',5,'2025-11-30','2026-11-12T15:59:16.943Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8c6844f3-96ef-4251-9892-8774dac84755','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xd1kwdHZjMngyYmpCdlZHbE9aeTA0Y2twWWEwRRAB','google','If you are looking for authentic Italian food and amazing service, this is the place for you.  We loved the bread and the dishes.  Highly recommend.',5,'2026-11-07','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('81c13338-99a0-48dd-a0be-fdc7d333642f','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxckxWUTJka2RMTkZwT2NtRnpXa1ZCWWpWVlUxRRAB','google','We ate there with two kids under 2. All of the staff was super friendly helpful and very accommodating with young kids. Food was very good and a little bit cheaper than a lot of the other spots downtown',5,'2026-10-26','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('152b5dc7-cbbf-4917-88d2-66ef401d3672','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxQmNEbFNSVW96WmpZMVRtcHBNMDlMTUZoVlJsRRAB','google','A bit pricey and wait times can be long, but the atmosphere is really nice. Perfect for a nice meal with friends or a dinner date. Our waitress was really nice as well.',4,'2026-10-21','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('68f6686d-7091-49a3-9791-7568843cac56','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KVVFqWllMWEpyU2w5MFUxSjJVRlEyUnpVMWFuYxAB','google','My boyfriend and I had high hopes for this place. It was awful. The service was atrocious, we waited 15 minutes for WATER. We actually received our bread from who I presume was the owner before we got our waters. I understand when it is a busy night, but the place was not packed and it almost seemed as if the outside patio guest were more important then the ones who sat inside.<br><br>We finally had our orders taken by the bartender, and not once did she come and check in on us. We had more interaction with the owner who offered us bread than the bartender. Our food took so long to get to us and it was a mediocre lukewarm. We had waited so long that we simply ate our meal with no complaints. Once we finished our meal our waitress came by and asked us if we wanted water after we were done with our meal. Mind you, this was the only time we were offered a refill. When it came time for the check, she was quick to get us to pay. We did not leave a tip and we just wanted to leave.<br><br>It was a disappointment and the only reason I am giving it a 2 star review was because of the nice blonde host.',2,'2026-10-19','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aae46e32-89f2-45cc-812a-41203fced277','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMFpFOTJSME42TTJGbFRFbDVOa1V0YjFWR2RXYxAB','google','My husband and I went here after a very chaotic day, and we were so well taken care of by the staff. They brought water and took our drink orders ASAP, then brought us some bread quickly. Our drinks, appetizers, entrees, and dessert all came quickly. Our server was completely delightful. Really cheered us up after a long day. The tiramisu martini was delicious! Despite my compulsive desire to trying as many things as possible, I ordered a second one because the first was so good.',5,'2026-10-13','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('42371d28-b967-4b39-9b9d-44228783f544','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkdFJIcGZiVTl6VXpRM1lrZ3paaTFZYms1a2QxRRAB','google','Entrees and dessert were both delicious. Atmosphere and service was outstanding. Will  definitely be back!',5,'2026-10-06','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('68cd0aa1-c7d2-42dd-9666-92a54ceb6134','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KMWFXaFpRa3haUTFaRlpsTmZXRmRXT1VKeGJYYxAB','google','Meal was very good and location was great outside on the patio.',5,'2026-10-03','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bf8e5b27-a15a-4db9-9c01-dac99dc0aafd','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxSlVsaHphak4yTUhsV2JFOXZjMGhSYkVwaVYyYxAB','google','A tourist trap with horrible food',1,'2026-09-28','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3a50345c-26a6-4401-b4d3-db157416c5cb','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOYUxUVldNV2hvU0hsM1VFRmtSRkV6TTFRMGMwRRAB','google','The staff was very helpful with suggestions.    We ordered take out for a party of 6.   Generous portions and wonderful flavors.  The ciabatta bread was amazing    Enjoyed a drink at the bar while waiting.  Perfect dirty martini.',5,'2026-09-14','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bd9400ed-49b1-40b0-ac60-01844cf98eac','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pVNGRISk9TMWRHVERKV1FrbERWRTVuY1d0aFZWRRAB','google','Nearly $90 for Two Pastas — Sal’s Fell Short<br><br>Sal’s Caffe Italia has a 4.3 Google rating and was packed on a Sunday evening, so expectations were high. The outdoor seating area was comfortable, vibrant, and easily the strongest part of the experience.<br><br>Unfortunately, the restaurant appeared understaffed for the number of tables, and the kitchen seemed overwhelmed. Several nearby tables complained about the wait. We ordered only two entrées: the Bolognese and the Pesto Genovese with chicken added at extra cost, yet the food took far too long to arrive.<br><br>We also clearly mentioned a gluten allergy, but complimentary bread was still brought to the table. That was concerning and suggested the allergy information had not been handled carefully.<br><br>During the long wait, service was inattentive. Our water was not regularly topped up, and there was little checking in. Curiously, once we finished, the check arrived very quickly.<br><br>The Pesto Genovese was served cold and drowned in a thin, soupy pesto sauce. It was serviceable, but disappointing. The Bolognese was better, though its sauce was also unusually thin and watery rather than rich or satisfying.<br><br>At nearly $90 for two straightforward pasta dishes, including the added chicken, this simply was not good value. The setting was enjoyable, but the food, service, and overall experience did not come close to justifying the price on this visit.',2,'2026-09-07','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7309310c-275e-4781-a81a-5748ae930c4c','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxelRYSnlla3A1YzJGRFpYWTNRbDl1YURaNmNYYxAB','google','This is a great spot, both in location, food, and service quality! My husband and I were seated at the terrace bar, which had a lovely view of the Paramount Theater. Our server Bella was so sweet and attentive! I got a spritz, negroni, and manicotti, and while the drinks came out quickly, the manicotti took much longer to arrive. Bella gave us two tiramisu and my negroni for free to thank us for waiting! The manicotti was delicious, definitely worth the wait. I’ll come again, both for the food quality, exceptional service, and vibes ✌️',5,'2026-07-30','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('49b29d1f-3438-4445-b86c-8778415c4479','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaNlJrUlhNR0pmYWpSNVVIRlVURkZpY0MxQlRsRRAB','google','We had a great time at Sal''s for our anniversary dinner! Walking the downtown mall and the plan was to eat wherever smelled and looked the best - Sal''s was it! Patio was busy yet we where able to be seated right away. Espresso martinis where a great start, some Chianti, fried mozz, and two pasta dishes rounded out the evening - everything was delicious! The server let us take our time and enjoy the evening, everything was lovely.',5,'2026-07-29','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0a4582db-1964-4521-81f5-78d89c53e76f','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RMlRsVnNVR1ppVjNGTWRtOW5OVGRWY2twellVRRAB','google','Fantastic Italian bistro with delicious food and authentic charm. We loved the meatballs in particular, and the chicken parmigiana, Caesar salad, and pink lady pasta were all big hits. Only miss was the garlic bread, which was not bad, just not at all garlicky. We will be back!',5,'2026-07-28','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9041649f-cc5b-4ca5-be44-867119939025','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvemRrWXRSRWhUVVV4VVYxbFNkSGRUTVZKb1pXYxAB','google','A Charlottesville Highlight!<br>While visiting the Charlottesville Downtown Mall, my wife and I stumbled upon Sal’s Caffe and it did not disappoint. The food was absolutely excellent. If you go, you have to try the fried mozzarella and the Chicken Parmigiana. Great spot!',5,'2026-07-18','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f08746ea-31d4-438e-a02a-0b3690982843','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkM01WQkpVR0k0VmtWdlptaEpORGQyZG05QmFuYxAB','google','One of the best pastas I’ve ever had. Loved the atmosphere even though it was small. Throughly enjoyed my experience.',5,'2026-07-04','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bcbdb93c-e71d-457c-b7d5-13c8b81787ce','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0a1dVSm9ZMjVoYmtWSlpVSlVVV1JTWjFwSU1WRRAB','google','First time visiting Sal''s and I was VERY impressed!  Immediately welcomed and sat at the table of my  choice.  The food cost seemed  high at first, but when they brought your food out, you knew why.  The portions were huge and top level quality, bursting with flavor.  This is our new spot!  We know where to take our guest in the future!',5,'2026-06-21','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('921208c8-6aee-40ac-a26f-3b9458e1be79','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214M2JUQmtYMUZxVVRsTVZrRlpUR1kwYnpGU1psRRAB','google','Amazing food and service! Highly recommend the gnocchi',5,'2026-06-15','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d1526400-5e7c-4c0e-aa1c-36aaae9af60a','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xveFMyaFFhSGxqTkVVMFRHSkhTVzlrTnpkNlJXYxAB','google','Food was amazing. We had mozzarella as a starter; my kids has spaghetti/meatballs and I had linguine Alfredo. Really great Alfredo sauce!<br>Service was impeccable from start to finish.',5,'2026-06-13','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5d0472de-0f08-4540-89f8-2bc3449fe39a','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOQ1YxOVhZakV0WTJwUVExWm9NMFZhVjB0dFRXYxAB','google','Arrived about 6:15, was immediately seated inside. Had the place completely to ourselfs. Prompt and friendly service. Timing was perfect on each round served. The main course was delicious. Closest I have come to true Italian food from Italy.<br>The tiramisu was delicious and looked homemade. And the coffee was strong, like it should be. If we get the chance, we will be back.',4,'2026-06-03','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f1254cbf-3f99-4e42-a32d-3ad1702b9716','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205bU1VMVdhbnAzYld0TldGSXhkMEppTm5wSVdGRRAB','google','Seriously authentic Italian from the food to the vibes of the restaurant and Sinatra playing in the background. Pictured below are the Mushroom Ravioli, Lasagna, Tiramisu, Cannoli, Calamari Fritte, and the bread that just comes out in the beginning. Service was impeccable. This is a great place for a nice dinner on the Charlottesville Mall, just make sure to make a reservation ahead because you may not be able to get a table otherwise.',5,'2026-05-12','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1325602f-5b90-4abb-8154-56fe9e047f35','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kM1dFVXlRMVZPY2pCSmJFODVaekp5VjB4cWQxRRAB','google','Had a wonderful meal at Sal''s Italian Restaurant downtown. Definitely recommend sitting outside if the weather is nice, such a great atmosphere for dinner in Charlottesville.<br><br>The pizza was delicious, the mussels in the white wine broth were full of flavor, and the tiramisu was the perfect ending to the meal. A great spot for a relaxed Italian dinner downtown.',4,'2026-05-09','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('52d703e0-7c44-4eda-83c4-b397d0019c76','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KaE1XeFFkMUpmTVVOclpUZzVOMUZxVW1neVJFRRAB','google','Our server was nice. But the tidy up lady really wanted us to leave, like straight up rude.<br>A sad end to our lovely evening.',1,'2026-04-18','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f16d8ba6-4f53-4e82-a07b-4f35c725560b','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wS1QwUXlUMkozUm5kT05HZE1Oa2RrVHpaWU1YYxAB','google','My friend was visiting us . We took them to sal’s caffe . Wait for food 1hour 30 minutes  after that food was not good kids were tired fell sleep without dinner',1,'2026-04-14','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cd4f1159-302d-437d-860a-3edd2c6a261c','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xV2QxWjNiRzlqUVhGR2R6Rm5jbmRuUkhCS05VRRAB','google','We were the first group to be seated our food was cold',2,'2026-04-13','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('58126c56-aa1e-4883-86e7-cfd5d1e7df08','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxRWNUWnFTVEJmTTB0dmVrWkJUa280VGpCT1kxRRAB','google','Great service, nice place. Ordered chicken parmesan.  Felt it was a little bland. Prices lean toward the high end.',5,'2026-04-05','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ce9dfcff-cae4-4aff-85c1-deee9bf7c984','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKQ1JFUk9UbmRIZUcxNlRHUlJNalJ3UVhBMmVsRRAB','google','Sat outside on the street patio. Patio is dog friendly. Make sure to ask for bread if it''s not offered. It''s delicious. Everything was great except for the risotto and shrimp, underwhelming under seasoned. Enjoyed the mussels two ways, chicken parm, salmon picatta and there was enough for some leftovers.',4,'2026-04-03','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('30faa885-8db4-49e3-96f4-cefa2c88c6f1','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KWFRGZ3laSGt3TVcxRlVUSlRSVGxRUzBaNGFuYxAB','google','Great food and great service. Felt a bit pricy for the pasta I got but I enjoyed the atmosphere and food nevertheless.',5,'2026-04-03','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4fa87783-985f-423d-8625-5036353d4a54','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prNFNtaHNiMDlKTld4b2FtODNkalo2WkRsdU4zYxAB','google','We had an amazing experience here while celebrating a bachelorette trip with a group of 7. The atmosphere was warm and cozy, the service was exceptional, and every dish we ordered was delicious. The staff made us feel genuinely welcomed, which made the night even more special. Highly recommend for groups looking for great food and a comfortable, inviting environment. Thank y’all so much!!',5,'2026-02-22','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('569906d6-45f8-433a-8101-c759d53b32bf','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSMFlua3pORTlDWVVwQ2NXMWhWbTlyUVhrM1ZXYxAB','google','Me and my spouse ate here for our Valentine’s Day dinner and the food was good, but the price is just far too high for what we got. A bruschetta appetizer, 2 wine glasses, a small pizza and a chicken parmigiana entree and our bill was $122 dollars.<br><br>We aren’t from Charlottesville so we didn’t know it was that expensive before coming to this restaurant, but I just don’t understand why people here are paying that kind of price for Italian food.',2,'2026-02-15','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4815c672-b492-4e08-a61f-c6e4be7f214b','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCdE5GQlRPVVZ0WVc1SWNGTTBRMll5TlhWVFNIYxAB','google','Great Itialian food . Great prices. Fast service.',5,'2025-12-29','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d3afa98d-fc6d-4f5d-bad0-e75bbbf0a0c2','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1dmFXRk9RM0k0TlhsRmFucEhNVmhPZG1WbFpFRRAB','google','Found the simplest and tastiest Caesar salad there, food was absolutely delicious. Service was great too.',5,'2025-12-09','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3c2c7b3c-4935-4348-91bc-871ebd30f2cc','a9a0437d-fb46-412d-83d1-14ba90604718','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2prM1kwcGFkM3BWTFZKRmQyOXRORTB4VWxVdFpFRRAB','google','This was a nice little place.  I wish they had a larger selection of wine though.  I would visit this restaurant again.',4,'2025-10-31','2026-11-12T15:59:18.098Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8fe96698-d084-4f9c-a1dc-411d2e80620c','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsRlpEVkRUVk55TlMxTlpsZHdWbXBTTFZwbVoxRRAB','google','We used The Local for our catering and wedding coordination services, and we cannot recommend them enough! Working with Helen was a game-changer: she was incredibly professional, knowledgeable, and patient. From the tasting and rental consultation to our wedding day, Helen was always just an email or a phone call away. Our meetings leading up to the big day were efficient and productive. We were able to stay on track with all aspect of planning our perfect day. Not only is The Local’s team top notch, but their food is also to die for! We loved the variety of options we chose from for our menu, focusing on locally sourced Virginia classics. Thanks to The Local, all of our wedding guests were very happy and well-fed ☺️',5,'2026-10-30','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ddc91f18-cc46-4c2f-b747-a9e48372291a','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205UE5FVlVWWGhvVGxjeFkzSTFiVEZLY1ZwdFZtYxAB','google','We used The Local to cater our April wedding, we had a very specific vision for what we wanted our reception experience to look like and The Local helped to make it come to life! The oyster bar was a crowd favorite, many of our guests saying it was the highlight of our cocktail hour. Having a family style meal was incredibly important to us, we wanted it to feel like dinner at grandma''s house but better and The Local delivered! We had a few pickier guests and we were able to accommodate their meals without an issue. All of the staff were incredibly nice and accommodating. During the planning process The Local team were incredibly helpful and easy to work with, we had a pleasure working closely with Meridyth!',5,'2026-10-27','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ee0fdfc2-df40-48ba-9d6c-9dd54e9b657d','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tac2JGQkdiMUpJZUV4RVptOU9VR3BtY0hwNWQzYxAB','google','I am so behind writing this review. We used the Local as our wedding caterer at Avonlea Farms last September. There are truly not enough words to explain how amazing their food and service was. They are so professional, seamless, friendly, and make the most food.<br>I was not concerned about anything from the moment I hired them. Our tasting was so delicious and top notch. I simply couldn''t wait for our guests to have their food! They answered every question quickly and worked with me for oysters and some specialty items we requested. They took care of our bartending too.<br>They made planning so simple, their service was quick, the food was beautifully displayed, and everyone of the staff that day had a smile on their faces.<br>Our gursts loved the food at cocktail hour, the bar service, wine service, all the food at the buffet, and the late night snacks.<br>We felt like a king and queen and simply can''t say enough about them. Everything was perfect!',5,'2026-08-29','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ace1e698-159c-4f25-8a96-8bbf9bb566ac','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFek9XWkVOemsxVTFrMU4zaEZRMUZLWjNwS1dsRRAB','google','We used The Local Catering for our wedding and day of coordinating. Samantha was the BEST!!!! I can not recommend her enough. I am so thankful for everything she did and helped us with during the process to make sure everything went smoothly and as we wanted. The food was also delicious, we highly recommend the ribeye with mashed potatoes and green beans.<br>-Maddie Farrar',5,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('36b174cd-fa8f-45ed-8c58-4a20f1da2a9a','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SRU9IcG9TbVpLVUhCRFlrOTNNVU10TFRadlVGRRAB','google','Helen and her team at the Local were fantastic to work with for our June 2026 wedding.  We got so many compliments on our appetizers and entrees which were of course prepared by the Local and I felt at ease knowing Helen was coordinating our big day.  She is incredibly professional, experienced in coordination, and a pleasure to work with.  We highly recommend Helen and her team.',5,'2026-07-15','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4355353d-767f-402d-81e5-de35e966523a','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sclNFSTBiWGRDUjFKelRIWldMUzEyUmtoM1QxRRAB','google','We loved working with The Local for our 115 person June 2026 wedding at King Family Vineyards. We worked with Samantha up until about 6 months from our wedding when Meridyth took over, and both were fantastic -- detail oriented, responsive to the (many, many) emails I sent back and forth over menu tweaks, rental updates, and more. They also accommodated our request to provide outside dessert, used custom tea towels I made for cocktail hour, and worked with our vision on providing the beer & liquor for specialty drinks.<br><br>On the wedding day, their team was professional and our food was delicious. We''d recommend working with their team for full-service catering for any wedding or event! We also found their pricing to be most competitive among the Charlottesville caterers we worked up quotes with, and their planning portal made it easy to see updates to the menu and costs.<br><br>(Photos by Paige Ryan Photography)',5,'2026-06-29','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('35383148-a5bc-4227-a371-55773faff3a2','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KTGMxZDRlRmd4VEdObVNWUlBSSFF0ZWsxSGJrRRAB','google','We worked with The Local for our full catering and coordination services for our wedding. We cannot say enough good things about their entire team! Helen, our coordinator, went above and beyond to make our wedding everything we hoped for and more. She was incredibly responsive and helpful, and managed all our vendors, requests, and the wedding day all so seamlessly and professionally. She put all our stresses and concerns at rest, and we felt like we could truly relax and be present at our wedding, knowing that she had everything planned and managed. My only wish is that we hired her for full service wedding planning! The catering team was awesome as well! We enjoyed all the food and drinks, and we receive many compliments from our guests. They easily accommodated our "breakfast-for-dinner" menu, tailoring all our food choices to what we asked for. We would recommend Helen and The Local for any event!',5,'2026-06-05','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b8fe30dc-6945-4a3e-85ba-d6b2444c797c','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGWUxUZElSMWg2VEdWV1MxQnpkWGhXWWxsb2FuYxAB','google','The Local did a FANTASTIC job at catering for a girls dinner in Faber, VA this past week. We had several courses all served yo us by Jake who was both professional and lots of fun. We would highly recommend this group for a GREAT experienc. .',5,'2026-05-14','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5a99c762-d930-49d7-a394-accc21720a75','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WSFJFaEJVell6TTBaYVpWRm9kV0Z5YjNaRloxRRAB','google','The Local catering for our wedding was exceptional! Eleanore and the Local team were professional, attentive, organized, and so helpful through the whole process. The food was beautiful and delicious! Crowd favorites were the bang bang shrimp and mac and cheese. They also coordinated with MS events rental company to make rentals more convenient. Thank you Eleanore and the Local for making our wedding day special and delicious!',5,'2026-05-11','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('48d6a1f5-7c1b-42e0-b90f-a102fc7b3ba7','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21FeWFXTmxWSE5tWkhsV04ybGZZVlpvZUdoQ1puYxAB','google','Hiring a private chef was one of the best things we’ve ever done.  The Local Catering was exceptional.  They came in took over the kitchen and started cooking.  This allowed our large party to relax and enjoy each other’s company. We were served 3 different types of<br>hor d''oeuvres, they were all delicious.  Our meal started with a salad.  For our entrees, we had a choice of beef tenderloin, chicken or vegetable pasta.  They were served with potatoes and green beans. For dessert we had chocolate cake.  After serving us dessert, they cleaned up the entire kitchen and boxed up any leftovers for us.  They were very professional and courteous.  I highly recommend them!',5,'2026-04-07','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f379516b-e034-4e33-923e-483095939ea1','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0T1kybHpSWEE0TVVvemVXbE1kVnBKZDFST2NrRRAB','google','Samantha did a great job today with our tasting. So excitedly about our wedding and what they are doing. Professional and efficient, highly recommend.',5,'2026-04-01','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7494d366-f4f8-43a2-b1e7-aac4300b8f96','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkMWJFVkhURjg1UjAwNU9VTlRlalU1YW1ocVJVRRAB','google','We used the local for catering our wedding, and they were a fantastic service. Samantha was our primary contact person and made the entire process incredibly pleasant. She was proactive and helpful, especially when we wanted modifications on their alcohol offerings for catering.<br><br>On the day off the food was excellent, the service impeccable, and our guests had a wonderful time. The coordination between the Local and our venue Old Met was flawless.<br><br>Their food choices for catering are amazing, and the star of our show was the crispy shrimp appetizer. The wine selection was really good too.<br><br>Thank you to the entire team for an amazing experience.<br><br>Edit: credit to Sarah Cramer Shields for the photos!',5,'2026-03-25','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1ffb0924-a773-46b7-8a89-130313b25bb9','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KeGFVTnhhRVE1UkhwWFdHNVVNMGhMYWtSdU5WRRAB','google','The Local catered our wedding and did an incredible job. They were super to work with through the planning process, the food was incredible, and the staff were so incredibly nice and helpful. They really went above and beyond for us and I would highly recommend them for any event!',5,'2025-12-21','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0b8c6f38-a9d2-448b-8690-5ec671fb6a7e','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21acldEVmtUbEJDVGpaWVdURllWbkpaUVhaQ2NWRRAB','google','We cannot recommend The Local - both the restaurant and their catering team - highly enough! We got married on November 1 at Eastwood Farm and Winery in Charlottesville. The Local''s catering services were exceptional from start to finish and truly elevated our entire wedding experience.<br><br>I had no idea how complex the catering process for a wedding could be, but The Local guided us through every step with ease. We opted for a sit-down dinner with grilled chicken, fried chicken, or steak, served with green beans and fingerling potatoes. The food was delicious, beautifully prepared, and perfectly warm when served, even on a chilly fall day!<br><br>Our catering coordinator, Eleanore, was absolutely fantastic. From our tasting, to helping us select rentals through MS Events, to the final walkthrough at the venue, and being on-site the day of, she was thoughtful, organized, energetic, and genuinely fun to work with. Her experience showed in everything she did. Knowing that The Local had worked many weddings at Eastwood also gave us so much peace of mind. They knew exactly how the day should flow, and it showed, and they worked cohesively with our planner and venue staff.<br><br>Eleanore and the entire team went above and beyond in every way. If you’re considering The Local for your event or wedding, do it. They’re an absolute standout.',5,'2025-12-12','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f6c6243d-ecc9-4fb9-8a5f-270d7efd868b','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KcU4zWnhZMHBVUVhkVlZHNTBTVzlRUkRkQldsRRAB','google','The Local was the perfect choice for our wedding! The food was absolutely incredible. We wouldn''t change a single thing about the menu items we chose. Weeks later, we still have guests telling us how much they enjoyed the food and passing along compliments. The service they provided was excellent, as well. We were so impressed with the entire event!<br><br>The planning process was stress-free and we felt like they genuinely cared about our vision and made it happen. Catering is a significant part of any wedding budget, and we feel the quality, service, and experience provided by The Local were worth every penny!<br><br>This team is experienced and really knows what they’re doing. They made sure we got to eat, too! We were so excited to find an extra meal packed up for both of us in our honeymoon suite at the end of the night. Every detail was considered and executed fabulously. We recommend The Local for ANY event you’re having and we hope to work with them again in the future. What an amazing experience!',5,'2025-12-01','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a59f61b0-f3ef-4f16-8cd1-68cc0073b85e','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkNWVIWlZkVTR4ZDJkWlkxOTVZMkpJTlRkV2VIYxAB','google','We used The Local for catering and bar as well as day-of coordination for our wedding. Samantha was our coordinator, and she did an excellent job! She''s incredibly organized, calm, and down-to-earth. She was always prompt, straightforward, and detailed with her communication, and I felt like our wedding was in good hands with her. There were only two minor hiccups -- first, we ended up with champagne flutes instead of the coupe glasses we had asked for; second, there was no table runner on the sweetheart table until our photographer mentioned it, and then they fixed it. However, those are extremely tiny details, and if those were the worst things to happen at our wedding, then I''m not going to sweat it. I still think they deserve 5 stars regardless because everything ran very smoothly otherwise. As for the food and drinks, everything tasted so fresh and delicious, and the portions were honestly huge (in a good way); we got so many compliments from our guests! It was definitely the best wedding food I''ve ever had. Samantha even packed us to-go boxes to enjoy the next day, which was so thoughtful! We did a tasting with Kelly early on in the planning process, and she was very organized and on top of things as well. I think it''s also worth mentioning that the food at the wedding was just as good as the food at our initial tasting, which is not always the case with wedding caterers. Overall, we are very happy with our experience with The Local, and we would still choose them if we did it again!',5,'2025-11-04','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7c3ce9b7-8c69-485f-bb55-dd84cce8d0cb','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CQ1pIRTVVMlYyUmxWdE4yUXphbEpGWlV4V1RVRRAB','google','Kelly from the Local was so on top of things for our wedding catering. I was so grateful for her organization and foresight. She was so patient with our questions, and so responsive. The Local team set up the reception beautifully and we received SO many compliments on the food!',5,'2025-10-11','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9c89121f-c9ce-44ab-8c07-72a6879f05f3','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twWE4zRTFlRzQ0VWt4NlkyUXRlbFJTTVRGZkxWRRAB','google','We used the Local for catering and day of coordination services. We received so many compliments on the appetizers and dinner selection. Our coordinator, Samantha, did a wonderful job and helped our day flow smoothly!',5,'2025-09-24','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('23610f80-3442-4ee6-81c5-60a9b3c1d8a8','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwcGVteGtkbVZRY1Uxb1dqTmhkM2x5VlZsUlZuYxAB','google','I recently had the pleasure of working with The Local Catering as the wedding planner for a lovely couple at South Paddock Winery, and I can’t say enough good things about their service!<br><br>From the very beginning, their communication was excellent. They were always prompt in responding to inquiries and open to discussing ideas, which made the planning process so much smoother.<br><br>On the big day, the staff was nothing short of immaculate. They arrived on time, dressed professionally, and brought a warm, personable attitude that immediately put everyone at ease. It was refreshing to see how well they worked as a team, seamlessly coordinating with each other to ensure that everything ran smoothly. They took care of every detail, allowing the bride and groom to focus on enjoying their special day.<br><br>Now, let’s talk about the food—outstanding is an understatement! The chicken was absolutely delicious, perfectly cooked and bursting with flavor. The presentation was beautiful, making each dish look as good as it tasted. Guests truly enjoyed each dish prepared.<br><br>Moreover, the staff went above and beyond to keep the venue clean and tidy throughout the event, which is often overlooked but so important. Their attention to detail truly made a difference!<br><br>I thoroughly enjoyed collaborating with The Local Catering and I would highly recommend them to anyone looking for a reliable and professional catering service for their event. They helped create a memorable experience for the couple and all their guests, and I can''t wait to work with them again in the future!',5,'2025-09-14','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5355b67c-9994-4eff-9dc8-f554e90ae8dc','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2OUxLUnZ3RRAB','google','Sam and her team were absolutely amazing! They made our wedding so smooth and carefree! The food was amazing and the service was amazing! We also loved our extra wedding food bag we got to take home with us on the wedding night! Matthew and I could not recommend Sam and her team more! Thank you, thank you, thank you! ❤️',5,'2024-12-18','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9178d30a-0265-413c-903c-67ae5d8b10c0','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQZ2JYS013EAE','google','Helen and her team beyond rocked the wedding day for my clients! Helen is absolutely the best at what she does! We worked together on a wedding where I was the photographer and her stellar job planning made the day effortless for everyone in attendance. I''ve had the pleasure of working with many planners and this team really blew it out of the water ensuring I was prepared for the day and serving my couple the best way I could.<br><br>Beyond the planning, the team was responsible for the catering which was beyond tasty. Just an A+ service all the way around, I strongly encourage adding these guys to your big day!',5,'2024-12-02','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('197b4f21-e1ea-4c07-911d-e4d2c16f675e','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQNVAtbTFnRRAB','google','My husband and I are SO glad we chose The Local for our wedding weekend. We had our rehearsal dinner in the private Hearth Room at their restaurant — and they also catered the wedding. Weeks later, our friends and family are still telling us how beautiful everything was — and raving about the truffle mac & cheese! The Local also provided us with partial planning — and Kelly was extremely helpful and responsive throughout the entire process! She really brought our vision to life and kept everything running smoothly and on time. I truly can’t think of a SINGLE thing I would change about our wedding day. It was perfect!',5,'2024-11-21','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ec5babc8-78fd-4d12-bf26-5f76151e17a2','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQzbE91X25nRRAB','google','First off, let me just say that we love the Local as a restaurant. When they popped up on a vendor list as a catering option for our wedding, we knew we had to reach out. After getting a handful of quotes back, we are pleasantly surprised that the Local came back with the best price! Booking with them was incredibly easy, and they even worked with us to make our own custom passed appetizer for the event! As we got closer to the wedding, we were assigned Samantha as our catering coordinator. Samantha was incredible. She was so easy to work with and helped make our dream wedding a reality. She made sure everything was perfect, promptly answered all of our questions, and never said no when we had (what we thought) a crazy request! I have no constructive criticism for her and her team, everything was wonderful. For weeks after the wedding, we got rave reviews on the food, not only the taste but the portion sizes, too. We will continue to visit the Local every time we’re back in Charlottesville, but I highly recommend you give their catering team a chance for any event you might have!',5,'2024-11-12','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0c9abb86-921c-4b85-98af-ab063d38e87d','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNudjZiTjdnRRAB','google','I recently had the pleasure of working with Helen and the team at The Local for my wedding, and I couldn''t be happier with the experience.<br><br>My husband and I used The Local for our September 2024 wedding and could not recommend their services enough. We ended up working with The Local for every aspect of the wedding, including cocktail hour, bar, day of coordination, and reception needs. The Local was actually a preferred vendor from our venue and I realized that my husband and I ate there a few years ago for a New Years trip, which made me all the more excited to reach out to them.<br><br>From the start, Helen was incredibly organized and attentive. She listened to my vision and brought it to life, ensuring every detail was perfect. Her expertise and calm demeanor made the planning process enjoyable rather than stressful.<br><br>From the weeks before the wedding to the actual day, Helen was on top of everything. I am not a huge planner myself, so her expertise was imperative. Not only is Helen a wonderful person and provides great energy to be around, but she has a plan for anything and everything. For example, the zipper track of my wedding dress broke in the middle of the reception, and before I could even blink, Helen was right behind me with a needle and thread saving the day. That is just one of the many things Helen did to ensure our day was perfect. If there was anyone in the world who could write a blueprint for being the perfect wedding coordinator, it would hands down be Helen.<br><br>The catering by The Local was outstanding. The food was not only delicious but beautifully presented. Our guests are still raving about the food from cocktail hour to the reception dinner. They also accommodated dietary restrictions seamlessly, which we really appreciated.<br><br>Overall, the combination of Helen’s planning skills and The Local’s culinary talents made our wedding day unforgettable. I highly recommend both for anyone looking to create a memorable event!',5,'2024-10-01','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('99229d5b-b00d-4ecd-9f1a-83cf520b1c27','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURINGUyUEx3EAE','google','We are so glad we used The Local as our caterer for our wedding! We are also glad that we got to work with Helen exclusively. She guided us through the most stressful part of the wedding – the catering. We were a long-distance couple and she was so accommodating. She helped us create an excellent menu that our guests loved. We also had some specific guest dietary restrictions that she helped us navigate and execute. She was an excellent communicator throughout the entire process.<br><br>Our wedding day food was absolutely excellent. Each dish was beautifully presented and packed with flavor. The service was impeccable. The day of catering team was incredibly professional, attentive, and friendly, ensuring that everything ran smoothly and that our guests were well taken care of. They were able to quickly pivot when we needed to move our ceremony indoors as well.<br><br>We couldn’t have asked for a better catering experience. If you’re looking for a caterer who delivers exquisite food, exceptional service, and a truly memorable dining experience, The Local is the way to go.',5,'2024-09-16','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('554db2fe-8fe6-4c9f-8588-971012a68db2','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3bTZfYTJRRRAB','google','We used The Local for catering and coordinating our wedding and the food, service and organization were spot on! We got so many compliments about the food and they were very flexible with adjustments!',5,'2024-08-28','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('70cbd7b9-cac9-4e26-bf3d-5943bdbbc948','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURMeWVfTVl3EAE','google','The Local Catering offered excellent service, attention to detail, and the food was incredible. My husband and I booked the Local as our wedding catering service for our wedding set for the Market at Grelen this past October. Samantha was readily available for all our questions and was very organized during our meetings. All of the food was delicious and the service was impeccable for my husband and I, and our wedding guests. My husband and I could not have been in more awe seeing how months of planning had resulted in such beauty. We were also excited to hear so many positive compliments about the food, following our wedding, and felt reassured that the Local was the perfect choice for our special day! We cannot wait to go back to the restaurant for dinner when we are back in the Charlottesville area.',5,'2024-06-28','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b3c9accd-a2c2-471e-a052-ccc7a8c197cc','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqanFud2tBRRAB','google','Food and service both fabulous, and Samantha Clarke is the BEST wedding coordinator one could hope for! So professional, calming, pleasant, friendly and always got  your back. I highly recommend her!',5,'2024-04-21','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('69888c91-1a37-47df-b5b4-e0638db2838f','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkX291Ym9BRRAB','google','The Local always does an AMAZING job!! As a wedding vendor we’ve tried food at all sorts of weddings over the years and The Local has remained at the top of our referral list! The staff is exceptional and the food is insanely good!!!',5,'2024-02-15','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c51df3db-2f16-4c6d-b6e3-e92ebc0c8d2a','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR0ajZmMENBEAE','google','Simply fantastic. They were easy to contact and make selections for our association event brunch. The food was on time, we''ll presented and DELICIOUS! Lots of wonderful feedback.  We will be using them again for another dinner event this spring.',5,'2024-02-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('950e27ac-e616-4255-aa50-cbbf3559c941','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN0c2YzRU13EAE','google','The Local gave us an incredible experience from start to finish. After having eaten at their restaurant multiple times (including for our first date), my husband & I knew we wanted to have them as our caterer, and they exceeded our expectations.<br><br>From the very beginning, they were consistently prompt in their communication and flexible with what we wanted in our contract. The food packages they offer are generous for the price with endless options to customize everything to our liking. The quality and portion sizes at the actual event were exceptional - exactly like in our tasting - and we are still getting compliments on our food months afterwards. We also were able to provide our own alcohol (except wine, as per our venue''s rule) that they used for bartending purposes, which helped with cost. Their staff even helped set up desserts we purchased from other companies.<br><br>I also really appreciated their contracting services through MS Rentals, which was included in our price. When we first started planning, we hadn''t even considered where to find linens and flatware, but luckily we didn''t have to. The MS Rentals team helped us piece together our table settings with little more than a color palette to start with, and they were more than accommodating with any changes we decided to make before the event.<br><br>Cost is a big part of catering, so I can''t emphasize enough how mindful of our budget The Local was throughout the planning process. It''s easy to get nickel-and-dime-d when deciding on vendors, but we had the complete opposite experience with them. The contract they provide is very clear about the cost of each item and kept up to date, there are no hidden fees, and they even provided helpful suggestions for various items based on our guest count that ultimately decreased the final bill (which they didn''t have to do).<br><br>All in all, this company provided excellent catering & dinner service for our event while supporting us throughout the entire planning process. We feel extremely valued and satisfied as clients and can''t wait to go eat at The Local again soon!',5,'2024-01-30','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('902c6469-6454-4c07-9f3d-88790a7bc8eb','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGMkpPSDl3RRAB','google','Eleanore and the entire Local team were fantastic to work with and I highly encourage anyone planning a wedding to book them for catering! We received so many compliments on the food (especially the beef short ribs)! Between one of the grooms being gluten-free, and several of the guests having other dietary restrictions, the Local did a fantastic job making sure everyone had something they could eat. They even talked with one of our guests weeks before the wedding who was worried about her son''s food allergies!!<br><br>They also did an amazing job coordinating all the rentals for the table settings. And we appreciated being able to coordinate everything through one person.<br><br>On the day of the wedding, Eleanore was awesome! She was attentive and professional and made sure we were having a great time (the post-ceremony margaritas and hors d''oeuvre she had waiting for us was perfection!). Thank you all so much for making our wedding so special!!',5,'2023-11-04','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('08f7436b-b1e2-4f66-a373-24c6ac7b8dbd','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaOTVxd3h3RRAB','google','The Local catering is exceptional and far exceeded our expectations with everything.  They provided a "one stop" coordinated experience that included set-up, coordination with the rental company MS Events, take down, and clean up. The appetizers and dinner were exceptional. ALL staff members were professional and amazing at anticipating every need of our guests.  Eleanore was our coordinator and words cannot adequately express our gratitude to her.  She was professional, kind, patient and on top of or ahead of every little detail.  She carried herself with a confidence and grace that transcended out providing an unexplainable calmness to the bride, her wedding party and family. If you are waffling at all on a caterer or coordinator, you should definitely choose The Local and request Eleanore as your coordinator.  They are both "worth their weight in gold".',5,'2023-10-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aaf9cf7b-ab33-403e-b30f-75356492e874','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNabC1EUGNnEAE','google','We are so happy we selected The Local to cater our small wedding. We knew it came highly recommended, but were still not sure what to expect. Helen was our main contact, and she was amazing! Their email system was a little tricky, but Helen stayed on top of everything and was super organized. On our wedding day, the catering staff was also great! Most importantly, the food was incredible. (Multiple guests said it was the best wedding food they''d had!) We appreciated that they boxed up a couple extra meals for us, too. Lastly, their team cleaned up really well. All in all, would absolutely recommend!',5,'2023-09-19','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b3d6a1b9-4ee4-46a6-8fe2-9a05cc504696','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNadTgyNXVBRRAB','google','I would 1000% book the local and Eleanore again!!!!! Don’t pay any mind to the negative, fake review from my estranged aunt lol!<br>2023 bride here!! :) For reference, I am the bride that the negative comment below mentioned and I just have to set the record straight! I used Eleanore for coordination and the Local for catering for my wedding and I just want to say that Eleanore and her team were absolutely INCREDIBLE and made our special day run SMOOTHLY and BEAUTIFULLY. Not only is she is an absolute JOY and an overall INCREDIBLE HUMAN BEING, but she is so good at what she does! She is PROFESSIONAL and poised and has an eye for both the small and big details. She made mine and my husbands ideas come to light and honored our wishes for our wedding. She came to the rentals meeting and saved us money with her input. She set up the decorations for our day and was so attentive to detail- see the photos below!!🤍 She is so thoughtful and intentional and I truly would’ve been lost without this woman. Words cannot express our gratitude to Eleanore and her incredible team!! The food was amazing- guests were raving especially about the steak and peppercorn sauce!!! Please book these wonderful people! Couldn’t imagine our wedding day without them!!!!<br><br>Benjamin and Gabriella Seal',5,'2023-09-19','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5df09a89-4d12-4112-b936-65693643ce11','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaN3V2ZzNBRRAB','google','We went to the local and the vibe / decorations was very very nice !<br>The food was good and a + for the dessert (the brownie was aswome)<br>We just wait kind of a long time after we finish our main course',4,'2023-09-11','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('adfdfe6a-3e9a-4a49-a664-22f205875336','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwMzd6Mjl3RRAB','google','I recently attended a wedding that this company catered at The Barn at Edgewood. The food was mediocre but the staff was wonderful EXCEPT for the wedding coordinator, Eleanore. She was rude, confrontational and absolutely shut out the parents of the bride with the planning and then day of event.  It didn''t help that the bride was a textbook version of a bridezilla!  Eleanore seemed more interested in being chummy with the bride than she was in following the parents'' wishes and it was the parents who were the ones paying! It was the parents'' names on the contract!  It''s unfortunate that one person can really make such a negative impact on a company.<br><br>Edit to reply to owner: I was very much involved with the parents in planning. You answer proves my point that you did NOT work with your clients, which were the PARENTS of this very young 21 year old bride!  The parents are the ones who paid for this event, not the bride.<br><br>For any parents who may be dealing with a younger bride, beware they can easily be influenced by those who may not share your vision, values or plans for a very expensive event!',1,'2023-09-02','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cce1f650-51cb-4885-89c2-46a39932dd3e','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4XzY2b3BBRRAB','google','WOW WOW WOW!! We cannot say enough good things about our experience with The Local. From day one they were attentive, paid attention to all the details, and helped us to navigate all things food, drink, linens, china, etc,. We secured our spot with The Local early on in our wedding planning journey and learned so much with them throughout the planning process. They helped us make decisions based on our wants and used their experience to help ensure that we got the looks and outcomes that we were hoping for! Our guests RAVED about our food and our mixed drinks(YUM!!)! We also opted for the signature cocktails during our cocktail hour and they did not disappoint! We have several friends getting married in the next year or two who have already secured their spots with The Local because of their experience with our wedding. We are so thankful for y’all and your team!!<br><3 The Hodges',5,'2023-05-30','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('690d6bfc-90b7-4d21-9eb7-d1fc72d427f6','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GeFZqTjBRbEpPY1ROaFRHRjFhSGh5WkRRdFkyYxAB','google','The restaurant was very pleasant, the design was very cohesive, and the food was a good portion for a decent price. The water wasn''t really tasty but all the food was excellent at this place was very busy on Saturday night and while it was loud it was still very enjoyable. Would recommend',5,'2026-11-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d0fcaf6f-c9d0-465b-a6f7-732be7eec1f0','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRGVtcDBlR1E1ZGtOdk4yMUVabXByVG5WcFJFRRAB','google','My favorite place to go in Charlottesville. Best to make a reservation because it does get busy.',5,'2026-10-21','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2a0e2a04-b5be-4c80-a2d5-0a1f12b8c047','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205cU9URm1aRVpwT1ZSNFQzbHdUak54VjBWSVVVRRAB','google','The meatloaf and the vegetarian shepherds pie were incredible! Service was pretty good as well. Worth checking out :)',5,'2026-10-14','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('983e8483-0eb6-4624-a249-b3a670359662','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sUVRXRmtWeTFxTFhaQldIQnlPSEJTUTNWS2JVRRAB','google','Awesome food! Chef was able to redo a dish for me to make it dairy free.',5,'2026-10-12','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('755654ac-9d8b-40fe-956d-43e322f29db2','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vd1IxVmFlRTlqY1hnMWFXTmphRGRLY1ZSTFVGRRAB','google','This was by far the best meal I''ve had in a very, very long time! Not only the aesthetic and historical significance of the location but the service was beyond the beyond!<br><br>The Bartenders were so great, made great conversation in between drink orders. The service staff was friendly and fast. I noticed that everyone was helping out, working together as a team. They got a slight pop around the middle of my visit but the Food Runner and his fellow team members never missed a beat.<br><br>The food was impeccable and exquisite. I had the bison empanadas and bison short ribs. I wanted seconds but I decided to wait until I visit next time.<br><br>Definitely give this fabulous establishment a visit!',5,'2026-10-03','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bd5ac082-c2ef-4ed4-a870-0a00276289a5','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGS01UTm9UMmhaVDJGQ2F6ZzBOWEZRTTA1U1ExRRAB','google','Fabulous meal and dining experience at The Local this evening. This was our first visit and we’re already planning our next. We both agreed this is the best meal we''ve had in years! The meatloaf was so delicious and so were the ribs. Several great dishes on the menu we look forward to on future visits. 5 plus stars for presentation, flavor and value. Service was great and we enjoyed the overall relaxed cozy vibe.',5,'2026-09-03','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9f414ea1-9cac-4758-999d-4a3ea1d77c1c','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wWFZXazBjR2hSVEVOTmNIUmFYMVE0UjNJMWRuYxAB','google','I suspect that most of the time, people have a better experience here that we did.  Maybe the Monday crew was just not on their A game when we went for our anniversary; a lot of small things added up to not a great experience.  No spoon being provided with the soup, few servers checking in upstairs to bring water (or spoons), an overcooked medium rare state (barely pink in the middle), and fruit cobblers for desert that were barely warmed up.  I definitely won''t be headed back.',2,'2026-09-02','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('04ee31af-a104-48e2-8f75-2b7d37e9b25a','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4M1lqWTNXVEExT0ZsMGRVcHVUaTFVT0U1RE5VRRAB','google','Amazing wine, food, and service. Manndî was amazing at the bar and the food was epic! Half price bottles Monday''s.',5,'2026-09-01','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c62d7ebe-bb42-4c18-8cc9-1bccdd3a53a5','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkMVQzb3lZbEJXZUdsRVREWnVUemt3ZEVaQ1NXYxAB','google','Very good! Reasonable prices and very nice atmosphere. Highly recommend.',5,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6eb6fe6e-2784-4aa4-a26d-5144c44a0d25','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wZmFsaE9NbU5uVkVaWlVIRlpOVEJtZWxGalMzYxAB','google','The food is fine, nothing write home about though...',3,'2026-08-22','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8b10c51d-6640-4a35-8adf-4b6081ac4cb1','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SYWFUWjNUV3BmTW1kTFFtbFBaVFpwVWpsUFIxRRAB','google','Great little place in C-Ville. The food is terrific, you can’t go wrong with anything on the menu. We had the cheese board and cauliflower/Brussel sprout appetizer. The appetizer was really good, strongly recommend. The mushroom pasta and the fried chicken breast were well cooked. A ton of mushrooms in the pasta. Very good wine list thats not overpriced or overwhelming.<br>Very worth the visit.<br>Went back this weekend and had a terrible experience at the bar. The waiter at the bar told us that the Chef requires the food order to be put in all at once (app & entree’s). So we did, and advised the waiter that we wanted time to finish our drinks before the entree come out. He said no problem, I decide when your entree actually gets “fired” in the kitchen. 3 minutes after we finished our app, the main course came out. I brought it to the waiter’s attention, reminding him of our request. He laughed and said oh, I’m sorry. The bison rib was okay, but the two large pearl like onions were so raw I couldn’t stab them with my fork to cut them. Wife had the meatloaf. It was very dry. Not sure how long it has been setting out, but it was way below the expectations from the waiter, who said it’s the most popular thing on the menu.<br>My wife and I have been here several times. Never had this kind of experience. Very disappointing',4,'2026-08-09','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0d22f424-4ac7-442b-ae40-508ed4c21e98','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGaFNUQm1SVzk0VFVKMmNXNDNka0V5UVdvMk9HYxAB','google','A few dishes worth trying. Hard to get past the buzzing sound in the upstairs deck. Bit of slow service on Saturday night, but decent cocktails and pasta dishes.',3,'2026-08-09','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('66432ec2-e0b0-4ae8-8482-68fc57282877','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWUldYZGFSaTFrVDB4eGRuQmxWVEJUWjFSdlQzYxAB','google','Excellent friendly service and delicious food. Downstairs is beautiful but upstairs is less refined and a bit hot at 87 degrees outside. The local cheese board with local wine is just perfect and a good value. Highly recommend.',5,'2026-08-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d8801b59-7a2f-4f9b-9018-44ab50007774','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGeU5WWjRNbTFIVlhCVWIxb3lORFl6Um5KekxWRRAB','google','Good food and great service.',4,'2026-08-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c236644b-5cf6-4e1c-9989-ec34a2ef1e81','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWc1YwSXpZMWc1Y1hGV2EzUnNZV0V0VW5wdmJGRRAB','google','Perfect space for a large rehearsal dinner—with a stellar day-of team!<br><br>We hosted an 80-person rehearsal dinner at The Local, and we are so glad we found this venue! The layout was fantastic—plenty of space for a seated or buffet dinner, plus a great area near the bar for guests to mix and mingle.<br><br>While the food individually felt a bit overpriced, the overall value was definitely there when you factor in the space, microphone access, passed appetizers, incredible service, and the flexibility of a pay-by-consumption bar.<br><br>The planning process required a little patience, as the event coordinator isn''t super responsive over email and prefers phone calls. However, once you talk, they provide a very detailed PDF and event plan to keep everything on track.<br><br>Most importantly, the day-of execution was flawless. The waitstaff was awesome, and Ryan was truly the best! He was incredibly attentive, kind, and made sure everything ran smoothly. Highly recommend for large group events!',5,'2026-07-29','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bab594d0-d7db-414e-ac14-e7bdcc015f11','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201WE1sVkdjbTFWY1dOMllXVjNlR0ZpTmkxQ0xYYxAB','google','The food was good.  I chosen the meatloaf which was tasty and moist.  Wine selection was pretty big but plenty from local winery around Cville.  Luckily we were there for chatting and taking it slow, the server didn''t come by for awhile, which was fine for this particular night.',4,'2026-07-22','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1b4b2d5e-0f07-4d37-9294-609488e3dbad','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sUlMxOUpSR1ZOV0RsbFRXSlJPRVYzVUZKUldIYxAB','google','The Brussels and cauli appetizer was amazing, and the smash burger was especially to die for. Make sure to park in a surrounding block to avoid the outrageous fees that are set by the surrounding business.',5,'2026-07-13','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3f19e488-f76e-4041-ab6d-1bcbb30a14c6','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xabE0xZEpiMWswU0cxVlkyWnJNMk41WlRoUU9VRRAB','google','We had a fantastic experience. Ollie was our server and the food, service, atmosphere, and accommodations were all phenomenal. Our group had the meatloaf, short rib, gnocchi, a few cocktails and a sampling of desserts and they were all delicious. Highly recommend!!',5,'2026-07-12','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('19b84ae7-5c89-4c50-89cc-c1ca8a9f2b86','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OT1pFazJTRVpGT1VwQ2VubEZkakJXTFhNd2NGRRAB','google','Food was overly salty.',3,'2026-07-10','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8a7d8f3c-f776-4d7e-8dd7-4c7906fa43f7','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xObU1FSXlPVGRNVFdGcWJFczRRMkowUW5sWGFVRRAB','google','Generous portions, creative menu, excellent service and nice ambiance with quiet music playing upstairs.',5,'2026-07-09','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('281c4432-4223-4ae9-ac72-ce271da4cb16','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOemMyMHlRamRIVHpnMlVuRndURVJLTlZVM1dHYxAB','google','Unfortunately I wasn’t able to review this restaurant because open table messed up my reservation. when I arrived they couldn’t accommodate our party of four despite many open tables, They said they didn’t have enough food. which I found out later was probably a lie because they had reservations for later times . The hostess could have at least offered to accommodate us at a different time',2,'2026-07-03','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2e2ec118-eb9c-4e6b-8251-5f88e1930057','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SUVlUVlVWUzE1UWxGR2FuWjNhMDVzUjBGQmNXYxAB','google','The food was absolutely incredible, delicious and well priced. They had a wide variety of options. The staff were all so nice! Shoutout to Ashlyn thank you for everything! Definitely recommend it if you’re in town :)',5,'2026-07-03','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e0ae4f7e-aaa4-4e81-9a88-ab7e81855b03','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poSGJXSlVhR1JEUlRseE5XbElUMGcxWDBRdFdHYxAB','google','Fantástico! Muy contenta de haber elegido ese restaurante y conocer la gastronomía!',5,'2026-06-27','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('38522fcd-d266-427a-b3ae-2e86b9bb6daf','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4NVh6SkNkMFYxTUV3d1dXdFphRE5hZWpaRFQyYxAB','google','They got what you need',5,'2026-06-22','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f3b46405-59e9-4afb-a4c9-8f0c59b322af','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tRNU5YWm9WMGhTV1dRMlRFODNNVGxVUTNoeWNWRRAB','google','We had a large group from UVA and Seth took care us. He provided top tier service!',5,'2026-06-10','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4e0cdfd0-1602-474d-9f4f-37cc97ee2b4e','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxMVdFaFNTMFl3VkVaS1pEaFdTV3BGYkdoYVlXYxAB','google','Used The Local to cater our wedding and got almost as bad of an experience as possible. The food we ordered was not what was served, the potatoes meant to be a side were burnt, they blatantly disregarded dietary restrictions of guests which were laid out in detail, and we were ghosted on our email correspondence with their Director of Operations. We were so excited based off our tasting only to be treated terribly on our wedding day. Never use them to cater a single event.',1,'2026-06-02','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b6f0cca9-703a-4311-97d1-786088f48ede','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwN0piS1dREAE','google','Great service. Food is good, fine for the cost.',4,'2026-06-01','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b7b590a0-32e0-4279-bc76-87238ddfd7df','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxbWJXMVBiRXBKWDBnMVNWSnBNbGRJVlVrNGNXYxAB','google','Excelente lugar para cenar y tomar una buena cerveza y vino',5,'2026-05-28','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('83ffcf19-7bd7-4060-9956-1f142267087d','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oVGRtZENaV1p6VlhRMFRsQlFVVmg1VFVJMVRuYxAB','google','We loved this farm-to-table restaurant!  They served one of the best burgers I''ve ever had and the meatloaf was amazing.  I wish we would taken a picture of our food; the portion and presentation were excellent.  Highly recommended, but maybe not so much as we  don''t want it to become too popular or more expensive.  Right now it is fantastic value.',5,'2026-05-12','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('867a946c-46ef-44fb-bc3c-2e11d3cf05f4','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SWWNrdG9TV3R3UkY5aFdURm1jMVppTTE5ZlEwRRAB','google','Food is great and reasonable.',5,'2026-05-10','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9d9deedf-eee4-4348-b9e8-c2187062ac33','ffea1e0a-6334-4695-ad19-1750033ba9b8','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwUlMwVTJPR05SU25Gbk5YRmZTR1UxTW13eE9HYxAB','google','GREAT SERVICE -<br><br>We had a reservation for a party of six at 7:45. Arrived on time - no seating except at the bar and the reserved table had received their food just 20 minutes ago. We left and walked across the street to Mockingbird. They moved tables around to accommodate our party of six with no reservation.<br><br>However, then the manager of Local came over and apologized. He even gave us a gift card. Owning an error shows incredible customer service. I''ve adjusted the stars to reflect this. I would highly recommend both restaurants.',5,'2026-05-08','2026-11-12T15:59:23.466Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a1a4119c-aac7-4a11-ad06-6df11c436fde','21a8dfdb-7be5-4792-8896-53e5be7ef783','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25BemNpMW1jSFpNZEdwMmNqWmZSRGRrTWxwTFUxRRAB','google','All foods are frozen readt-to-eat. No food is being making in restaurants. It does not taste good. The waiter was awesome.',2,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T15:59:24.871Z');
