INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('80796dfd-01c7-4900-b2c6-0c42265cfe98','772e303b-6822-486b-baae-fdbf7539e71d','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SSVNWbzFPRzgzVDBaTlExQmhOR2R0WVdaT1VWRRAB','google','Need a table and also a high chair which caused about a ten minute wait when there was no wait rime. Then another discussion at the table area when they went to seat is. Server  was great. Checked on is several times and refilled rolls and drinks. I would recommend not using the restroom. That''s all I will say about that.The food came out fast and hot and cooled as desired. The server stations are an area to watch out for. I was walked into by a server and got an over the shoulder excuse me as they continued on in the middle of our group leaving. Couple small issue but would nothing that would stop me from going again.',4,'2026-10-29','2026-11-12T16:01:11.404Z');
